2 CONT http://www.venitap.com/Genealogy/WebCards/ps39/ps39_076.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT NameLady Gwladus fch GRUFFUDD Of Wales , F Birth Dateabt 1225 Birth PlaceGwynedd, Wales Death Date1261 FatherGruffydd ap LLYWELYN FAWR , M (~1198-1244) MotherLady Senana fch CARADOC Of Anglesey , F Spouses 1Rhys FYCHAN Of Ystrad T
2 CONC ywi , M Death Date1271
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Lady Gwladus fch GRUFFUDD Of Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT Dafydd's parents were Gruffudd ap Llywelyn ab Iorwerth (died 1244) and his wife Senana.
2 CONT
2 CONT Brothers:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Owain Goch ap Gruffydd (died c. 1282)
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Llywelyn ap Gruffudd, Prince of Wales (killed at Battle of Orewin Bridge at Builth Wells, 11 December 1282) married Eleanor de Montfort, daughter of Simon de Montfort, Earl of Leicester. They had one daughter, Gwenllian. Eleano
2 CONC r died in childbirth at Llywelyn's court at Abergwyngregyn on 19 June 1282.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Rhodri ap Gruffudd (died c. 1315) married 1) Beatrice, daughter of David of Malpas. 2) unknown. He had a son Thomas ap Rhodri (died 1363) by his second marriage, who was the father of Owain ap Thomas (died 1378).
2 CONT
2 CONT Sisters 1. Gwladus ferch Gruffudd (died 1261) married Rhys Fychan (died 1271) of Ystrad Tywi.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Margaret ferch Gruffudd married Madog II ap Gruffydd, Lord of Dinas Bran (died 1277) of Powys Fadog. They had two sons, Gruffudd ap Madog and Llywelyn ap Madog. The two boys died in mysterious circumstances shortly after the ou
2 CONC tbreak of war in 1282.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Wikipedia: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dafydd_ap_Gruffydd
