2 CONT *1. Prince of Wales Llewelyn ap Gruffydd
2 CONT
2 CONT Llewelyn was born in 1228 in Nefyn, North Wales.2   He died as a war casualty, Battle of Builty, at the age of 54 on December 11th, 1282 in Builty, Wales.2 
