2 CONT Susanna was the 2nd wife of Madog ab Maredudd, Brenin of Povys. Source- Griffith-Pedigrees of Anglesey and Caernarvan,Page 331
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT * Daughter of Gruffydd ap Cynan
2 CONT * Wife of Madoc (Madog, Madwg) ap Maredudd
2 CONT
2 CONT Welsh wives *'''did not'''* take their husbands' patronymics. It was not until the Welsh started using regular surnames (c. 16th century with isolated earlier examples) that women started taking their husbands' last names.
2 CONT
