2 CONC  and one who married Maredudd Gethin.  The latter is usually called "Gwenllian Fychan", but it is possible these were two marriages by the same lady.  Widowed young with small children, a single Gwenllian might have been matched w
2 CONC ith a young Gwent nobleman soon after the death of Maredudd Gethin. But if these were two different ladies, we have no idea who the widowed Gwenllian took as her second husband." (Steven Ferry, September 17, 2020.)
