2 CONT '''Our Royal, Noble, Titled and Commoner Ancestors and Cousins [https://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p136.htm#i4063 Isabel Mauduit]'''1,2,3,4
2 CONT >Isabel Mauduit was born at Hanslape, Buckinghamshire, England. She married Sir William de Beauchamp, Earl of Warwick, 5th Baron Beauchamp, Sheriff of Worcester & Worcestershire, son of Walcheline de Beauchamp and Joane de Mortime
2 CONC r, circa 1236; They had 4 sons (William, Earl of Warwick; Sir Walter; Sir John; & James) & 6 daughters (Alice, wife of Bernard de Brus; Joan, wife of Sir Martholomew de Sudeley; Isabel; Margaret (Margery), wife of Sir Hubert Husse
2 CONC y; Sibyl; & Sarah, wife of Richard Talbot).2,3,4 Isabel Mauduit died before 30 January 1268 at England; Buried at Cokehill Nunnery, Worcestershire.4
2 CONT
