1 NOTE {geni:about_me} (1) JOAN, born at Caerphilly Castle (her father being under age), and baptized there, 24 November 1291. Richard's Castle was included in her pourparty. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, 1stly, by 12 August 1305, Thomas de Bykenore. He died s.p., circa 1316. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, 2ndly, Richard Talbot, [younger brother of Gilbert, 1st Lord Talbot] in her right, of Richard's Castle. She died before 12 January 1344.
