2 CONT
2 CONT 7. Unknown. [Note: Possibly Susanna ferch Gruffudd ap Cynan (sister of#4), who was wife of Madog ap Maredudd, but Madog is known to have hadchildren by other women also, and Bartrum does not list a mother forMargred in his charts 
2 CONC in BWG, indicating that the early sources do notidentify Margred's mother. PF, vol. 1, pp. 119-124 states that Margred(Margaret) was daughter of Madog by Susanna, but this source also givesMadog a chronologically impossible second
2 CONC  wife Maude who md. 2nd, JohnFitz Alan, d. 1268, earl of Arundel, who lived a hundred years later, andPF cannot be considered reliable on this matter.]
