2 CONC t of Gwladus (#5). In addition, the sources given byBartrum for Dyddgu's alleged father Iorwerth ap Cadwgan are all late 16thcentury or later, so Iorwerth's existence is also uncertain. In myopinion, this link should be regarded a
2 CONC s dubious.]
