1 NAME William /FitzMartin/ Lord of Cemais
2 GIVN William
2 SURN FitzMartin
2 NSFX Lord of Cemais
2 _MARNM FitzMartin
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1135
2 PLAC Blagdon
2 ADDR
3 CTRY England
