2 CONT
2 CONT # Note:
2 CONT
2 CONT     [De La Pole.FTW]
2 CONT
2 CONT     Sources: Young; Kraentzler 1406, 1409; AF; A. Roots 239; History of Morgan Family.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Roots: Angharat of Tegaingl, daughter of Owain ap Edwin.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Young: Angharad II of Tegaingl.
2 CONT
2 CONT     K: Anghared verch Owain (the Golden Hair).
2 CONT
2 CONT     SOURCES:
2 CONT
2 CONT     1. Lloyd, John E., _The History of Wales, Vol. II:
2 CONT
2 CONT     P. 464: "By his wife Angharad, the flaxen-haired daughter of Owain abEdwin,
2 CONT
2 CONT     whom he married about 1095, he had three sons, Cadwallon, Owain, andCadwaladr,
2 CONT
2 CONT     and five daughters...." Footnote 7, same page, names the daughters as
2 CONT
2 CONT     Gwenllian (wife of Gruffydd ap Rhys), Marared, Rannillt (named for her paternal grandmother), Susanna(who married Madog ap Maredudd), and Annest.
2 CONT
2 CONT     P. 488: Owain Gwynedd fell into a deep melancholy when his mother died in1162.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Owain Ap Edwin b: 1044 in Llys Edwin, Llaneurguin, Flintshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Morwyl Verch Ednywain b: Abt 1044-1048 in Tegeingl, Flintshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Gruffudd ap Cyan b: 1055 in Dublin, Ireland
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Married: Abt 1095 in Wales 2
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Change Date: 21 Sep 2005
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT    1. Has Children Margred Verch Gruffudd b: Abt 1070 in Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT    2. Has Children Gruffydd ap Rhys b: Abt 1081
2 CONT
2 CONT    3. Has Children Gwenlian verch Gruffydd b: Abt 1090 in Caernarvonshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT    4. Has Children Susanna Verch Gruffydd b: Abt 1095 in Caernarvonshire, Wales c: in <Gwynedd, Wales>
2 CONT
2 CONT    5. Has No Children Cadwaladr Ap Gruffudd b: Abt 1096 in Caernarvonshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT    6. Has Children Owain Gwynedd Ap Gruffudd b: Abt 1100 in The Forgotten Monarchy of Scotland"
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT
