1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Discussion of the children of Gruffudd ap Rhys, and their various mothers, is at https://www.geni.com/discussions/206971?msg=1360216
2 CONT
2 CONT The sources are clear as to some of the children of Gruffydd ap Rhys by his wife Gwenllian ferch Gruffydd.  Before he married her, however, he had other children, by an earlier connection.  The identity of the earlier woman is unk
2 CONC nown.
2 CONT
2 CONT   Please contact the curator if you find evidence for a name for her.
2 CONT
2 CONT An earlier version of the Wikipedia entry for Gruffydd ap Rhys read:                                                
2 CONT
2 CONT Wikipedia: "Gruffydd [ap Rhys ap Tewdr] had four sons by Gwenllian ferch Gruffydd: Maredudd, Rhys, Morgan, and Maelgwn. He also had two older sons''' from a previous marriage''': Anarawd and Cadell, and at least three daughters: G
2 CONC wladus, Elizabeth, and Nest. He was followed by his eldest son, Anarawd. Of his other sons, Cadell, Maredydd, and Rhys (later known as The Lord Rhys) all ruled Deheubarth in turn."
2 CONT
2 CONT Anarawd, Cadell, Gwladus, Elizabeth and Nest would be this woman's children.
