2 CONT MAREDUDD ap Bleddyn, son of BLEDDYN ap Cynfyn King of Gwynedd and Powys & his third wife Haer of Gest (-1132).  He succeeded his father in 1075 as MAREDUDD Prince of Powys.  The Annales Cambriæ record the death in 1132 of "Maredut
2 CONC  filius Bledint dux Powisorum"[145]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT m firstly HUNYDD, daughter of EUNYDD [Efnydd] ap Gwernwy & his wife ---. 
2 CONT
2 CONT m secondly EVA, daughter of BLETRWS ap Ednowain Bendew & his wife ---. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Maredudd & his first wife had three children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.             MADOG ap Maredudd (-1161).  He succeeded his father in 1132 as Prince of Powys.  The Annales Cambriæ record the death in 1161 of "Madoc filius Maredut Powysorum princeps"[146].  m SUSANN of Gwynedd, daughter of GRUF
2 CONC FYDD ap Cynan King of Gwynedd & his wife Angharad of Deheubarth.  Madog & his wife had four children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT a)             LLYWELYN (-killed 1161).  The Annales Cambriæ record that "Lewelinus filius eius [Madoc filius Maredut Powysorum princeps]" was killed in 1161[147]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT b)             GRUFFYDD "Maelor" I (-1191).  Prince of Northern Powys (Fadog). 
2 CONT
2 CONT -        see below, Part C. PRINCES of NORTHERN POWYS. 
2 CONT
2 CONT c)             MARARED .  m IORWERTH Drwyndwyn ("Flat nose") Prince of Gwynedd, son of OWAIN ap Gruffyd King of Gwynedd & his first wife Gwladus --- (-1174). 
2 CONT
2 CONT d)             GWENLLIAN .  m RHYS ap Gruffyd Prince of Deheubarth, son of GRUFFYD ap Rhys King of D|eheubarth & his wife Gwladus of Powys ([1132]-1197). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Madog had three illegitimate children by unknown mistresses:
2 CONT
2 CONT e)              OWAIN Brogyntyn .  m MARGARET, daughter of EINION ap Seisyll of Mathafarn & his wife ---. 
2 CONT
2 CONT i)               BLEDDYN . 
2 CONT
2 CONT (a)            OWAIN . 
2 CONT
2 CONT ii)              IORWERTH . 
2 CONT
2 CONT (a)            GRUFFYDD . 
2 CONT
2 CONT (b)            ELISSE . 
2 CONT
2 CONT iii)            GRUFFYDD . 
2 CONT
2 CONT (a)            DAFYDD . 
2 CONT
2 CONT f)                son . 
2 CONT
2 CONT g)              son . 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.             GRUFFYDD (-1128).  Lord of Mawddy.  The Annales Cambriæ record the death in 1128 of "Grifinus filius Meredut"[148].  m GWERFYL, daughter and heiress of GWRGENO ap Hywel Lord of Caer or Clydewen & his wife ---.  Gruf
2 CONC fydd & his wife had two children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT a)             OWAIN "Cyfelliog" ([1125]-1195).  Prince of Southern Powys 1160.  He abdicated. 
2 CONT
2 CONT -        see below, Part D. PRINCES of SOUTHERN POWYS. 
2 CONT
2 CONT b)             MEURIG . 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.             HYWEL (-1142).  The Annales Cambriæ record that "Hoelus filius Maredut filii Bledint" was killed by his own men in 1142[149]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Maredudd & his second wife had one child:
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.             IORWERTH Goch/the Red .  m MAUD, daughter of ROGER de Manley & his wife ---.  Iorwerth & his wife had one child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT a)             MADOG .  
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/WALES.htm#Madogdied1160
