2 CONT
2 CONT Madog ap Gruffydd, Prince of Powys Fadog
2 CONT
2 CONT b. circa 1151, d. circa 1236
2 CONT
2 CONT Father	Gruffydd Maelor I ap Madog, Prince of North Powys1 b. circa 1121, d. circa 1191
2 CONT
2 CONT      Also called Madog ap Gruffydd. Madog ap Gruffydd, Prince of Powys Fadog was born circa 1151. He was the son of Gruffydd Maelor I ap Madog, Prince of North Powys.1 Madog ap Gruffydd, Prince of Powys Fadog was the successor of 
2 CONC Gruffydd Maelor I ap Madog, Prince of North Powys; King of North Powys.2 Prince of Powys Fadog at Wales between 1191 and 1236.2 Madog ap Gruffydd, Prince of Powys Fadog died circa 1236.
2 CONT
