2 CONT MARY Corbet .  Eyton records her parentage and marriage but does not cite the corresponding primary source[1552].  m GWENWYNWYN Prince of Southern Powys, son of OWAIN ap Gruffydd Cyfelliog & his first wife Gwenllian of Gwynnedd (-
2 CONC 1216). 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/WALES.htm#Gwenwynwyndied1216
2 CONT
2 CONT GWENWYNWYN (-1216).  He succeeded his father as Prince of Southern Powys.  He abdicated in 1215.  m MARY Corbet, daughter of ROBERT Corbet of Caus & his wife ---.  Gwenwynwyn & his wife had two children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT a)         GRUFFYDD (-[1286/87]).  m (before 1241) HAWISE, daughter of JOHN [III] le Strange of Knockin, Shropshire & his wife Lucy [Tresgoz] (-1310).  "Hawise" kept the manor of Stretton for "frater suus dominus Hamo Extraneus" w
2 CONC hen he left for Palestine, with the consent of "mariti sui…domini Griffini", by charter dated to [1270], witnessed by "Dominis Rogero Extraneo, Roberto fratre suo"[696].  Gruffydd & his wife had seven children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT i)          OWEN de la Pole (-1293).  m as her first husband, JOHANNA Corbet, daughter of Sir ROBERT Corbet & his wife ---.  Owen & his wife had two children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT (a)       HAWISE Gadam/the Hardy (1290-).  m (1309) JOHN Cherleton [Charlton] (-before 1353).  Lord of Powys, de iure uxoris. 
2 CONT
2 CONT (b)       GRUFFYDD (1291-1309).  m as her first wife, ELA de Audley, daughter of NICHOLAS de Audley & his wife Catherine Giffard.  She married secondly Sir James de Perrers, and thirdly Piers Corbet. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ii)         5 sons. 
2 CONT
2 CONT iii)        MABEL .  m FULK FitzWarin [V], son of FULK FitzWarin [IV] & his wife Constance --- (-Dec 1314). 
2 CONT
2 CONT b)         MADOG . 
2 CONT
