2 CONT
2 CONT ---------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Ednyfed Fychan and Gwenllian ferch Rhys were parents to Goronwy, Lord of Tref-gastell (d. 1268). Goronwy was later married to Morfydd ferch Meurig, daughter to Meurig of Gwent. (Meurig was son of Ithel, grandson of Rhydd and great
2 CONC -grandson to Iestyn ap Gwrgant. Iestyn had been the last King of Gwent (reigned 1081 - 1091) before its conquest by the Normans.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Goronwy and Morfydd were parents to Tudur Hen, Lord of Penmynydd (d. 1311); 
