2 CONT http://www.geneajourney.com/talbot.html
2 CONT
2 CONT albot of Herefordshire and Cornwall, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Hugh Talbot b abt 1105, of Shrewsbury, Shropshire, England. He md Beatrice de Mandeville abt 1125, daughter of William de Mandeville and Margaret.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Hugh Talbot and Beatrix de Mandeville was:
2 CONT '''Richard Talbot b abt 1127, of Linton, Herefordshire, England, d 1174/75'''. He md Daughter de Bulmer abt 1148, daughter of Stephen de Bulmer. She was b abt 1134, of Appletreewick, Yorkshire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Richard Talbot and Daughter de Bulmer was:
2 CONT
2 CONT Gilbert Talbot b abt 1155, of Hereford, Herefordshire, England, d bef 15 Feb 1230. Wife unknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Gilbert Talbot was:
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard Talbot b abt 1186, of Herefordshire, England, d aft 1231. He md Aline/Aliva Basset abt 1220, daughter of Alan Basset and Aline de Gay.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Richard Talbot and Aline Basset was:
2 CONT
2 CONT Gilbert Talbot b abt 1224, Herefordshire, England, d 8 Sep 1274. He md Gwenthlian verch Rhys abt 1246, daughter of Rhys-Mechyll ap Rhys, Lord of Dynevor. She was b abt 1232, Dynevor, Carmarthenshire, Wales.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Gilbert Talbot and Gwenthlian verch Rhys was:
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard Talbot, Governor of Cardiff, b 1250, Herefordshire, England, d 3 Sep 1306, Eccleswall, Herefordshire, England. He md Sarah de Beauchamp aft 7 Jan 1267/68, daughter of Sir William de Beauchamp, Lord of Elmley Castle, and Is
2 CONC abel Mauduit. Child of Richard Talbot and Sarah de Beauchamp was:
2 CONT
2 CONT Gilbert Talbot b 18 Oct 1276, Wyke, Cornwall, England, d bef 24 Feb 1345/46, Eccleswall, Herefordshire, England. He md Anne/Ankaret le Botiler abt 1300, daughter of William le Botiler and Angharad verch Gruffydd. Children of Gilbe
2 CONC rt Talbot and Anne le Botiler were: Sir Richard Talbot b abt 1302. Philippa Talbot b abt 1305; md Sir Philip de Clanvowe. Sir Richard Talbot b abt 1302, Wyke, Cornwall, England, d 23 Oct 1356. He md Elizabeth Comyn abt 1325, daugh
2 CONC ter of Sir John Comyn, Lord of Badenoch, and Joan de Valence. Child of Sir Richard Talbot and Elizabeth Comyn was: Sir Gilbert Talbot b abt 1332, Herefordshire, England, d 24 Apr 1387, Roales, Spain. He md Petronella Butler bef 8 
2 CONC Sep 1352, daughter of Sir James Butler, Earl of Ormonde, and Eleanor de Bohun. Children of Gilbert Talbot and Petronella Butler were: Elizabeth Talbot b abt 1354, of Herefordshire, England, d 10 Jan 1400/01; md Henry de Grey bef 1
2 CONC 379. Sir Richard Talbot, Lord Talbot, b abt 1358. Sir Richard Talbot, Lord Talbot, b abt 1358, Blackmere, Cornwall, England, d abt 7 Sep 1396, London, Middlesex, England. He md Ankaret le Strange bef 23 Aug 1383, daughter of Sir J
2 CONC ohn le Strange, Lord of Blackmere, and Isabel/Mary Fitzalan. Children of Richard Talbot and Ankaret le Strange were: Mary Talbot b abt 1382, d 13 Apr 1433, Hertfordshire, England. She md Sir Thomas Greene, Knight, abt 1397, son of
2 CONC  Sir Thomas Greene and Margery Mablethorpe. Sir Gilbert Talbot, Lord Talbot, b 1383, d 19 Oct 1418, Rouen, France; md Joan Plantagenet abt 20 May 1392. Richard Talbot, Archbishop of Dublin, b abt 1385, d 15 Aug 1449. Anne Talbot b
2 CONC  abt 1387, d 16 Jan 1439/40; md Hugh de Courtenay, Earl of Devon. Sir John Talbot, Earl of Shrewsbury, b 1390, of Shropshire, England, d 17 Jul 1453, Chastillon, France; md Margaret de Beauchamp abt 1414. SOURCES: CP: Vol XII/1[60
2 CONC 6-617]; AR: Line 8[33], Line 84A[29-31], Line 95[31-32].
2 CONT www.findagrave.com
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard Talbot
2 CONT Birth 1120
2 CONT Linton, Herefordshire Unitary Authority, Herefordshire, England
2 CONT Death 14 Dec 1185 (aged 64–65)
2 CONT Darmstadt, Stadtkreis Darmstadt, Hessen, Germany
2 CONT Burial
2 CONT Burial Details Unknown
2 CONT Memorial ID 86598935
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard was the son of Hugh Talbot born about 1085 and Beatrix De Mandeville born 1105 and died April 19, 1197. He married a Miss Bulmer who was born about 1125.
2 CONT Family Members
