2 CONT ** '''Children:'''
2 CONT ***  Maud de Beauchamp Say (____ - 1369)*
2 CONT ***  Thomas De Beauchamp (1313 - 1369)*
2 CONT ***  John Beauchamp (1316 - 1360)*
2 CONT ** '''Sibling:'''
2 CONT ***  Isabel De Beauchamp Despencer (1256 - 1306)*
2 CONT ***  Guy de Beauchamp (1271 - 1315)
2 CONT * '''Burial:'''  Bordesley Abbey, Redditch, Redditch Borough, Worcestershire, England
