1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Sir Giles de Beauchamp, Sheriff of Caernarvon, Keeper of Droslan, Scarborough, & Denbigh Castles1,2,3,4,5,6
2 CONT *'''M, #15666, b. circa 1290, d. 12 October 1361
2 CONT *Father      Sir Walter de Beauchamp, Constable of Gloucester Castle7,8,9,10 b. b 1242, d. 16 Feb 1303
