2 CONT *'''     Sir Giles de Beauchamp, Sheriff of Caernarvon, Keeper of Droslan, Scarborough, & Denbigh Castles was born circa 1290 at of Alcester, Warwickshire, England; Also of Acton Beauchamp, Worcestershire; Kemerton, Gloucestershir
2 CONC e; & Freshwater, Hampshire.7,2 He married Katherine de Bures, daughter of Sir John de Bures and Hawise de Muscegros, before 21 May 1329; They had 2 sons (Sir John; & Walter).2,3,4,5,6 Sir Giles de Beauchamp, Sheriff of Caernarvon,
2 CONC  Keeper of Droslan, Scarborough, & Denbigh Castles died on 12 October 1361 at of Boddington & Longford, Gloucestershire, England.4,6
2 CONT *'''Family      Katherine de Bures b. c 1316, d. a Oct 1355
