2 CONC rriage. They had 3 sons (Sir John, 2nd Lord Lisle of Rougemont; Robert; & Thomas) and 4 daughters (Alice, wife of Sir Thomas de Seymour; Elizabeth, wife of Sir Edmund Peverel; Audrey, a nun; & Aubrey, a nun).2,3,4,5,6,7 Margaret d
