1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  WILLIAM25 LE BLOUNT, [SIR KNIGHT] (Robert24, Stephen23, Gilbert or Hubert22, William21, Gilbert20, Robert19, Rodolphus of GUISNES18, Ardolphus17, Sigefrede the Dane16, son15, Harold V14, Gormon ANGLE13, Frotho12, 
2 CONC Cnute "the Little"11, Eric "the Usurper"10, Eric "the Bern"9, Siward "the Snake-Eyed"8, Ivar7, Regner6, Siward5, Hemming4, Olaus3, Gotrick2, Gormon1) of Rock, son of (32) Robert24, [B of Saxlingham and (ACP-2) Isabel (ODINSELS), w
2 CONC as born circa 1233, and died in 1316 of Timberlake. He married of Belton, Rutland, England, circa 1261, (DP-15) ISABEL DE BEAUCHAMP of Warwick, Warwickshire, England, daughter of (DP-10) William, 9th Earl of Warwick and (XZ-6) Mau
2 CONC d (FITZ JOHN), who was born circa 1236, and died circa 30 May 1306 of Elmley Castle. [6, 1, 2]
2 CONT
2 CONT "The Ancestry of Anne Hutchinson" shows the wrong ancestry of William for 3 generations, claiming he was son of Sir William le Blount and Anne Tracy. [6]
2 CONT
