2 CONC or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume II, page 231. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT
2 CONT [S6] Cokayne, and others, The Complete Peerage, volume II, page 232.
