1 NOTE BIOGRAPHY: 1st Lord Botiller of Wem.  He succeeded both his brothers, who died without heirs.  He had livery of his brother Gawain's lands on April 8, 1296.  Having served in the wars with Scotland, he was summoned to Parliament f
2 CONC rom March 10, 1307/08 to October 10, 1325, by writs directed Willelmo le Botiller de Wemme, whereby he may be held to have become lord le Botiller.
