2 CONT **Sir Richard Talbot, 4th Lord Talbot, Baron de Blackmere+3,7,13 b. c 1361, d. 8 Sep 1396
2 CONT *'''Family 2      Joan de Stafford b. c 1339, d. c 2 Aug 1397
