1 NOTE TITLE: : Gilbert was the 3rd Baron Talbot, was summoned to Parliament 14 August, 1362, to 8 August, 1386. This nobleman served under the Black Prince, and in 1st of Richard II he was in the King's Fleet at sea, with Michael de la 
2 CONC Pole, Admiral for the North. He married Petronelle, daughter of James Butler, Earl of Ormond.
