2 CONT Gwenllian ap Llewelyn BIRTH	12 Jun 1282 Aber, Gwynedd, Wales DEATH	7 Jun 1337 (aged 54) Sempringham Fen, South Kesteven District, Lincolnshire, England BURIAL	 Sempringham Priory Sempringham Fen, South Kesteven District, Lincolnsh
2 CONC ire, England  MEMORIAL ID	140340611
2 CONT
2 CONT Princess Gwenllian, the only daughter of the last native Prince of Wales was incarcerated in the Gilbertine Priory at Sempringham for over fifty years by Edward I.
2 CONT
