1 NAME Gwenllian /verch Ednyfed Fychan/
2 GIVN Gwenllian
2 SURN verch Ednyfed Fychan
2 _MARNM verch Ednyfed Fychan
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1195
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Please see Darrell Wolcott: Einion ap Celynin of Llwydiarth; http://www.ancientwalesstudies.org/id138.html. (Steven Ferry, August 25, 2020.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Correspondence from Darrell Wolcott, Center for the Study of Ancient Wales, re: was Gwenllian married to all 3 men: "Yes, her marriage to Gwrwared ap Gwilym and to Aaron ap Rhys ap Bleddri (ap Rhys ap Bleddri ap Cadifor Fawr) are 
2 CONC both cited in Dwnn ii. 53.  Her marriage to Tegwared Baiswen base son of Llewelyn Fawr is cited in Pen 176, pages 168, 171 and 263  Her 1st husband (Gwrwared) was born c 1180, the later 2 spouses were born c. 1190.  I doubt anyone
2 CONC  knows which children of those men were by her." (Steven Ferry, September 3, 2020.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Please see Darrell Wolcott: Sir Aaron ap Rhys, Knight of the Sepulchre; http://www.ancientwalesstudies.org/id292.html. (Steven Ferry, March 15, 2022.)
