1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Darrell Wolcott indicates that Tangwystl ferch Llywarch was most likely a second wife for Ednyfed Fychan. That, and the fact that she would be around 40 when Sir Tudor was born, make it unlikely that she was Sir Tu
2 CONC dor's mother. 
2 CONT
