2 CONT >>>ii)         [https://www.geni.com/people/NN/6000000176965442821?through=6000000176965511821 daughter] (after [1182/83]-after [1194/95]).  Her existence is confirmed by the letter of Pope Innocent III dated 17 Feb 1205 (see abov
2 CONC e) which records that, after the death of Rhodri, “predictus L.” asked “a rege Manniæ juniorem filiam in conjugem”, which was refused as Llywelyn had already been betrothed to the older daughter[1311]. 
