2 CONT *[455] CP VIII 402-3. 
2 CONT *[456] Stevenson (1870), Vol. I, pp. 410 and 414. 
2 CONT *[457] Johannis de Fordun (Goodall), Vol. II, Lib. XI, Cap. XIII, p. 150. 
2 CONT *[458] Johannis de Fordun (Goodall), Vol. II, Lib. XIII, Cap. XII, p. 287. 
2 CONT *[459] Stuart (1798), p. 429. 
