2 CONT  Margaret ap Llywelyn is the daughter of Llywelyn ap Iorwerth, Prince of North Wales. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, firstly, John de Briouze, son of William de Briouze.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, secondly, Walter de Clifford, son of Walter de Clifford and Agnes de Cuni. 
2 CONT
