1 NOTE Invalid baptism temple code: LLKK.
1 NOTE Invalid baptism temple code: LLKK.
1 NOTE OR "REGINALD"; TOOK ARMS WITH THE REST OF THE BARONS AGAINST KING JOHN IN 1216,
2 CONT BUT AFTER AN OFFER BY JOHN TO RESTORE ALL HIS HEREDITARY LANDS, HE MADE HIS
2 CONT PEACE WITH THE KING, RECEIVING ON 6/23/1217 ALL HIS FATHER'S HOLDINGS; HE WAS
2 CONT LATER SUED BY HIS NEPHEW, JOHN (SON OF HIS ELDEST BROTHER WILLIAM, WHO HAD
2 CONT BEENSTARVED TO DEATH) - AFTER MUCH LITIGATION, IT WAS DETERMINED THAT JOHN
2 CONT SHOULD INHERIT ALL OF HIS GRANDFATHER'S LAND IN VARIOUS COUNTIES EXCEPT THE
2 CONT CASTLES AND LORDSHIPS OF BRECKNOCK, BLIENFYNI, HAY, ABERGAVENNY, AND RADNOR,
2 CONT WHICH WOULD BE RETAINED BY REYNOLD AND HIS HEIRS
