1 NOTE SUCCEEDED HIS ELDER BROTHER; SUPPORTED HENRY III IN THE BARONS' REBELLION AND WAS PRESENT AT THE KING'S CONFIRMATION OF THE MAGNA CARTA 1/1235/6.
