2 CONT Darrell Wolcott, Center for the Study of Ancient Wales : " Numerous modern biographies, including Wikipedia, include a statement saying "Owain probably had an elder brother called Madog, but he may have died young".  We suggest he
2 CONC  didn't "die young", but eluded the detection of modern writers by being called "Madog Fychan" in the pedigree manuscripts":
