2 CONT
2 CONT Father	Owain ap Bleddyn, Lord of Dinmael & Rug b. c 1200, d. a 1267 Mother	Gwenllian verch Madog b. c 1220
2 CONT
2 CONT      Annes verch Owain married Heilin ap Tudor, son of Tudur ap Ednyfed and Adles verch Richard. Annes verch Owain was born circa 1254 at of Dinmael, Denbighshire, Wales.
