2 CONT
2 CONT ----------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT 	Hywel ap EINION was born ABT 1281 in Parc Letis, Llangatwg Dyffry, Monmouthshire, Wales. He was the son of 2. Einion Sais ap RHYS and 3. Lucy Crest verch HOWELL. He married Letis verch CADWALADR, daughter of Cadwaladr ap GRUFFUDD
2 CONC . She was born 1285 in Parc Letis, Llangatwg Dyffry, Monmouthshire, Wales.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Ahnentafel, Generation No. 2
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.	Einion Sais ap RHYS was born ABT 1200 in Pen-Point, Breconshire, Wales, and died AFT 1271. He was the son of 4. Rys ap HYWEL and 5. Catherine verch GWYR.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.	Lucy Crest verch HOWELL was born ABT 1244 in Cilwhibalt, Modrydd, Breconshire, Wales. She was the daughter of 6. Howel ap MEREDITH and 7. Ann verch GWILYM.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Lucy Crest verch HOWELL and Einion Sais ap RHYS are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.	  i.	Hywel ap EINION was born ABT 1281 in Parc Letis, Llangatwg Dyffry, Monmouthshire, Wales. He married Letis verch CADWALADR, daughter of Cadwaladr ap GRUFFUDD. She was born 1285 in Parc Letis, Llangatwg Dyffry, Monmouthshire
2 CONC , Wales.
2 CONT
2 CONT  	  ii.	Rhys ap EINION was born ABT 1260. He married Gladys verch LLEWELYN, daughter of Llewelyn ap HYWEL. She was born ABT 1260.
2 CONT
2 CONT  	  iii.	Lleucu verch EINION was born ABT 1282 in Pen-Pont, Llansbyddyd, Breconshire, Wales. She married Reynold KEMEYS.
2 CONT
2 CONT  	  iv.	Gruffudd ap EINION was born ABT 1283 in Pen-Pont, Llansbyddyd, Breconshire, Wales.
