2 CONT
2 CONT Nicholas also married Isabel, grandaughter of Ralph FitzWilliam, daughter of Unknown and Miss FITZ WILLIAM, between 1259 and 1260 8978. (Isabel, grandaughter of Ralph FitzWilliam was born about 1235 in Brown Manor, Treborough, Wil
