2 CONT
2 CONT *Tewdwr "Mawr" ap Cadell
2 CONT
2 CONT born about 0977 Dynevor, Llandyfeisant, Carmarthenshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT died about 0997 probably in Brittany, France
2 CONT
2 CONT father:
2 CONT
2 CONT *Cadell ap Einion
2 CONT
2 CONT born about 0953 Llandilo, Carmarthenshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT died 0993 Battle of Llangwm, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT mother:
2 CONT
2 CONT *Elinor Verch Gwerystan
2 CONT
2 CONT born about Powys, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT siblings:
2 CONT
2 CONT unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT spouse:
2 CONT
2 CONT *Gwenllian verch Gwyn
2 CONT
2 CONT born about 0977 Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT children:
2 CONT
2 CONT *Rhys ap Tewdwr
2 CONT
2 CONT born about 0997 Carmarthan, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT died 1093 Brecknock, Brecon, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT biographical and/or anecdotal:
2 CONT
2 CONT notes or source:
2 CONT
2 CONT ancestry.com
2 CONT
2 CONT Tewdwr "Mawr" Ap CADELL [Parents] 1 was born about 977 in Dynevor, Llandyfeisant, Carmarthenshire, Wales. He died . He married Mrs-Tewdwr "Mawr" Ap CADELL.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs-Tewdwr "Mawr" Ap CADELL 1 was born about 977 in Brittany, France. She died . She married Tewdwr "Mawr" Ap CADELL.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT  		M	i	 Rhys Ap TEWDWR
2 CONT
2 CONT  		M	ii	 Maredudd Ap TEWDWR 1 was born about 998 in Carmarthenshire, Wales. He died .
2 CONT
2 CONT  		M	iii	 Gwyn Ap TEWDWR 1 was born about 999 in Carmarthenshire, Wales. He died .
2 CONT
2 CONT  		M	iv	 Rhydderch Ap TEWDWR 1 was born about 1000 in Derllys, Gwarthaf, Carmarthenshire, Wales. He died .
2 CONT
2 CONT  		F	v	 Nest Verch TEWDWR 1 was born about 1003 in Carmarthenshire, Wales. She died .
2 CONT
2 CONT  		F	vi	 Elen Verch TEWDWR 1 was born about 1004 in Carmarthenshire, Wales. She died .
2 CONT
