2 CONT ^ Wayne Le Cuirot's History Pages: Henry I Beauclerc (1106-1135). 
2 CONT ^ Matthew, Donald, 2005. Side 79. 
2 CONT ^ Matthew, Donald, 2005. Side 77. 
2 CONT ^ Haskins, C.H.: Studies in the History of Medieval Science, Cambridge, Mass,, 1924, sidene 327-335: ?The abacus og the exchequer?. 
2 CONT ^ Matthew, Donald, 2005. Side78. 
