2 CONT Died in 1075, assasinated at Powys Castle
2 CONT
2 CONT Bleddyn was Prince of Powys and Gwynedd from 1063 to 1075; he acknowledged the overlordship of King Edward the Confessor and later resisted William the Conqueror. He married  to Haer, daughter and heiress of Cilin ap y Blaidd Rhyd
2 CONC d, Lord of Gestyn-Efionydd. 
2 CONT
2 CONT From: http://www.robertsewell.ca/powys.html
