1 NAME Geoffrey /de Camville/
2 GIVN Geoffrey
2 SURN de Camville
2 _MARNM de Camville
1 NAME Geoffrey de Camville, 1st Baron Camville
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1238
2 ADDR
3 CITY Clifton Campville
3 STAE England
1 DEAT
2 DATE SEP 1308
2 ADDR
3 CITY Clifton Campville
3 STAE England
1 OCCU
1 TITL Sir
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Camville-25
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Geoffrey de Camville, 1st Lord Camville was born before 1239 at of Clifton-Campville, Haselor, & Stotfold, Staffordshire, England; Of age in 1260.[2]. He was the son of William de Camville d. a 1205 and his wife Lucy.  [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT He had 1 daughter (Amice, wife of Henry de Pomeroy, & of Sir William Martin, 1st Lord Martin) by his 1st wife (unnamed).
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Maud de Bryan, daughter of Sir Guy de Bryan, Governor of Carmarthen & Cardigan Castles and Eve de Tracy, circa 1268. 2nd marriage for both.[3] They had 1 son (Sir William, 2nd Lord Camville).
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Geoffrey de Camville, 1st Lord Camville married Joan after 29 September 1279.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Geoffrey de Camville, 1st Lord Camville died circa 21 September 1308 at Grindon & Bramcote in Polesworth, Warwickshire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 1 (unknown)
2 CONT
2 CONT Child
2 CONT # Amicia de Camville, wife of Henry de Pomeroy, & of Sir William Martin, 1st Lord Martin [4] b. c 1267
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 2: Maud de Bryan b. 25 Dec 1242, d. b 29 Sep 1279
2 CONT
2 CONT Child
2 CONT #-Sir William de Camville, 2nd Lord Camville[5] b. c 1268, d. c 27 Jul 1338
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 3: Joan d. a 26 Oct 1308
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family notes 
2 CONT
2 CONT Richardson is very clear that https://www.geni.com/people/Amice-de-Camville/5598160038500116336?through=6000000000424760140 was the daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Geoffrey-de-Camville-1st-Baron-Camville/600000000697117810
2 CONC 3?through=6000000000424760140 but not https://www.geni.com/people/Maud-de-Brian/6000000000424760140.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT #https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Camville-25 cites 
