2 CONT      Hawyse Le Strange was the daughter of John Le Strange, Sheriff of Salopshire and Staffordshire and Lucy de Tregoz.2 Hawyse Le Strange married Griffith ap Gwenwynwyn, Prince of Powys-Wenwynwyn, son of Gwenwynwyn ap Owen Cyfeil
2 CONC iog, Prince of Powys Cyfeiliog and Margaret Corbet of Caus.1 Family 	Griffith ap Gwenwynwyn, Prince of Powys-Wenwynwyn d. before 1218 Children	
