2 CONT Bartrum also charts this Llewelyn ap Gruffudd de la Pole ap Gwenwynwyn Cyfeiliog ap Gwenwynwyn  as the husband of Margred ferch Maredudd Goch, but that woman was married to Llewelyn ap Gruffudd ap Gwenwynwyn, and born c. 1240. in 
2 CONC a cousin line. Bartrum does not conclude that the mother of Efa ferch Llewelyn was Sibyl de Tuberville. (Steven Ferry, August 3, 2021.).)
