2 CONC fith ap Gwenwynwyn, Prince of Powys-Wenwynwyn and Hawyse Le Strange.1 Owen ap Griffith, Prince of Powys Wenwynwyn was a witness where Llywelyn ein Llyw Olaf ap Gruffydd, Tywysog Cymru defeated his brothers Owain (d.1282) and Dafyd
2 CONC d (d.1283), in battle at Bryn Derwin in 1255.4 Owen ap Griffith, Prince of Powys Wenwynwyn was born circa 1259?. He died circa 1282.4 He married Johanna Corbet, daughter of Sir Robert Corbet Knt., of Moreton Corbet and Katherine L
