2 CONT *'''     Sir Morgan ap Maredudd Descended from the Welsh lords of Caerleon. He was born circa 1250 at of Cyfoeth Meredydd, Gwynllwg, Monmouthshire, Wales, England.2 He married Crisli ferch Dafydd, daughter of Dafydd ap Meurig "Gam
2 CONC ", circa 1297 at England.2
2 CONT *'''Family      Crisli ferch Dafydd b. c 1275
2 CONT *Child
2 CONT **Angharad fil Morgan ap Meredith+ b. c 1298
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S4065] Unknown author, Wallop Family, p. 566.
2 CONT * 2.[S61] Unknown author, Family Group Sheets, Family History Archives, SLC.
