2 CONT http://www.celtic-casimir.com/webtree/19/36812.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: Abt 1317 Married: Died: Herefordshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT     Research Notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT According to later pedigrees, an English soldier named Walter Sais, settled near Tretower, moved to Bredwardine [sic] after marrying Sir Walter Bredwardine's daughter named Florence.
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Walter Seys married the only daughter and heiress of Sir Walter Bredwardine [sic] and lived at his wife's home. His son Rhosier Hen inherited and married a daughter of Sir Walter Devereaux a famous and influential family who later
2 CONC  became the earls of Essex.
2 CONT
2 CONT    Marriage Information:
2 CONT
2 CONT Walter married Florence de PEDEWARDYN, daughter of Walter de PEDEWARDYN.
2 CONT
2 CONT    Sources:
2 CONT
2 CONT Burke, J, ed. (1847). The Patrician 3. London: E. Churton. p. 428; Oxford Biographical Dictionary
2 CONT --------------------
