1 NOTE {geni:about_me} NOT the illegitimate son of Dafydd ap Gruffydd, the last independent prince of Wales (till his execution in 12 83).  Edward I took great care to make sure that Dafydd ap Gruffydd had no heirs, legitimate or otherwi
2 CONC se; the connection of this Dafydd Goch to the Prince of Wales was invented by later genealogists; there is no contemporary evidence to the connection.
2 CONT
2 CONT This particular Dafydd Goch comes from a line of men with much the same names, in the same order, but is ultimately descended from Nefydd Hardd.
2 CONT
2 CONT See Darrell Wolcott, http://www.ancientwalesstudies.org/id116.html -- for the untangling of this line. (January 10, 2016; Anne Brannen, curator)
2 CONT
