1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.celtic-casimir.com/webtree/8/30175.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: Abt 1112, Hook Norton, Oxfordshire, England 803
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: After 1113, Hook Norton, Oxfordshire, England 1524,2646
2 CONT
