2 CONT *  "Royal Ancestry" D. Richardson Vol. II. page 314 lists “Egeline” as daughter of Reynold l & his 1st wife but doesn’t mention a husband.
2 CONT * https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/chamsensjoi.htm#Williamdied1214 shows as daughter of the 2nd Renaud & his second wife .
