2 CONT *born 1158 Heddington, Oxfordshire, England (probably incorrect as a birth place, given that her parents were from elsewhere, and that she married a gentleman who became Lord Headington, but probably correct as a death location - 
2 CONC primary sourcing would be helpful here).
