2 CONC 17, 2968]
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Amabel, who acted as keeper of the person of King Stephen, was approached directly by Queen Matilda for the transfer and exchange of their two husbands without consenting the Empress. The war dragged on for several more years
2 CONC . [The Conquering Family, p. 18] 
