2 CONC Robert b: 1120 in Gloucestershire, England 5. Philip De Gai FitzRobert b: 1122 in Gloucestershire, England 6. Robert Castellan b: ABT 1120 in Gloucestershire, England 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Mabel FITZHAMON was born, the daughter of Sybil and Robert. She had two sons and three daughters with Robert de Caen, 1st Earl of Gloucester FITZROY. She died in 1157.
