2 CONC sa Gloecestræ"[1377].  m ([1150]) '''WILLIAM FitzRobert Earl of Gloucester''', son of ROBERT Fitzroy Earl of Gloucester & his wife Mabel [Matilda or Sibylle] FitzRobert (23 Nov [1112]-23 Nov 1183, bur Keynsham Abbey, Somerset),  
