2 CONT
2 CONT      Mabile de Beaumont was the daughter of Robert de Beaumont, Comte de Meulan and Maud de Dunstanville. She died after 1 May 1204.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Mabile de Beaumont and William de Reviers, 5th Earl of Devon
2 CONT
