2 CONC f England, Keeper of the Tower of London, Constable of Colchester, Corfe, Devizes, hadleigh, Oxford, & Sherborne Castles and Hawise de Lovaine, circa 1260.2,3,4,14,7,8,9 Sir Hugh le Despenser, 1st Lord Despenser, Justiciar of Engl
2 CONC and died on 4 August 1265 at Evesham, Worcestershire, England.2
