2 CONT
2 CONT Eleanor le Despencer was the daughter of Sir Hugh le Despenser, 1st Lord Despenser and Aliva Basset.1 She married Sir Hugh de Courtenay, son of John de Courtenay and Lady Isabel de Vere.1 She died on 30 September 1328.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Eleanor le Despencer and Sir Hugh de Courtenay
2 CONT
2 CONT Hugh de Courtenay, 1st Earl of Devon+1 b. c 1276, d. 23 Dec 1340
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Citation:''' Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 1, page 1122. Hereinafter cited as Bu
2 CONC rke's Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Sir Hugh le Despenser and Aline Basset were: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Eleanor le Despenser b abt 1252, Ryhall, Rutlandshire, England, d 30 Sep 1328, London, Middlesex, England. She md Sir Hugh de Courtenay, Knight, abt 1265, son of John de Courtenay and Isabel de Vere. 
2 CONT
