2 CONT Mother: Aline Basset b: 1241
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Hugh de Courtenay b: BET 1248 AND 1250
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT Hugh de Courtenay b: 14 SEP 1275 in Okehampton, Devonshire, England
2 CONT Isabel de Courtenay b: 1283
