2 CONT Pedigree for Susan Drake
2 CONT
2 CONT Compressed Pedigree for Raymond John Newcombe to his 79th great-grandparents Adam and Eve
2 CONT
2 CONT Eleanor Despenser was the daughter of Hugh Despenser Justicar of England. Eleanor Despenser married Hugh Courtenay, son of John Courtenay and Isabel Vere.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Eleanor Despenser and Hugh Courtenay:
2 CONT Hugh Courtenay Earl of Devon+   b. c 1276, d. 23 Dec 1340 
