1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Please see Dwnn i, 307, in which he says that the mother of Alson ferch Cynfelyn was Julian Mortimer. That would put Julian's birth at c.1155/60, so she does not fit as a daughter to Rodger de Mortimer, but she wou
2 CONC ld fit as a sister. Neither the Wikipedia article (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roger_Mortimer_of_Wigmore) nor Stirnet (paywall- https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/mm4fz/mortimer01.php0 have her charted) (Steven Ferry, Au
2 CONC gust 21, 2025.)
