2 CONT      Waleran de Newburgh, 4th Earl of Warwick was the son of Roger de Newburgh, 2nd Earl of Warwick and Gundred de Warenne.1 He married, secondly, Alice de Harcourt, daughter of John de Harcourt.1 He married, firstly, Margery de B
2 CONC ohun, daughter of Humphrey de Bohun and Margaret of Gloucester. He died in 1205.1
2 CONT      Waleran de Newburgh, 4th Earl of Warwick gained the title of 4th Earl of Warwick. Child of Waleran de Newburgh, 4th Earl of Warwick and Alice de Harcourt Alice de Newburgh+1
