2 CONT Margaret LE DESPENSER  	
2 CONT Born: Abt 1292, Barton, Gloucester, Gloucestershire, England  Married: After Dec 1313 
2 CONT
2 CONT General Notes: He [John de St. Amand] married, in or after December 1313, Margaret, daughter of Hugh LE DESPENSER, afterwards EARL OF WINCHESTER, by Isabel, widow of Sir PATRICK DE CHAURCES, and daughter of William (DE BEAUCHAMP),
2 CONC  EARL OF WARWICK, by Maud, sister and coheir of Sir Richard FITZJOHN [LORD FITZJOHN], and 1st daughter of Sir John FITZGEOFFREY. He died shortly before 15 January 1329/30 (f). [Complete Peerage XI:298-9, (transcribed by Dave Utzin
2 CONC ger)] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Information: Margaret married Sir John DE ST. AMAND 2nd Baron de St. Amand of Woodhay, son of Amauri DE ST. AMAND of Grendon Underwood and Isabel, after Dec 1313. (Sir John DE ST. AMAND 2nd Baron de St. Amand of Woodhay w
2 CONC as born before 1283 in Bloxham, Banbury, Oxfordshire, England and died before 15 Jan 1329-1330 in West Woodhay, Hungerford, Berkshire, England.)
