1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Isabel, daughter of Hugh Le Despencer, Earl of Winchester,  by Isabel, daughter of William de Beauchamp, Earl of Warwick.  Granddaughter of Sir Hugh le Despenser and Alivia Basset, William Beauchamp and Maud FitzJo
