2 CONT Wife of Sir Gilbert de Clare 1280-1307, son of Sir Thomas de Clare and Juliane FitzMaurice. They had no issue and Sir Gilbert died by 1307.
2 CONT
2 CONT Secondly, she was the second wife of Sir John Hastings, 1st Lord Hastings, married before 1308 and they had two sons before Sir John died 10 Feb 1313. 
2 CONT
