2 CONT MEMORIAL ID 107258973
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Hugh le Despenser, Earl of Winchester and Isabel de Beauchamp. Granddaughter of Sir Hugh le Despenser and Alivia Basset, William Beauchamp and Maud FitzJohn.
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Sir Gilbert de Clare 1280-1307, son of Sir Thomas de Clare and Juliane FitzMaurice. They had no issue and Sir Gilbert died by 1307.
2 CONT
2 CONT Secondly, she was the second wife of Sir John Hastings, 1st Lord Hastings, married before 1308 and they had two sons; Hugh and Thomas, before Sir John died 10 Feb 1313.
2 CONT
2 CONT Thirdly, she was the second wife of Sir Ralph Monthermer, Earl of Gloucester and Hertford.
2 CONT
