2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Philip le Despenser [k] b abt 1289, Stoke, Gloucestershire, England, d 24 Sep 1313; md Margaret Goushill abt 1311, daughter of Sir Ralph de Goushill and Hawise Fitz Warin.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Philip le Despenser and Margaret de Goushill was: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Philip le Depenser [l] b 6 Apr 1313, of Lincolnshire, England, d Aug 1349, Lincolnshire, England. He md Joan de Cobham 1339/40, daughter of Sir John de Cobham. She was b abt 1323, prob Cobham, Kent, England, d bef 15 May 1357.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Philip le Despenser and Joan de Cobham were:
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Philip le Despenser b 18 Oct 1342, d 4 Aug 1401, Goxhill, Lincolnshire, England; md Elizabeth. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hawise le Despenser b abt 1345, Lincolnshire, England, d 10 Apr 1414. She md Sir Andrew Luttrell, Lord Luttrell, Knight, 7 Sep 1363, son of Sir Geoffrey Luttrell, Lord Luttrell, Knight, and Agnes Sutton. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.geneajourney.com/dspensr.html#LINE B
2 CONT
2 CONT ********************************************************
2 CONT
2 CONT T HED  ESPENSER LINE
2 CONT
2 CONT http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~agrandchildsheritage/despenser.html
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Magna Carta Ancestry (2005), page 612
2 CONT
2 CONT (sub Nettlestead)
2 CONT
2 CONT Gage's History & Antiquities of Suffolk: Thingoe Hundred (1838): 4-8, which cites a
2 CONT
2 CONT Placita coram Rege, Term. S. Hill. 8 Edward II. [Year: 1315], Rot. 77,
2 CONT
2 CONT which names Philip le Despenser as "filio ipsius Hugonis" (that is,
2 CONT
2 CONT son of Hugh le Despenser).
2 CONT
2 CONT Inasmuch as Sir Philip le Despenser's wife, Margaret de Goushill, was
2 CONT
2 CONT born in 1294, and their son and heir, Philip, was born in 1313, it is
2 CONT
2 CONT clear from the chronology that Sir Philip le Despenser (husband of
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret de Goushill) was a younger son of Hugh le Despenser, usually
2 CONT
2 CONT styled "the elder," Earl of Winchester (died 1326) and his wife, Isabel
2 CONT
2 CONT de Beauchamp. Hugh the elder and his wife Isabel were married sometime
2 CONT
2 CONT after 7 July 1283.
2 CONT
2 CONT Conversely, it is chronologically impossible for Sir Philip le
2 CONT
2 CONT Despenser to have been the son of Hugh le Despenser the younger, who
2 CONT
2 CONT married shortly after 14 June 1306 Eleanor de Clare.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hugh le Despenser [f], Earl of Winchester, Lord le Despenser, b 1 Mar 1259/60, Winchester, Hampshire, England, d 27 Oct 1326, Bristol, Gloucestershire, England (hanged). He md Isabel de Beauchamp abt 1284, daughter of Sir William 
2 CONC de Beauchamp, Earl of Warwick, and Maud Fitz John. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Hugh le Despenser and Isabel de Beauchamp were:
2 CONT
2 CONT Hugh le Despenser, Earl of Winchester, b abt 1286. See LINE A
2 CONT
2 CONT Philip le Despenser b abt 1289. See LINE B
2 CONT
2 CONT LINE B
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Philip le Despenser [k] b abt 1289, Stoke, Gloucestershire, England, d 24 Sep 1313; md Margaret Goushill abt 1311, daughter of Sir Ralph de Goushill and Hawise Fitz Warin.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Philip le Despenser and Margaret de Goushill was:
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Philip le Depenser [l] b 6 Apr 1313, of Lincolnshire, England, d Aug 1349, Lincolnshire, England. He md Joan de Cobham 1339/40, daughter of Sir John de Cobham. She was b abt 1323, prob Cobham, Kent, England, d bef 15 May 1357.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Philip le Despenser and Joan de Cobham were:
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Philip le Despenser b 18 Oct 1342, d 4 Aug 1401, Goxhill, Lincolnshire, England; md Elizabeth.www.celtic-casimir.com
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Philip I LE DESPENSER of Stoke 
2 CONT 	Born: 1290, Stoke Gifford, Chipping Sodbury, Gloucestershire, England 
2 CONT 	Died: 24 Sep 1313
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Information:
2 CONT Philip married Margaret DE GOUSHILL Heiress of Goxhill, daughter of Ralph DE GOUSHILL Lord of Camoys Manor and Hawise FITZ WARIN. (Margaret DE GOUSHILL Heiress of Goxhill was born on 12 May 1294 in Goxhill, Glanford Brigg, Lincoln
2 CONC shire, England and died on 29 Jul 1349.)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Hawise le Despenser b abt 1345, Lincolnshire, England, d 10 Apr 1414. She md Sir Andrew Luttrell, Lord Luttrell, Knight, 7 Sep 1363, son of Sir Geoffrey Luttrell, Lord Luttrell, Knight, and Agnes Sutton.
