1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "Maud de Chaworth (2 February 1282–1322) was an English noblewoman and wealthy heiress. She was the only child of Patrick de Chaworth. Sometime before 2 March 1297, she married Henry, 3rd Earl of Lancaster, by whom
2 CONC  she had seven children. Although the exact date of her death is unknown, it is estimated that she must have died sometime before 3 December 1322."
2 CONT
