1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Elizabeth de Beauchamp''' is the daughter of Guy de Beauchamp, 10th Earl of Warwick and Alice de Toni. She married Thomas of Astley, 3rd Lord Astley, son of Sir Giles of Astley and Alice Wolvey, before 1336/37. 
