2 CONT Marriage Information: Elizabeth married Sir Thomas DE ASTLEY 3rd Baron de Astley, son of Sir Giles DE ASTLEY and Alice DE WOLVEY, before 1337 . (Sir Thomas DE ASTLEY 3rd Baron de Astley was born before 1305 in Astley, Nuneaton, Wa
2 CONC rwickshire, England  and died after 3 May 1366 in Bentley, Atherstone, Warwickshire, England .)
