2 CONT      Sibyl Patshull was the daughter of Sir John Patshull and Mabel de Grandson.1 She married Roger Beauchamp, 1st Lord Beauchamp (of Bletsoe), son of Giles Beauchamp and Catherine de Bures, before 1336/37.1 She died after 27 Sept
2 CONC ember 1359.2 She was buried at Black Friars, London, England.1
2 CONT
2 CONT      From before 1336/37, her married name became Beauchamp.1
