2 CONT Sir Roger de Beauchamp (d. before 15 May 1374), who married Joan de Clopton, widow of Sir Walter de Walcote, and daughter of Walter de Clopton, by whom he had a son, 
2 CONT *Sir Roger de Beauchamp (d. 3 May 1406),  and a daughter, 
2 CONT *Margaret Beauchamp, who married Robert Mautby, esquire.
2 CONT
2 CONT  Sir Roger de Beauchamp (d. 3 May 1406) was the grandfather of Margaret Beauchamp of Bletso, grandmother of Henry VII.[2][5
