2 CONT *'''Roger de Beauchamp[1, 2]
2 CONT *'''Born    Cal 1363    of , Bletsoe, Bedfordshire, England   [1] 
2 CONT *'''Died    3 May 1406  [1] 
2 CONT *Father    Roger de Beauchamp,   d. Aft 16 Feb 1369 
2 CONT *'''Family 1    Joan Clopton 
2 CONT *Children 
2 CONT **          1. Sir John de Beauchamp, of , Bletsoe, Bedfordshire, England ,   d. 13 Apr 1412
2 CONT **          2. Catherine de Beauchamp
