1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://thepeerage.com/p13741.htm#i137408
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir William le Blount, 1st and last Lord Blount was the son of Sir Walter le Blount and Joan Sodington.1 He married Margery de Verdun, daughter of Sir Theobald de Verdun, 2nd Lord Verdun and Maud de Mortimer, before 20 February 13
2 CONC 26/27.1 He died before 3 October 1337.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir William le Blount, 1st and last Lord Blount was created 1st Lord Blount [England by writ] on 25 January 1329/30.1 He lived at Sodington, Worcestershire, England.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT On his death, his title become extinct.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.[S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Extinc
2 CONC t or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume II, page 196. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/BLOUNT1.htm#William BLOUNT (Sir Knight)1
2 CONT
2 CONT William BLOUNT (Sir Knight)
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: ABT 1295, Sodington, Worcestershire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Died: BEF 3 Oct 1337
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes: Heir to Sir Walter, Knight of Ockha (alias Rock) died without issue and left the Estate of Sodington property to his brother John. Had a command in Scotland in 1335. He m. Margaret, 3rd dau. and co-heir of Theobald De Verdo
2 CONC n, Lord of Alton Castle, co. Stafford, lord justice of Ireland; and Maud De Mortimer. The lady was b. in 1310; there was no issue of the marriage, and Sir William dying, 11th Edward II. (anno 1337), seized of the castle of Weobly,
2 CONC  in Herefordshire, Batterby, and lands in Fenton, Romesore, and Biddulph, Staffordshire, Sodington and Timberlake, in Worcestershire, as s. by his brother.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Walter BLOUNT (Sir Knight)
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Johanna De SODINGTON
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: Margaret De VERDUN (b. 10 Aug 1310, Ludlow, England) Feb 1327, Sodington, Worcester, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Alice BLOUNT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------------
