2 CONT
2 CONT Theobald de Verdon m. Maud de Mortimer....
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret/Margery de Verdun (b.10 Aug 1310, Alton; d. abt 1377) m. (1) bef 20 Feb 1326/1327 William le Blount (d. bef 3 Oct 1337); m. (2) Mark Husee (d. bef 10 Feb 1345/1346); m (3) bef 10 Sep 1355 John de Crophull (d. 3 Jul 1383).
