2 CONT * http://records.ancestry.com/john_blount_records.ashx?pid=14129759
2 CONT
2 CONT *______________________
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Heir to his brother 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Of Churchdowne
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT It was very unimaginative of Sir William Le Blount to name two sons John.
