1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Ankaret Boteler
2 CONT * AKA le Boteler, le Botiller, le Strange, de Ferrers
2 CONT *b. 1316?, 
2 CONT *d. 8 October 1361
2 CONT *Father	William, 1st Lord Boteler2,3 b. 11 June 1274, d. 14 September 1335
2 CONT *Mother	Ela de Herdeburgh3 b. say 1282
2 CONT
2 CONT Ankaret Boteler was born in 1316? At Wem, Shropshire, England.1 She was the daughter of William, 1st Lord Boteler and Ela de Herdeburgh.2,3 Ankaret Boteler married John, 2nd Lord Strange of Blackmere, son of Fulk, 1st Lord Strange
2 CONC  of Blackmere and Eleanore Giffard; Her 1st.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2 Ankaret Boteler married Sir Thomas de Ferrers after 1350; Her 2nd (widow).2 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ankaret Boteler died on 8 October 1361 at age 45 years.2
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 1
2 CONT
2 CONT John, 2nd Lord Strange of Blackmere b. 1305/6, d. 21 July 1349
2 CONT
2 CONT Children	
2 CONT # Fulk, 3rd Lord Strange of Blackmere b. c 1331, d. 30 Aug 13492
2 CONT # John, 4th Lord Strange of Blackmere+ b. 1332, d. 12 May 13614
2 CONT # Matilda Le Strange+ b. c 13331
2 CONT # Alianor le Strange+ b. s 1340, d. 1396
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 2
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Thomas de Ferrers b. 1315?
2 CONT
2 CONT No issue by 2nd marriage.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
