2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir Leonard Carew, Baron Carew''' was born on 23 April 1342 at Stoke Fleming, Devonshire, England.2,3,6 He married Elizabeth FitzAlan, daughter of Sir Edmund FitzAlan and Sibyl de Montacute, circa 1367; They had 1 son, Sir Thom
2 CONC as, Baron Carew.2,8,3,4,5 Sir Leonard Carew, Baron Carew died on 9 October 1369 at of Carew Castle, Pembrokeshire, Wales, at age 27.2,3,6
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Family''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT m: Elizabeth FitzAlan d. bt 29 Sep 1385 - Mar 1386
2 CONT
2 CONT Child
