2 CONT
2 CONT '''Citations'''
2 CONT
2 CONT  1.[S9513] Unknown author, Burke's Peerage, 1938, p. 498; Carew Genealogy.
2 CONT  2.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 184.
