1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ====Wikitree: [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Talbot-34  Richard Talbot (abt. 1361–abt. 1396)]
2 CONT * Scrutinized and Well-Sourced Webpage. 
2 CONT * '''''Please''''' refrain from copy-&-pasting it into this overly bloated Overview. Instead, perused Wikitree's webpage.
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Cracrofts Peerage: [http://www.cracroftspeerage.co.uk/online/content/talbot1332.htm#TALBOT_1332_7 Richard {Talbot}, 4th Baron Talbot]
2 CONT *'''born	c. 1361
2 CONT *'''mar.	bef. 23 Aug 1383 Ankaret Lestrange, suo jure Baroness Strange of Blackmere''' (b. c. 1361; mar. betw. 8 Mar and 4 Jul 1401 as his second wife Thomas [Nevill], jure uxoris 5th and 4th Baron Furnivall; d. 1 Jun 1413), only 
2 CONC dau. and eventual sole hrss. of John [Lestrange], 1st or 4th Baron Strange of Blackmere, by his wife Lady Mary FitzAlan, 2nd dau. of Richard [FitzAlan], 10th or 3rd Earl of Arundel, by his first wife Isabel le Despencer, 2nd dau. 
2 CONC of Hugh [le Despencer], 1st and de jure 2nd Baron le Despencer, by his wife Lady Eleanor de Clare, sister and cohrss of Gilbert [de Clare], 7th Earl of Gloucester, and 1st dau. of Gilbert [de Clare], 6th Earl of Gloucester, by his
2 CONC  second wife Princess Joan "of Acre", 2nd surv. dau. by his first wife of King Edward I
2 CONT *'''children
2 CONT **1. Sir Gilbert Talbot, later 5th Baron Talbot later 5th Baron Strange of Blackmere
2 CONT **2. Sir John Talbot, later jure uxoris 6th and 5th Baron Furnivall later 7th Baron Strange of Blackmere and 7th Baron Talbot later 1st Earl of Shrewsbury
2 CONT **3. Most Rev Richard Talbot, Archbishop of Dublin
2 CONT **4. Thomas Talbot, of Wrockwardine, co. Shrewsbury
2 CONT *'''died	8 or 9 Sepc1396
2 CONT *'''suc. by	son
2 CONT *Gilbert [Talbot], 5th Baron Talbot later 5th Baron Strange of Blackmere, KG
2 CONT *born	1383
2 CONT *mar. (1)
2 CONT *mar. (2)	c. 1415 Beatrice ....., a lady of Portugal (mar. (2) bef. 1423 Thomas Fettiplace, of East Shefford, co. Berkshire; d. 25 Dec 1447; bur. at East Shefford, co. Berkshire)
2 CONT *only child by second wife
2 CONT **1. Ankaret Talbot, later suo jure Baroness Talbot and Baroness Strange of Blackmere
2 CONT * Died	s.p.m. 19 Oct 1418
