2 CONT *Father: Gilbert TALBOT (3° B. Talbot)
2 CONT *Mother: Petronella BUTLER
2 CONT *'''Married: Ankaret STRANGE (B. Strange of Blackmere) 23 Aug 1383
2 CONT *Children:
2 CONT **1. John TALBOT (1º E. Shrewsbury)
2 CONT **2. Gilbert TALBOT of Irchingfield (5º B. Strange of Blackmere)
2 CONT **3. Mary TALBOT
2 CONT **4. Richard TALBOT (Archbishop of Dublin)
2 CONT **5. George TALBOT
2 CONT **6. Anne TALBOT (C. Devon)
2 CONT **7. Thomas TALBOT of Wrockwardine (Sir Knight) (had no Children) (d. 1419/20)
2 CONT **8. William TALBOT
