2 CONT ====GordonBanks.com: [http://www.gordonbanks.com/gordon/family/2nd_Site/geb-p/p33.htm#i1611 Lord Talbot de Blackmere IV]
2 CONT * '''Sir Richard Talbot 4th Lord Talbot of Blackmere, M.P.1'''
2 CONT * M, b. circa 1361, d. between 8 September 1396 and 9 September 1396, #1611
2 CONT * '''Father:''' Sir Gilbert Talbot M.P.2,3,4,5,6 b. circa 1332, d. 24 April 1387
2 CONT * '''Mother:''' Petronilla Butler7,4,5,6 d. 1368
2 CONT * '''Birth:''' Sir Richard Talbot 4th Lord Talbot of Blackmere, M.P. was born circa 1361.7,8,9,10,1,5 
2 CONT * '''Knighted:''' He was knighted by Richard II at his coronation on 16 July 1377.5 
2 CONT * '''Event-Misc:''' Was in Ireland with Edmund, Earl of March in January 1381 at Ireland.5 
2 CONT * '''Marriage:''' He married Ankaret le Strange, daughter of Sir John le Strange and Mary FitzAlan, before 23 August 1383.11,12,9,10,1,5 
2 CONT * '''Event-Misc:''' Summoned to Parliament in consequence of his marriage to the heiress of Strange of Blackmere. Between 3 March 1384 and 17 December 1387.10,1,5 
2 CONT * '''Event-Misc:''' Summoned to be present 14 Jul for service against the Scots on 13 June 1385 at Newcastle-on-Tyne, Northumbria, England.5 
2 CONT * '''Event-Misc:''' Seised of his father's lands on 18 June 1387.5 
2 CONT * '''Event-Misc:''' Was summoned to Parliament by writ directed Ricard Talbot de Godriche Castell. Between 1 December 1387 and 13 November 1393.5 
2 CONT * '''Event-Misc:''' Was (upon the death of the 3rd Earl of Pembroke) awarded the Honor of Wexford in Ireland, as coheir through Elizabeth Comyn, his grandmother. On 31 December 1389.5 
2 CONT * '''Event-Misc:''' Was commissioner of array for Shropshire on 1 March 1392 at Shropshire, England.5 
2 CONT * '''Event-Misc:''' Was in Ireland in the King's service. In February 1395 at Ireland.5 
2 CONT * '''Death:''' He died between 8 September 1396 and 9 September 1396.7,11,9,10,1,5 
2 CONT * '''Arms:''' His arms were Gules a lion and a border engrailed or.1 
2 CONT * '''Family''' Ankaret le Strange b. 1361, d. 1 June 1413
2 CONT * '''Marriage''': He married Ankaret le Strange, daughter of Sir John le Strange and Mary FitzAlan, before 23 August 1383.11,12,9,10,1,5 
