2 CONT
2 CONT Joan de Stafford1 
2 CONT *F, #23626, d. before 1397
2 CONT
2 CONT Joan de Stafford was the daughter of Ralph de Stafford, 1st Earl of Stafford and Margaret Audley, Baroness Audley.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, firstly, John Cherleton, 3rd Lord Cherleton, son of John Cherleton, 2nd Lord Cherleton and Maud de Mortimer.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, secondly, Gilbert Talbot, 3rd Lord Talbot, son of Richard Talbot, 2nd Lord Talbot and Elizabeth Comyn, before 16 November 1379.
2 CONT
2 CONT She died before 1397.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Her married name became Cherleton.1 From before 16 November 1379, her married name became Talbot.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Joan de Stafford and John Cherleton, 3rd Lord Cherleton
2 CONT
2 CONT John Cherleton, 4th Lord Cherleton b. 25 Apr 1362, d. 19 Oct 14011 
2 CONT
2 CONT Edward Cherleton, 5th Baron Cherleton+ b. c 1371, d. 14211 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://thepeerage.com/p2363.htm#i23626
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT *''''''Joan Stafford1,2,3
2 CONT *F, #10875
2 CONT *Father      Sir Ralph de Stafford, 1st Earl Stafford, 2nd Lord Stafford, Seneschal of Aquitaine, Chief Justice of Chester & Flint4,2,3 b. 24 Sep 1301, d. 31 Aug 1372
2 CONT *Mother     Katharine de Hastang4,2 d. b 6 Jul 1336
2 CONT *''''''     Joan Stafford married Sir Nicholas Beke, Sheriff of Staffordshire, son of Robert de Bec and Mary (?).4,2,3
2 CONT *''''''Family      Sir Nicholas Beke, Sheriff of Staffordshire d. a Sep 1369
2 CONT *Child
2 CONT **Elizabeth de Beke+3 d. c 1373
2 CONT *Citations
