2 CONT Last Edited=28 Nov 2008  Elizabeth Talbot was the daughter of Sir John Talbot and Catherine (?).1 She married Warin l'Arcedekne, 3rd Baron Arcedekne , son of John l'Arcedekne, 2nd Baron Arcedekne and Cecily Haccombe.1 She died on 
2 CONC 3 August 1407.1 Her married name became l'Arcedekne.1  Children of Elizabeth Talbot and Warin l'Arcedekne, 3rd Baron Arcedekne  	Philippa l'Arcedekne +2  	Alienor l'Arcedekne +2  	Margary l'Arcedekne 2  	Elizabeth l'Arcedekne 3 Ci
