2 CONT Marriage Information: Joyce also married Sir Robert DE MORTIMER of Richard's Castle, son of Sir Hugh DE MORTIMER of Richard's Castle and Unknown, before 1268 in Devonshire, England. (Sir Robert DE MORTIMER of Richard's Castle was 
2 CONC born before 1252 in Richard's Castle, Hereford, England, died on 7 Apr 1287 in Wychbold, Droitwich Spa, Worcestershire, England and was buried on 8 Apr 1287 in Worcester Cathedral, Worcestershire, England.)
