2 CONT Sir Geoffrey Cornwall
2 CONT
2 CONT      Sir Geoffrey Cornwall was the son of Richard de Cornwall. He married Margaret de Mortimer, daughter of Hugh de Mortimer, 1st and last Lord Mortimer, before 1309.1 He died before June 1335.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Sir Geoffrey Cornwall gained the title of 1st Baron of Burford, Shropshire [feudal barony].
2 CONT
