2 CONT *''''''     Margaret Howard married Sir Constantine Clifton, 2nd Baron Clifton, son of Sir John de Clifton, 1st Lord Clifton and Elizabeth de Cromwell, after February 1390; They had 1 son (Sir John, 3rd Lord Clifton) and 1 daughte
2 CONC r (Elizabeth, wife of Sir John Knyvet).2,3,4,5 Margaret Howard married Sir Gilbert Talbot, Justice of the Peace for Berkshire & Wiltshire, son of Sir John Talbot and Juliane de Grey, between 13 February 1396 and 31 December 1396; 
2 CONC They had 1 son, Richard. His 3rd marriage.2,3,5 Margaret Howard died on 25 March 1434; Buried at Black Friars, Norwich, Norfolk.2,3
