2 CONT *''''''     Margaret Howard married, firstly, Constantine de Clifton, 2nd Lord Clifton, son of John de Clifton, 1st Lord Clifton and Elizabeth de Cromwell, after February 1389/90.1 She married, secondly, Sir Gilbert Talbot before 
2 CONC 1397.1 She died on 25 March 1433.1 She was buried at Blackfriars, Norwich, Norfolk, England.1
2 CONT *''''''     She was the daughter of Sir John Howard and Margaret Plaiz.1 From after February 1389/90, her married name became de Clifton.1 From before 1397, her married name became Talbot.1
2 CONT *''''''Children of Margaret Howard and Constantine de Clifton, 2nd Lord Clifton
