2 CONT *'''     Sir John Hardreshull, Lord Hache married Maud Mussenden. Sir John Hardreshull, Lord Hache married Margaret Stafford, daughter of Sir James Stafford and Mary de Stafford. Sir John Hardreshull, Lord Hache was born on 24 Aug
2 CONC ust at Pachesham, Surrey, England; St. Bartholomew's Day. He died between 1 May 1367 and 18 June 1369 at of Hartshill, Warwickshire, Saleby, Lincolnshire, England.
