2 CONT .	John 3rd Baron Hache de HARDRESHULL , Sir (William de HARDRESHULL , of Hartshill & Saleby7, John de HARDRESHULL , of Hartshill & Saleby6, William de HARDRESHULL , of Hartshill & Saleby5, Robert de HARDRESHULL , of Hartshill & Sa
2 CONC leby4, William de HARDRESHULL , of Hartshill & Saleby3, Robert de HARDRESHULL , of Hartshill2, Hugh de HARDRESHULL , of Hartshill & Ansley1) was born 24 AUG 1291 in Hartshill, Atherstone, Warwickshire, England, and died BEF 18 JUN
2 CONC  1368 in Ashton, Northamptonshire, England. He married Maud (Matilda) MALEMAYNS in 1st wife, daughter of Nicholas IV MALMAYNS , of Ockely, KB, Sir and Alice. She was born ABT 1305 in South Warnborough, Aldershot, Hampshire, Englan
2 CONC d, and died BEF 1329. He married Margaret STAFFORD ABT 1330 in 2nd husband 2nd wife, daughter of James STAFFORD , of Sandon, Sir and Mary de STAFFORD. She was born ABT 1315 in Sandon, Stone, Staffordshire, England, and died AFT 13
2 CONC 74.
2 CONT  	  Child of John 3rd Baron Hache de HARDRESHULL , Sir and Maud (Matilda) MALEMAYNS is:
2 CONT
2 CONT +	4	  i.	Margaret de HARDRESHULL was born ABT 1325 in Hartshill, Atherstone, Warwickshire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of John 3rd Baron Hache de HARDRESHULL , Sir and Margaret STAFFORD is:
