2 CONT *'''     Sir Thomas de Crophull was born circa 1350 at of Cotesbach & Newbold Verdun, Leicestershire, England.3,6 A settlement for the marriage Sir Thomas de Crophull and Sibilla de la Bere was made on 18 October 1371; They had 1 
2 CONC daughter (Agnes, wife of Sir Walter Devereux, of Sir John Parr, & of John Merbury, Esq.).3,4,5,6 Sir Thomas de Crophull died on 18 November 1381.2,3,6
2 CONT *'''Family      Sibilla de la Bere b. 19 May 1338, d. b 18 Nov 1381
