2 CONT *'''     Agnes Crophill was born circa 1371.1 She was the daughter''' of Thomas de Crophill and Sibyl de la Bere.1 '''She married, secondly, Sir John Parr.1 She married, firstly, Sir Walter Devereux''', son of Sir Walter Devereux.
2 CONC 2 '''She married, thirdly, John Merbury.2 She died on 3 February 1436.1
2 CONT *'''      Her married name became Devereux. Her married name became Merbury.2 She was also known as Agnes de Crophull.2 Her married name became Parr.1
