2 CONT '''Violet de la Bere''', daughter of John de la Bere, wife of John de Chaundos 1363 25 Jan 1363 - 24 Jan 1364 Thomas de Chaundos, knight, to settle messuages, land and rent in Wellington, Fownhope and Snodhill [in Dorstone, Herefo
2 CONC rdshire] on himself for life, with remainder to his son John, Violet daughter of John de la Bere, and the heirs of the said John the son, retaining manors in the said places. Hereford. 37 Edward III, National Archives, Kew C 143/3
2 CONC 48/2.
