2 CONT *'''     Sir John de St. John, Mayor of Bordeaux was born at of Faumont, Glamorgan, Wales. He married Elizabeth Paulett, daughter of Sir John Paulet and Elizabeth Creedy. Sir John de St. John, Mayor of Bordeaux died after 1421.
