2 CONT LDS
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Llowarch ap Bran, Lord of Monau (Menai), and founder of the II. noble tribe of North Wales and Powys. 
2 CONT
2 CONT They (Owen Gwynedd and Llowarch ap Bran) were brothers-in-law, their wives being sisters. Llowarch ap Bran was succeeded by his son, Meredydd, who married his cousin, Gwenillian, granddaughter of Prince Owen Gwynnedd.  (from Meyri
2 CONC ck Genealogy but I believe he missed a generation)
2 CONT
2 CONT There is some discrepancy between the Visitations of Wales and the Meyrick Genealogy.  I am following the Visitations that give the following lineage for Eva, wife of Einion Sais:
2 CONT
2 CONT "Eva verch Mredydd ap Cadwgan ap Llowarch ap Bran".
