2 NICK Lord of Stinton
2 NICK de Braose
2 NICK de Briouse
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Priory Church, Aconbury, Herefordshire, England, United Kingdom
2 ADDR
1 OCCU unknown
2 PLAC Magna Carta Surety
2 ADDR
