2 CONC  province of Alessandria.
2 CONT
2 CONT Montferrat was a lordship in northern Italy, technically a member of the
2 CONT Empire but subject to Provencal and Angevin influences.  The marquis wasa
2 CONT prominent figure on the Ghibelline side in thirteenth centuryMediterranean
2 CONT politics,
