2 CONT
2 CONT Source: "The Rufus Parks Pedigree" by Brian J.L. Berry.
2 CONT
2 CONT Page 78:  Chart -- EDMUND, 1st Lord MORTIMER, 1261-1304
2 CONT
2 CONT !Availability: The libraries of Ken, Kevin, Karen, Kristen, Brian, Adam, Amy, and FAL.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: "Ancestral Roots of Sixty Colonists" by Frederick Lewis Weis
2 CONT
2 CONT Page 32. Line: (32-30):
2 CONT
2 CONT 31. -- SIR EDMUND DE MORTIMER, b. 1261, d. 17 Jul. 1304, 7th Baron Mortimer of Wigmore; m. (2) ca. 1280, MARGARET DE FIENES (120-32), d. 7 Feb. 1333/4.  (CP VIII 433; IX 281-283).
2 CONT
2 CONT !Availability: The library of Ken
1 NOTE !SOURCES:
2 CONT     1. Plantagenet Ancestry, Eng. 116, p. 72
2 CONT     2. The Complete Peerage, G.E.C., Eng. V, v. 9, p. 281-83
