1 NOTE BECAME 7TH BARON MORTIMER (OF WIGMORE) BY BARONIAL WRIT 1295; 1282 PRINCE LLEWELLYN WAS KILLED A BUILTH IN A CHANCE ENCOUNTER - EDMUND IDENTIFIED THE BODY AND TOOK THE HEAD TO THE KING, WHO SENT IT TO LONDON WHERE IT WAS DISPLAYED
2 CONC  ON A SPIKE AT THE TOWER.
2 CONT
