2 CONT ----
2 CONT [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/110515058/margaret-de_vere]
2 CONT Margaret de Mortimer de Vere 
2 CONT BIRTH: unknown England 
2 CONT DEATH: 1297 England 
2 CONT BURIAL: Grey Friars Ipswich, Ipswich Borough, Suffolk, England 
2 CONT MEMORIAL ID110515058 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/details/L6LG-24K
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Daughter of''' Sir Roger de Mortimer and Maud de Brewes.
2 CONT '''Wife of''' Sir Robert de Vere, son of Sir Robert de Vere and Alice de Sanford. They had one son, Sir Thomas.
2 CONT '''Family Members, Parents:''' Roger Mortimer 1231–1282 Maud Braose 1224–1301
2 CONT '''Spouse''' Robert de Vere 1257–1331
2 CONT '''Siblings''' Isabel de Mortimer unknown–1292 Edmund Mortimer 1261–1303
2 CONT '''Children''' Phelice de Vere de Berkerolles
2 CONT ----
