2 CONC riage date suggests that she was much younger than her sister who married the Welsh princes.  Maybe they were born from different marriages.  m (1226[1316]) [https://www.geni.com/people/Thomas-of-Galloway/6000000176963741879 THOMA
2 CONC S of Galloway], illegitimate son of [https://www.geni.com/people/Alan-Lord-of-Galloway/6000000176963526866 ALAN Lord of Galloway] & his mistress ---. 
