2 CONT >>>>>(a)    [https://www.geni.com/people/Ragnvald-King-of-Man-the-Isles/6000000177016184823 RAGNVALD] Godradarson .  King of Man and the Isles.  William "the Lion" King of Scotland sold Caithness to him after the battle of Wick in
2 CONC  1198.  He lost Caithness to Harald [II] Maddadsson Jarl of Orkney in 1200.  [http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SCOTTISH%20NOBILITY.htm#_Toc268450047 (Cawley's Medlands)]
