2 CONC pg=PA324&lpg=PA324&dq=arderne+and+stanley+of+elford&source=bl&ots=2r-qgfE-ey&sig=dt3BDC98sQkPzwzo7_QftK1o16I&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwiCo4qLyLTUAhXI8YMKHWlKALk4ChDoAQghMAA#v=onepage&q=arderne%20stanley%20of%20elford&f=false GoogleBoo
2 CONC ks] >
