2 CONT http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p198.htm#i5954
2 CONT
2 CONT Maud le Vavasour was born circa 1187 at of Edlington & Newborough, Yorkshire, England. She married Theobald FitzWalter, Sheriff of Lancashire, Lord Preston, son of Hervey Walter and Maud de Valoignes, circa 1200. Maud le Vavasour 
2 CONC married Fulk III FitzWarin, son of Fulk II FitzWarin and Hawise de Dinan, before 1 October 1207. Maud le Vavasour died before 1226 at of Hazelwood, Yorkshire, England. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 1 	Theobald FitzWalter, Sheriff of Lancashire, Lord Preston b. c 1160, d. a 4 Aug 1205 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children	
2 CONT
2 CONT * Maud Walter+
2 CONT * Theobald le Botiller (Butler)+ b. 1200, d. 19 Jul 1230
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 2 	Fulk III FitzWarin d. 14 May 1264 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children	
2 CONT
2 CONT *     Joan FitzWarine+
2 CONT *     Eve FitzWarin+2 b. c 1220, d. a 1282
2 CONT *     Mabel FitzWarin+ b. c 1225, d. c 24 May 1297
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT
2 CONT *   1. [S1481] Unknown author, The Complete Peerage, by Cokayne, Vol. II, p. 447; Burke's Peerage, 1938, p. 1909.
2 CONT *   2. [S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 742-745.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Maude Le Vavasour
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Keats-Rohan, K.S.B. Domesday Descendants: A Prosopography of Persons Occurring in English Documents 1066-1166. II Pipe Rolls to Cartae Baronum. The Boydell Press, 2002. p. 1134.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Herverus who came over with William the Conqueror.
2 CONT
2 CONT Theobald married Maud, daughter of Robert le Vavasor. Their child was Theobald who married Maud, sister of Thomas A. Becket. He was sheriff of Lancashire 1195 59 1199. In 1177, he was made Chief Butler of Ireland by Henry II, when
2 CONC  he assumed the official surname Pincerna. In 1221, he first assumed the name of Boteler, or Butler, and from him descended the Butlers, Earls of Ormand.
2 CONT
2 CONT ~The Houghton Genealogy, p. 20
2 CONT
