2 CONT May have been the inspiration for Robin Hood; he was a medieval landed gentleman who was forced to become an outlaw in the early 13th century.  He rebelled against King John (1199-1216) from 1200 to 1203,mainly over a dispute conc
2 CONC erning his familial right to Whittington Castle.
