2 CONT *''''''The history of the princes, the lords marcher, and the ancient ..., Volume 3 By Jacob Youde William Lloyd
2 CONT *http://archive.org/details/historyofprinces03lloy
2 CONT *Pg. 27 
2 CONT *ESCLUSHAM.— TOWNSHIP OF BERS. PLAS Y MERS. 
2 CONT *Cae Cyriog MS. ; Lewys Dwnn, vol. ii, p. 359. 
2 CONT *Madog Puleston of Bers (argent, on a bend sable, three mullets of the field), was the second son of Robert Puleston of Emeral in Maelor Saesneg, ab Richard ab Sir Roger Puleston. He married Angharad, daughter of ''''''David ab Go
2 CONC ronwy of Burton and Llai, who, as well as his daughter Angharad, was living in 1415'''''' ; by this lady, Madog had, besides a daughter, Angharad, the wife of Elis Eyton of Rhiwabon, a son and heir, 
2 CONT *SEE DOCUMENTS OR SOURCES FOR MORE
