2 CONT See https://books.google.com/books?id=8XGoAwAAQBAJ&pg=PP109&lpg=PP109&dq=hywel+sele&source=bl&ots=8HxEPBWuQx&sig=GQet-uI14JxInx3EF4MNDm9Lh-A&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwj7gpX7k73PAhVQ_mMKHZPBBpM4ChDoAQg-MAY#v=onepage&q=hywel%20sele&f=fa
2 CONC lse
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT *''''''Archaeologia cambrensis    By John Skinner, Cambrian Archaeological Association
2 CONT *http://books.google.com/books?id=0gtPAAAAIAAJ&pg=PA269&lpg=PA269&dq=Gruffydd+Nannau&source=bl&ots=B-9B-R5d5m&sig=AWXnRV_-GEG1SZLC5t35t0J0Jbw&hl=en&ei=MgmfToqNH_LPiALS-8GDCg&sa=X&oi=book_result&ct=result&resnum=9&ved=0CE0Q6AEwCA#v
2 CONC =onepage&q=Gruffydd%20Nannau&f=false
2 CONT *Pg. 269
2 CONT **CHART
2 CONT *Gruffydd Nannau, lord of Nannau, ab Howel ab Davydd ab Meurig Vychan ab ''''''Howel Sele'''''', descended from Cadwgan ab Bleddyn ab Cynvyn, Prince of Powys = Jane, da of Humphrey ab Howel ab Ieuan ab Einion of Ynys Maengwyn, des
2 CONC cended from Osbwrn Wyddel
2 CONT **      Hugh Nannau of Nannau, Esq. = Annest, d. of Rhys Vaughan of Cors y Gedol, Esq.
2 CONT ***	Jane, second of five daughters of Hugh Nannau, Esq. = 1st Elisua Lloyd of Rhiwaedog, ab William, Esq., o.s.p. = 2ndly, Lewis Gwyn of Dolau Gwyn, Esq. (His first wife) ch: 1. Jane Gwyn; 2. Ann, prima ux. of Lewis Lloyde of Rhiw
2 CONC aedog, Esq., s.p..
2 CONT ****	      1. Jane Gwyn, h. of Dolau Gwyn = 2nd son Gruffydd Nannau (son of Gruffydd Nannau & Ellen, d. of John ab Cadwaladr)
2 CONT ***	1. Gruffydd Nannau of Nannau, Esq., n. 1568, M.P. for Meirionydd, 1593 = Ellen, d. of John ab Cadwaladr of Rhiwlas in Penllyn, Esq. ch: eldest son Hugh Nannau of Nan.; 2nd son Gruffydd Nannau
2 CONT ****	      eldest son Hugh Nannau of Nannau, Esq., n. 22 Oct. 1588; Sheriff, 1627; ob. 1647-8 = Ann, d. of Gruffydd Vaughan of Cors Gedol, Esq.
2 CONT ****	      2nd son Gruffydd Nannau = 1. Jane Gwyn, of Dolau Gwyn (d. of Lewis Gwyn & Jane Nannau)
2 CONT ***	2. Richard Nannau, parson of Llangelynin
2 CONT ***	3. Edward Nannau, ancestor of the Nanneys of Maes y Pandy, co. Mer. = Elizabeth, d. of Lewis Gwyn of Dolau Gwyn, Esq.
2 CONT ***	4. Robert, a merchant in London, = Joyce, d of Pyrs ___
2 CONT *____________________
