1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He is credited (along with Iolo Goch) with creating the cywydd meter.  His most famous poem is his elegy to his lover, Lleucu Llwyd, who is supposed to have died of a broken heart, when she thought he had deserted 
2 CONC her.
