1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John le Strange IV Lord Strange of Knockyn  Sex: M  Birth: 1254 in of Chesawardine, Salop, England  Death: ABT 26 FEB 1275/76 in River Severn  _FA1: Lord Strange of Knockyn in Salop.  Note: John le Strange, Lord of
2 CONC  Knokyn. This feudal baron, in the time of his father, was deputy governor of Winchester Castle, and in the 48th Henry III [1264], he was constituted governor of the castle of Montgomery. He subsequently espoused the baronial caus
2 CONC e and, after the triumph of the barons at Lewes, was reinstated in the governorship of Montgomery Castle. In the 3rd Edward I [1375], he surrendered to his brother, Robert, his entire right in the manor of Wrockwurdine. His lordsh
2 CONC ip m. Joane, one of the daus. and heirs of Roger de Someri, Baron of Dudley, by his 1st wife, Lady Nichola de Albini, sister and co-heir of Hugh, 4th Earl of Arundel, and d. in 1276, when all his lands were seized upon by the crow
2 CONC n, but in two years afterwards, they were restored to his son and heir, John le Strange. [Sir Bernard Burke, Dormant, Abeyant, Forfeited, and Extinct Peerages, Burke's Peerage, Ltd., London, 1883, p. 516, Strange, Barons Strange o
2 CONC f Knokyn]
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: John le Strange III Lord Strange of Knockyn b: BEF 1200 in of Ness & Cheswardine, Shropshire, England  Mother: Lucy de Tregoz b: ABT 1202 in Ewyas-Harold, Hereford, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Joan de Somery b: 1232 in of Ellesmere, Shropshire, England Married: BEF 1254 Children
2 CONT  John le Strange V Lord Strange of Knockyn b: ABT 1253 in of Ellesmere, Shropshire, England
2 CONT  Hamon le Strange b: ABT 1254 in Knockin, Shropshire, England
2 CONT  Hawise le Strange b: ABT 1258
2 CONT -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT The Magna Charta Sureties, 1215: The Barons Named in the Magna Charta, 1215 ... By Frederick Lewis Weis, William Ryland Beall Pg. 176-177 http://books.google.com/books?id=59XcwoRK9jkC&pg=PA177&lpg=PA177&dq=Thomas+of+Luton+Hoo+1366
2 CONC &source=bl&ots=KFompugY-m&sig=C4dhacl-ks2IRQVS1pDyuf-qhJA&hl=en&ei=oU3wS9nTOJKosgOonJm0Dw&sa=X&oi=book_result&ct=result&resnum=5&ved=0CCUQ6AEwBDgK#v=onepage&q=Thomas%20of%20Luton%20Hoo%201366&f=false
2 CONT -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
