2 CONT http://www.renderplus.com/hartgen/htm/le-strange.htm#name4981
2 CONT
2 CONT 7. John Le Strange - was born about 1226, lived in Cheswardine, Shropshire, England and died in 1276 in Knockin, Warwick, England . He was the son of John Le Strange and Lucy de Tregoz.  John married Joan de Somery. Joan was born 
2 CONC about 1232, lived in Ellesmere, Shropshire, England. She was the daughter of Baron Roger Dudley de Somery and Nicole d'Albiny. She died in 1282 in Knockin, Warwick, England .  
