1 NAME Margaret /de Vernon/
2 GIVN Margaret
2 SURN de Vernon
2 _MARNM de Vernon
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 PLAC Mottram,,Cheshire,England
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 4 JUN 1349
