2 CONT
2 CONT ---------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas ap Llywelyn   
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas was born about 1309 in Gloddaeth, Creuddyn, Caernavonshire, Wales.1   Thomas' father was Llywelyn ap Owain and his mother was Eleanor de Bar.  His paternal grandparents were Owain ap Gryffud de la Pole and Joan Corbet; his 
2 CONC maternal grandparents were Duke Henri of Bar III and Eleanor Plantagenet.  He was an only child.
2 CONT
2 CONT Personal Details
2 CONT
2 CONT  Thomas ap Llywelyn
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas was born about 1309 in Gloddaeth, Creuddyn, Caernavonshire, Wales.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT  Eleanor Goch verch Philip
2 CONT
2 CONT Eleanor was born about 1320 in Cardigan, Wales.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT   Thomas ap Thomas
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas was born about 1339 in Gloddaeth, Creuddyn, Caernavonshire, Wales.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT   Elen verch Thomas
2 CONT
2 CONT Elen was born about 1340 in Gloddaeth, Creuddyn, Caernavonshire, Wales.2 
2 CONT
2 CONT   Margred verch Thomas
2 CONT
2 CONT Margred was born about 1342 in Gloddaeth, Creuddyn, Caernavonshire, Wales.2 
