2 CONT Iscoed was born about 1225 in Cardigan, Wales.1   Iscoed's father was Lord of Cardigan Philip ap Ivor and his mother was Angharad verch Llewelyn.  His maternal grandparents were Llewelyn (The Great) ap Iorweth and Joan Plantagenet
2 CONC .  He was an only child.
