1 NOTE He [Nicholas Martin] married, 2ndly, in 1259 or 1260, Isabel, widow ofHugh PEVEREL, and granddaughter and coheiress of Ralph FITZWILLIAM, ofBrompton Ralph and Withycombe, which Isabel held the manor of Brown inTreborough, a third 
2 CONC of the original manor of Withycombe, and other lands.He died early in 1282, an inquisition after his death being taken 22March 1281/2.  [Complete Peerage VIII:533-5, (transcribed by DaveUtzinger)]
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: It may be that Isabel was daughter, not granddaughter of RalphFitzWilliam by Yolenta de Mohun.  @check ancestry SGM on Yolenta
