1 NAME Emma /d'Anjou/
2 GIVN Emma
2 SURN d'Anjou
2 _MARNM Plantagenet
2 NICK Emma of Anjou
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1140
2 ADDR
3 CTRY France
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1212
2 ADDR
3 STAE Cornwall
3 CTRY UK
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Emma d'Anjou, Princess of Wales'''
2 CONT
2 CONT According 
2 CONT *The Peerage: [http://www.thepeerage.com/p10475.htm#i104744 '''Emma Plantagenet'''] was the daughter of Geoffrey V Plantagenet, Comte d'Anjou et Maine and Matilda 'the Empress' of England.1 
2 CONT **She married Guy de Laval, Sire de Laval.2 
2 CONT **She married Dafydd ap Owain, Prince of East Gwynnedd, son of Owain ap Gruffyd,  King of Gwynedd and Cristin ferchGoronwy, in 1175.3 She died before 1214.4 Illegitimate.3
2 CONT *Medlands: [http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ANJOU,%20MAINE.htm#EmmaM1GuyVLavalM2DafyddIGwynedd '''Emma d’Anjou '''] ’’she had only one husband’’ m ([1174]) DAFYDD I Prince of Gwynedd, son of OWAIN King of Gwynedd & his second wife
2 CONC  Crisiant of Deheubarth (-1203). 
2 CONT *Euweb: E4. [illegitimate] '''Emma d'Anjou, *after 1128'''; m.Guy V, sire de Laval /OR m.ca VII.1174 David I, Pr of Gwynedd (''She was an illegitimate daughter of''  [http://genealogy.euweb.cz/anjou/anjou2.html#G5 GEOFFROY V Plant
2 CONC agenet, Cte d'Anjou].
2 CONT *Myheritage https://www.myheritage.com/names/emma_plantagenet
2 CONT *WikiTree [https://www.wikitree.com/genealogy/Plantagenet-Family-Tree-159 '''Emme (Plantagenet) of Anjou before 1151 - about 1214''']
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT From Medlands: Comte Geoffroy had three illegitimate children by Mistresses (1) to (3):[http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ANJOU,%20MAINE.htm#FoulquesIIIdied1040B  ''' 6. EMMA d´Anjou''' ] A manuscript entitled "De Origine Comitum An
2 CONC degavensium" records that "Gaufridus Plantagenet Comes Andegavensium" had an illegitimate daughter "Emmam quam David Norwallensium Princeps"[361].  The Chronicle of the Princes of Wales records that "king David married dame Emma t
2 CONC he sister of the king of England" in 1175[362].  The Testa de Nevill includes a writ of King John dated 1212 which records that "Emma quondam uxor David Regis Wallie" was granted "manerium de Hales" in Shropshire by King Henry II[
2 CONC 363].  m (1174) DAFYDD I Prince of Gwynedd, son of OWAIN King of Gwynedd & his second wife Christina of Deheubarth (-1204).  
2 CONT
2 CONT ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
2 CONT
2 CONT The Peerage:  [http://www.thepeerage.com/p10475.htm#i104744  '''Emma Plantagenet'''1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #104744, d. before 1214
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=10 May 2003
2 CONT
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=0.06%
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Emma Plantagenet was the daughter of Geoffrey V Plantagenet, Comte d'Anjou et Maine and Matilda 'the Empress' of England.'''1 She married Guy de Laval, Sire de Laval.2 She married David ap Owen, Prince of East Gwynnedd, son of 
2 CONC Owain Gwynedd (?) and unknown (?).2 She died before 1214.3
2 CONT
