2 CONC oc_id=6000000173393115944 [Bartrum charts him as a Gen 1 man married to a Gen 3 woman, which is not feasible. He then charts "great grandson" Caradog's father and grandfather as Gen 2 men, meaning they were born before the Gen 3 E
2 CONC linor. Wolcott avoids this by factoring a stable timeline for "Eidio Wyllt" and determining that both "Eidio Wyllt" and "Golwg Goch" were actually nicknames for Caradog's father, Madog eidio wyllt y golwg goch ap Sitric ap Olaf ap
2 CONC  Sitric Silkbeard] (Steven Ferry, June 23, 2026.)
