2 CONT Born A.D. 1110;died about 1168; married about 1136 when he brought his bride to Manorbier Castle in Wales which had been built by his grandfather Odo de Barri about A.D. 1090 after a Norman force subdued Pembrokeshire. De Barri wa
2 CONC s a Norman baron who fought along side  William, Duke of Normandy, at the Battle of Hastings in 1066.
