2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT https://freepages.rootsweb.com/~hwbradley/genealogy/aqwg1293.htm#50766
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Henry VI de POMEROY Knight [son of Henry V de POMEROY & N.N.] 1, 2, 3, 4 was christened 5 23 Apr 1265 in Tregony, Cornwall, England. He died 6 Mar 1305 in Berry Pomeroy, Devon, England. Henry married 7 Amice de CAMVILLE on 1 J
2 CONC un 1281 in Berry Pomeroy, Devon, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Amice de CAMVILLE [daughter of Sir Geoffrey de CAMVILLE Lord Canville & Maud de BRYAN] 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7 was born 1269 in Clifton Campville, Staffordshire, England. She died 8 Feb 1340 in Berry Pomeroy, Devon, England. Amice mar
2 CONC ried 9 Sir Henry VI de POMEROY Knight on 1 Jun 1281 in Berry Pomeroy, Devon, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Other marriages
2 CONT
2 CONT MARTIN, William Lord Martin
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT *	F	i	Elizabeth de POMEROY was born 1288 and died 16 Jul 1332.
2 CONT *  		M	ii	Sir Henry VII de POMEROY Knight was born 27 Sep 1291 and died 22 Oct 1367.
2 CONT *  		F	iii	Isabel de POMEROY 1 was born 1294 in Berry Pomeroy, Devon, England.
2 CONT *  		F	iv	Juliana de POMEROY was born 1300 and died 26 Apr 1360.
2 CONT
