2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Owain Ap Griffin-Gruffydd De La Pole b: 1257 in Montgomeryshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Joan Corbet b: 1266 in Moreton, Oswestry, Shropshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 John De Cherleton b: 1269 in Cherleton Inn, Wrockwardine, Shropshire, England. Hawis married Sir John DE CHERLETON 1st Baron Cherleton of Powys, son of Robert DE CHERLETON and Eleanor (Elinor) DE HOLAND, before 26 Aug 1
2 CONC 309 553. (Sir John DE CHERLETON 1st Baron Cherleton of Powys was born about 1280 in Cherleton, Wrockwardine, Shropshire, England and died before Dec 1353 in Powis Castle, Welshpool, Montgomeryshire, Wales.)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Married: 26 Jul 1309
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT    1. Has Children Isabelle De Cherleton b: 1308 in Malpas, Cheshire, England
