2 CONT
2 CONT      Hawys Gadarn also went by the name of Hawys "the Hardy".3 Also called Hawise de La Pole.5 She was born in 1291.3 She was the daughter of Owen ap Griffith, Prince of Powys Wenwynwyn and Johanna Corbet.2,3,4 Hawys Gadarn marrie
2 CONC d John, 1st Lord Cherleton of Powys, son of Sir Alan de Charlton Knt., of Appley Castle.4
2 CONT
