1 NOTE {geni:about_me} See Peter Batrum, https://cadair.aber.ac.uk/dspace/bitstream/handle/2160/5572/Bleddyn%20ap%20Cynfyn%2030.png?sequence=1&isAllowed=y (May 6, 2017; Anne Brannen, curator)
