2 CONT '''Sir Fulk IV FitzWarin, 1st Lord FitzWarin, Baron of Whittington Castle'''1,2,3,4,5
2 CONT
2 CONT '''b. 14 September 1251, d. 24 November 1315
2 CONT
2 CONT * Father	Sir Fulk III FitzWarin6 d. 14 May 1264
2 CONT * Mother	Constance de Tony6 d. b 11 Aug 1289
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir Fulk IV FitzWarin, 1st Lord FitzWarin, Baron of Whittington Castle was born on 14 September 1251 at Whittington, Shropshire, England.3 He married Margaret de la Pole''', daughter of Sir Griffith ap Gwenwynwyn de la Pole, Pr
2 CONC ince of Upper Powys and Hawise le Strange, '''before 25 February 1277; They had 3 sons''' (Sir Fulk, 2nd Lord FitzWarin; Sir William; & John) '''& 2 daughters''' (Hawise, wife of Ralph de Goushill, & of Sir Robert de Hoo; & Mabel)
2 CONC .3 '''Sir Fulk IV FitzWarin, 1st Lord FitzWarin, Baron of Whittington Castle died on 24 November 1315 at age 64.3
2 CONT
2 CONT Family
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Margaret de la Pole d. 11 May 1336
2 CONT
2 CONT Children	
2 CONT * Hawise FitzWarin+3,7,4,5 b. c 1275, d. 2 Sep 1344
2 CONT * Sir Fulk V FitzWarin, 2nd Lord FitzWarin+2,3 b. 1277, d. c 6 Jun 1336
2 CONT * Sir William FitzWarin, Governor of Montgomery Castle+8,3 b. c 1316, d. 28 Oct 1361 or 3 Nov 1361
2 CONT * 
2 CONT
