2 CONT Name Sir William FitzWarin KG [49, FitzWarin article, Vol V, pp. 512-3], [62, p. 58], 19G Grandfather  Death 18 Oct 1361  Burial Wantage, Berks (MI)  General Of Whittington, Salop, etc. Campaigned in France. KG 26: c. 1349; S 25. 
2 CONT
