2 CONT *'''     Angharad fil Morgan ap Meredith was born circa 1298 at of Cyfoeth Meredydd, Gwynllwg, Monmouthshire, Wales, England.2 She married Llewelyn ap Ivor, Lord St. Clear, son of Ifor ap Llywelyn and Tangwystl ferch Rhys, circa 1
2 CONC 318 at England.2
2 CONT *'''Family      Llewelyn ap Ivor, Lord St. Clear b. c 1280
