2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Roger I Vaughan Lord Bredwardine was born in 1341 in Bredwardine, Herefordshire, England. He had one son with Dame Anne Margaret Devereux in 1377. He died in Agincourt, Meurthe-et-Moselle, France.
