2 CONT *'''     Eustace Whitney, Esq. married Joan Trussell''', daughter of Sir William Trussell, Sheriff of Staffordshire and Margery Ludlow;'''His 1st wife; they had 1 son''', Robert.1,3,2 '''Eustace Whitney, Esq. died in 1481 at of Wh
2 CONC itney & Colepychard, Herefordshire, England.1
2 CONT *'''Family Joan Trussell  
2 CONT *Child 
2 CONT **Sir Robert Whitney, Sheriff of Herefordshire+1,2 b. c 1418, d. c 6 Oct 1494
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *1.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 104.
2 CONT *2.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. I, p. 190.
