2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Information:
2 CONT Bertram married Emma FOSSARD, daughter of William FOSSARD Lord of Mulgrave and Unknown. (Emma FOSSARD was born about 1140 in Mulgrave Castle, Sandsend/Whitby, Yorkshire, England.)
