2 CONT from Burke's Peerage (p. 897): "Richard de Talbot mentioned in Domesday Book as holding nine hides of land from Walter Giffard, Earl of Buckingham. This Richard m. the daughter of Gerard de Gournay, Baron of Yarmouth...." 
