1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ====Absence of Parental Evidence
2 CONT * No solid evidence proves that a https://www.geni.com/people/Geoffrey-de-Say/6000000006906655592?through=6000000003243522969 and a https://www.geni.com/people/Hawise-de-Clare/6000000006906640113?through=6000000006906655592 were p
