2 CONC ion against Stephen 1144; married Beatrice (died 19 April 1197 or some year before it), daughter of William de Mandeville, sister of 1st Earl of Essex and divorced wife of Hugh Talebot, and was allegedly killed in an attack on Bur
2 CONC well Castle, Cambs, along with his brother-in-law, 1st Earl of Essex Aug 1144, though he may well have died later." [Ref: Burke's Peerage]
