2 CONT GEOFFREY de Say (c. 1135 - c.1213).  He had seizin of the inheritance of his first cousin William de Mandeville Earl of Essex, in right of his mother, until it passed to Geoffrey FitzPiers, the husband of his niece, who was the se
2 CONC nior claimant.  m firstly as her second husband, ALICE Maminot,  m secondly ALICE de Vere, daughter of AUBREY de Vere Earl of Oxford & his third wife Agnes de Essex.  Geoffrey & his second wife had two children:  William and Geoff
