1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The heir, Hamon, was declared a bastard, and died with no heirs,  but the sisters and their heirs eventually inherited the ancient barony of Dunham Massey. [Paul C Reed (Reedpcgen), soc.genealogy.medieval] 2238
