2 CONT
2 CONT 	Child of Richard De Massey is: 			
2 CONT 	.	i.	HAMON De Massey was born 1313 in Dunham Massey, Cheshire, England, and died 1349 in England. He married Margery (Matilda) Timperley  Abt 1328 in Knowsley, Lancashire, England. She was born 1320 in Timperley, Cheshire, Englan
2 CONC d, and died Aft 1349 in England.
