2 CONT i)          MATILDA .  John Bishop of Lincoln authorised the substitution of two regular canons at Oxford St Frideswide, for the souls of “domine Elizabeth de Monte Acuto ac domini Willelmi de Monte Acuto mariti eiusdem domine E..
2 CONC .Alicie de Aubeneye, domine Marie Cogan, Elizabeth priorisse de Haliwell, domine Hawise Bauent, domine Matildis abbatisse de Berkyng, domine Isabelle sancte monialis de Berkyng, liberorum dictorum dominorum W. & E.”, charter dated
2 CONC  1 Mar 1380[1943].  Abbess of Barking. 
