2 CONT j)          ISABEL .  John Bishop of Lincoln authorised the substitution of two regular canons at Oxford St Frideswide, for the souls of “domine Elizabeth de Monte Acuto ac domini Willelmi de Monte Acuto mariti eiusdem domine E...
