2 CONT
2 CONT >Alice Montagu, eldest daughter, who married, before 27 January 1333, as his first wife, Sir Ralph Daubeney (3 March 1305 to c.1378), by whom she was the mother of Sir Giles Daubeney (d. 24 June 1386).[13][14]
