2 CONT
2 CONT Resting place 	Bisham Abbey, Berkshire
2 CONT
2 CONT Nationality 	English
2 CONT
2 CONT Other names 	William Montacute
2 CONT
2 CONT Years active 	c. 1320–1344
2 CONT
2 CONT Known for 	Service to Edward III
2 CONT
