2 CONT
2 CONT ALICE de Oilly .  The primary source which confirms her parentage and marriage has not yet been identified.   m ARNULF de Mandeville, son of GEOFFREY de Mandeville Earl of Essex & his wife Rohese de Vere (-1178).  
2 CONT
