2 CONT Last Edited=29 Feb 2004
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard Basset married Maud Ridel, daughter of Geoffrey Ridel.1 He died between 16 September 1144 and 29 May 1147.1,2
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard Basset lived at Drayton, Staffordshire, England.1 He held the office of Justiciar.1
