1 NAME Oliver /de Vaux/ Patron of Pentney, Baron Dalston
2 GIVN Oliver
2 SURN de Vaux
2 NSFX Patron of Pentney, Baron Dalston
2 _MARNM de Vaux
2 NICK Sir Oliver de Vaux alias Vallibus
2 NICK Knt.
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1170
