2 CONT From Camville-les-Deux-Eglises ... He was twice married, first to Alice (Bl Add Ch 28324), and secondly to Milisent, widow of Robert Marmion of Tamworth (d.1143-44), a kinswoman of Queen Adelicia. His charter for Jumièges granting
2 CONC  land at Hautot-l'Auvray mentioned both wives (Vernier, Chartes de Jumièges ii, 1). ... He had issue his successor Gerard (d.1214), Richard II (d.1224) and a daughter Matilda (b.c. 1145), wife of William de Ros (Rot de Dom., 84) .
2 CONC ..
