2 CONT born 1155 Somersetshire, England
2 CONT died 1185 Somersetshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings: unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouse:''' Mabel Alice Bassett
2 CONT born about 1170 Hedinton, Oxon, England
2 CONT died about 1264 
2 CONT married about 1204 Bolington, England
2 CONT
