2 CONT Not the son of https://www.geni.com/people/Henry-Bisset-of-Rockbourne/6000000110925690822?through=6000000000700952904 & Iseult.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==concerns==
2 CONT '''Stirnet's "Temp86" page (link below) identifies this John's parents as Henry Bisset of Rockbourne and his wife Iseuld NN.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==family==
2 CONT From Stirnet's "Temp86" page (link below): "This appears to be the 'John, Lord Biset, Baron of Combe-Biset in Wiltshire, and of East Bridgeford near Whatton' who is reported by ''Commoners'' (vol 4, Whatton of Leicestershire) to h
2 CONC ave married ... <Alice Basset.>"
2 CONT
2 CONT ==comments==
2 CONT Date and place of birth have also been (erroneously?) reported to be circa 1176 at Combe, Wiltshire, England.
2 CONT
