2 CONC er de Montgomery, Earl of Shrewsbury.3 Robert fitz Hamon, Lord of Glamorgan sustained serious injuries in 1105.3 He died in 1107. The grants of Robert and his knights to Tewksbury were confirmed in 1109, two years after his death.
