2 CONT Tour of the Abbey 
2 CONT Lord of Bristol refers to Robert fitzHamon as Lord of Bristol, which town and castle became important to his son-in-law. 
2 CONT Robert of Caen, son-in-law is said here to be grandson of a Welsh prince but most other sources say that his mother was an unnamed woman of Caen. 
