2 CONT      Sybil Montgomery married Robert FitzHamon, Seigneur de Creully in Calvados & Torigny-in-Manche, Governor of Caen, son of Hamon de Crevecoeur, Baron Thoringni, Tewksbury.2 Sybil Montgomery married Jean, Sire de Raimes. Sybil M
2 CONC ontgomery was born circa 1058 at of Montgomery, Montgomeryshire, Wales. She died in 1107. Family 	Robert FitzHamon, Seigneur de Creully in Calvados & Torigny-in-Manche, Governor of Caen b. c 1050, d. Mar 1107 Children	
