2 CONT  ROBERT FitzRobert (-1170).  The 1155 Pipe Roll records "Rob. fil. Com. Gloecestr." in Somerset[1512].  Named in charters in [1160], and addressed as Castellan of Gloucester[1513].  Robert of Torigny records the death in 1170 of "
2 CONC Roberto filio Roberti comitis Gloecestriæ"[1514].  [1515]m ([1147]) HAWISE de Reviers, daughter of BALDWIN de Reviers Earl of Devon & his first wife Adelisa --- (-[1215]).  The 1194/95 Pipe Roll records "Agnes uxor Roberti f comit
2 CONC is de Gloecr" in Lincolnshire[1516].  Robert & his wife had one child:  
2 CONT
2 CONT a)         [1517]MABEL .  m firstly JORDAN de Chambernon, son of ---.  m secondly WILLIAM de Soliers, son of ---.  
