2 CONT
2 CONT Geoffrey married Hawisa Fergant of Brittany (abt. 1105-?). They had two sons, Vicomte Eudes II Porhoet (1122-?) and Alan la Zouche(1132-?). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Porhoët
2 CONT
