2 NICK De Gernon
1 NAME Ranulph De Gernon /De Meschines/
1 NAME Ranulf de Gernon, 4th Earl of Chester
1 SEX M
1 OCCU unknown
2 PLAC Earl of Chester
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1099
2 ADDR
3 CITY Castle Gernon or Capelle-les-Grands, Eure, Upper Normandy, France
1 BURI
2 DATE 16 DEC 1153
