2 CONT Hugh, 5th Earl of Chester Kevelioc was born in 1147 in Monmouth, Monmouthshire, Wales, the son of Maud and Ranulph. He had one son and four daughters with Bertha, Countess of Chester MONTFORT between 1171 and 1180. He died as a yo
2 CONC ung father on June 30, 1181, at the age of 34.
2 CONT
