1 NAME Sir Ralph de Gorges, of Litton & Wraxall
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1230
2 PLAC Litton
2 ADDR
3 CITY Clutton
3 STAE England
3 CTRY United Kingdom
1 DEAT
2 DATE 24 OCT 1271
2 PLAC Wraxall
