2 CONT [MILLICENT .  A manuscript narrating the foundation of Wigmore Abbey records that “Milesaunt filia --- comitis Derbeyæ” was the first wife of “domini Rogeri”[245].  This has not been corroborated from other primary sources, but, i
2 CONC f it is correct, her father must have been William 3rd Earl.  m as his first wife, ROGER de Mortimer, son of HUGH de Mortimer & his wife Matilda Meschin of Skipton-in-Craven [Chester] (-before 19 Aug 1214, bur Wigmore).] 
2 CONT
