2 CONC , Frederick Lewis Ancestral Roots of Certain American Colonist Who Came To America Before 1700 (7th ed.), line 136-24 Davies, Norman, The Isles: A History Barber, Richard, Henry Plantagenet Warren, W.L. (1973). Henry II. ISBN 0-52
2 CONC 0-03494-5.
2 CONT ----
