2 CONT ROBERT MORTIMER, BARON OF BURFORD
2 CONT
2 CONT In June 1211 Robert Mortimer of Essex married the widowed Margaret Say and consequently held Richard's Castle for the rest of his life in right of his wife, although he only seems to have managed to acquire 5 1/2 fees of the baron
2 CONC y initially.  Robert Mortimer died in the summer of 1219, around the same time as he was presented by Margaret Say with a son and heir, Hugh Mortimer (d. 1275).
2 CONT
