1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Herdon Prideaux, inherited from his father considerable estates in Devonshire, and augmented them by marrying the heiress of Sir Ralph Orcharton, of Orcharton, in that county. He left a son, Sir Richard Prideaux of
2 CONC  Orcharton, who m. Elizabeth, daughter of Roger Mortimer, Earl of March, and was s. by his son, Sir Jeffery Prideaux, of Orcharton, who d. in 1243, leaving by his wife Isabella, daughter of William Montacute, Earl of Salisbury, a 
2 CONC son and successor, Sir Piers Prideaux, of Orcharton. This gentleman wedded Joan, daughter of Sir William Bigbury, and was father of Sir Ralph Prideaux, of Orcharton
