2 CONT
2 CONT EMMA Corbet .  A writ after the death of "Beatrice late the wife of Peter Corbet of Caus", dated "30 Aug 21 Edw III", names "Thomas Corbet…from whom issued Peter, Alice the elder daughter and Emma the younger", that "from Emma iss
2 CONC ued one Walter" who "had issue one Brian…and from him issued Margaret his firstborn and Elizabeth the younger", that "Margaret is espoused to Robert de Harleys and…Elizabeth to Edmund de Cornubia"[2033].  '''m BRIAN de Brampton, s
2 CONC on of ---'''. 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/enguntac.htm#RobertIIICorbetdied1219B
2 CONT ----
