2 CONT Bertha de Braose was born on 1151 to William de Braose, 3rd Lord of Bramber and Bertha de Pitres de Braose.  Bertha married Walter de Beauchamp on c. 1175 and had children, including Walcherine de Beauchamp who married Joan Mortim
