1 OCCU 2nd Earl of Warwick, EARL OF WARWICK (2ND), CRUSADER, Crusader., Second Earl of Warrick, English Nobleman, @occu00015@, Baron, de Neubourg, d'Asnebec, Sieur, de Livarot, Sénéchal, Lieutenant, Gouverneur, de Normandie, Earl of Warw
