2 CONT
2 CONT      Roger de Newburgh, 2nd Earl of Warwick was the son of Henry de Newburgh, 1st Earl of Warwick and Margaret de Perche.2 He married Gundred de Warenne, daughter of William II de Warenne, 2nd Earl of Surrey and Elizabeth de Verma
2 CONC ndois.1 He died on 12 June 1153.1
2 CONT
2 CONT      Roger de Newburgh, 2nd Earl of Warwick gained the title of 2nd Earl of Warwick.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Roger de Newburgh, 2nd Earl of Warwick and Gundred de Warenne
