2 CONT Citations
2 CONT
2 CONT [S22] Sir Bernard Burke, C.B. LL.D., A Genealogical History of the Dormant, Abeyant, Forfeited, and Extinct Peerages of the British Empire, new edition (1883; reprint, Baltimore, Maryland: Genealogical Publishing Company, 1978), p
2 CONC age 569. Hereinafter cited as Burkes Extinct Peerage.
2 CONT
2 CONT [S22] Burke, Burkes Extinct Peerage, page 399.
