1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Isabel le Despenser''' (1312–1356) was the eldest daughter of Hugh Despenser the Younger and Eleanor de Clare. She was descended from Edward I of England through her mother, while her father is famous for being 
2 CONC the favorite of Edward II of England.
2 CONT
2 CONT On 9 February 1321 at the royal manor Havering-atte-Bower, Isabel was duly married to Richard FitzAlan, the heir to the earldom of Arundel.[2] Isabel was only eight at the time, while Richard was fifteen (not seven as has been cla
2 CONC imed). Their respective ages would come up later when Richard would try to seek an annulment.[1] Richard and Isabel had one son, Edmund Fitzalan, born in 1327, and in 1331 Isabel's husband became earl of Arundel. However in Decemb
2 CONC er 1344 Richard Fitzalan had their marriage annulled on the grounds that he had never freely consented to marry Isabel and that they both had renounced their vows at puberty but had been "forced by blows to cohabit, so that a son 
2 CONC was born".[1] Isabel retired to several manors in Essex that were given to her by her ex-husband. After receiving a papal dispensation, Richard married Isabel's first cousin Eleanor of Lancaster, with whom he had apparently been h
2 CONC aving an affair.[1] Richard and Isabel's only child, Edmund Fitzalan, was rendered illegitimate by this annulment and so was unable to inherit his father's earldom. When his father died in 1376 Edmund quarreled with his half-sibli
2 CONC ngs, the children of his father's second marriage, over inheritance rights. Edmund was imprisoned in the Tower of London until he was released in 1377 by request of his brothers-in-law. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Isabel_le_Despenser,_Countess_of_Arundel
2 CONT
2 CONT there was a death date of 30/6/1376 but I couldn't find any source to this fact
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Isabel_le_Despenser,_Countess_of_Arundel
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Isabel Despencer (daughter of Hugh le Despencer - "The Younger and Eleanor de Clare). She married (1) Richard Fitzalan-10th Earl of Arundel on February 09, 1319/20 in Kings Chapel, Havering-Atte-Bower, Essex, Eng.. She married (2)
2 CONC  Richard Fitzalan on 1321.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Isabel Despencer and Richard Fitzalan-10th Earl of Arundel: Marriage: February 09, 1319/20, Kings Chapel, Havering-Atte-Bower, Essex, Eng..
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Isabel Despencer and Richard Fitzalan: Marriage: 1321
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Isabel Despencer and Richard Fitzalan-10th Earl of Arundel are:
2 CONT
2 CONT *   +Phillippa Fitzalan, b. 1349.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Marriage annulled: 1344 
