2 CONT
2 CONT      Margaret Hastings was born circa 1309.1 She was the daughter of Sir John de Hastings, 1st Lord Hastings and Isabel le Despenser.1 She married, firstly, William Martyn, Lord Camoys, son of William Camoys and Eleanor FitzPiers.
2 CONC 1 She married, secondly, Robert de Waterville.1 She died on 7 July 1359.1
2 CONT
2 CONT       Her married name became Martyn.1
