2 CONC idgeshire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth le DESPENSER [Parents] 1, 2, 3, 4 was born 1297 in Barton, Gloucestershire, England. She died after 7 Jul 1326. Elizabeth married 5 Sir Ralph III de CAMOYS Lord Camoys on Apr 1316 in Bourn, Cambridgeshire, England.
2 CONT
