2 CONT *  		F	iv	 Isabel CAMOYS Abbess of Romsey 1, 2 was born 1323 in Bourn, Cambridgeshire, England. She died 1396 in Romsey, Hampshire, England.
2 CONT *  		M	v	 Hugh de CAMOYS 1 was born 1325 in Bourn, Cambridgeshire, England.
2 CONT
