1 NAME Sir Geoffrey de Say, Constable of Rochester Castle
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1309
2 ADDR
3 CITY Sawbridgeworth
3 CTRY England
1 DEAT
2 DATE 26 JUN 1359
2 ADDR
