2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p3200.htm#i31995
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Thomas of Astley, 3rd Lord Astley''' [1]
2 CONT * '''M''', #31995, 
2 CONT *  '''b'''. before 1308, 
2 CONT * '''d.''' after 3 May 1366
2 CONT * Last Edited=7 Nov 2008
2 CONT * Thomas of Astley, 3rd Lord Astley was '''born before''' 1308.[1] 
2 CONT * He was the '''son of''' Sir Giles of Astley and Alice Wolvey.[1] 
2 CONT * He '''married''' Elizabeth de Beauchamp, 
2 CONT ** '''daughter of''' Guy de Beauchamp, 10th Earl of Warwick and Alice de Toni, before 1336/37.[1] 
2 CONT * He '''died after''' 3 May 1366.[1]
2 CONT * On 27 March 1326 he had seizin [= take possession of land], having proved his age.[1] 
2 CONT * He '''succeeded to the title''' of 3rd Lord Astley [E., 1295] on 25 February 1342/43, by writ.[1] 
2 CONT * He founded a chantry in the parish church of Astley.[1] 
2 CONT * He had three younger children.[2]
2 CONT ** '''Children of Thomas of Astley, 3rd Lord Astley and Elizabeth de Beauchamp'''
2 CONT *** 1. Sir Thomas Astley [2]
2 CONT *** 2. William of Astley, 4th Lord Astley+[1] b. b 1344, d. a 1370
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
