2 CONT 47514122. '''Baron of Astley Thomas Baron Of Astley''', 
2 CONT * '''born''' Abt. 1305 in Astley, Warwickshire, England; 
2 CONT * '''died''' Abt. 1385. 
2 CONT * He was '''the son of''' 95028244. Giles Astley and 95028245. Alice Wolvey. 
2 CONT * He '''married''' 47514123. Elizabeth De Beauchamp '''Bet. 1336 - 1337''' in Astley, Warwickshire, England. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 47514123. '''Elizabeth De Beauchamp''', 
2 CONT * '''born''' Abt. 1305 in Warwick Castle, Warwickshire, England; 
2 CONT * '''died''' 1359. 
2 CONT * She was '''the daughter of''' 5814348. Earl of Warwick Guy De Beauchamp Earl Of Warwick and 5814349. Countess of Warwick Alice De Toeni Countess Of Warwick.         '''Children of Thomas Astley and Elizabeth Beauchamp are:''' 
2 CONT * i.  '''Baron of Astley Thomas Baron Of Astley''', 
2 CONT ** '''born''' Abt. 1343 in Nailston, Leicestershire, England; 
2 CONT ** '''died''' Aft. 1399; 
2 CONT ** '''married''' Elizabeth Harcourt '''Abt'''. 1364 in Harcourt, Lancashire, England.
2 CONT * ii.  '''Baron of Astley William Baron Of Astley''', 
2 CONT ** '''born''' Bet. 1344 - 1345 in Astley, Warwickshire, England;  
2 CONT ** '''died''' 18 Oct 1404 in Spm, Astley, Warwickshire, England; 
2 CONT ** '''married''' Baroness of Astely Joan Willoughby Baronness Of Astley Abt. 1361 in Lincolnshire, England. 
2 CONT * 23757061  iii. '''Alice Astley''', 
2 CONT ** '''born''' Abt. 1347 in Estleigh, Devonshire, England; 
2 CONT ** '''married''' Sir Knight Sir Richard Champernon Abt. 1381 in Devonshire, England.
2 CONT * iv.  '''Giles Astley''', 
2 CONT ** '''born''' Abt. 1347 in Wolvey, Warwickshire, England; 
2 CONT ** '''died''' Bet. 1427 - 1428 in Dunstable; 
2 CONT ** '''married''' Katherine Unknown Abt. 1389 in Astley, Warwickshire, England.
2 CONT  ***************************
