2 CONT Son of of the 3rd Baron Thomas de Astley and his wife Elizabeth de Beauchamp.
2 CONT Married 1361 to Joan Willoughby . Your father in law and mother in law were John Willoughby and Cecily de Ufford .
2 CONT You and Joan were blessed with a daughter Joane d'Astley born 1366 and married to Lord Reginald de Grey the 3rd Baron of de Ruthin .
