2 CONT **Sir Thomas Beauchamp, 12th Earl of Warwick, Admiral of the North Fleet, Sheriff of Worcestershire+22,4,9 b. b 16 Mar 1339, d. 8 Apr 1401
2 CONT **Agnes Beauchamp b. c 1341
