3 CONC ed by his brother Prince Richard. The coronation was cancelled.
3 CONT 1483	The thirteen year old King and his ten year old brother mysteriously disappeared in the Tower after being declared illegitimate. They were believed to have been murdered and are referred to as the Little Princes in the Tower
