2 CONT 1558 - 1603 Elizabeth I (Henry's daughter by Anne Boleyn)
2 CONT 1563 The Black Death ( Bubonic Plague ) broke out in London
2 CONT 1564 Ambrose Dudley was created Baron Lisle. His brother Robert Dudley was a great favourite of Queen Elizabeth I and was created Earl of Leicester.
