2 CONT *'''Isabel de Beauchamp1,2,3,4,5,6 
2 CONT *'''F, #44767, d. 29 September 1416
2 CONT *Father      Sir Thomas de Beauchamp, 11th Earl of Warwick, Sheriff of Worcestershire, Warwickshire, & Leicestershire, Marshal of England7,3,4,8,6 b. c 14 Feb 1314, d. 13 Nov 1369
2 CONT *Mother     Katherine de Mortimer7,3,8,6 d. 4 Aug 1369
2 CONT *'''     Isabel de Beauchamp married Sir John le Strange, 5th Baron Strange of Blackmere, son of Sir John le Strange, 4th Lord Strange of Blackmere and Mary FitzAlan, before 3 November 1362; They had 1 daughter (Elizabeth, wife of
2 CONC  Sir Thomas de Mowbray, Duke of Norfolk, Earl Marshal & Nottingham).9,2,3,4,5,6 Isabel de Beauchamp married Sir William Ufford, 2nd Earl of Suffolk, Lord Ufford, Admiral of the Fleet towards the North, son of Sir Robert de Ufford,
2 CONC  1st Earl Suffolk, 2nd Lord Ufford and Margaret Norwich, circa 12 June 1376; No issue.10,2,3,5,6 Isabel de Beauchamp left a will on 26 September 1416.2,3,6 She died on 29 September 1416; Buried at Campsey Priory, Suffolk.1,2,3,6 H
2 CONC er estate was probated on 28 October 1416.2,3,6
2 CONT *'''Family 1      Sir John le Strange, 5th Baron Strange of Blackmere b. c 1353, d. 3 Aug 1375
