1 NAME Alice /Beauchamp/
2 GIVN Alice
2 SURN Beauchamp
2 _MARNM Beauchamp
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1366
2 ADDR
3 STAE England
3 CTRY United Kingdom
1 DEAT
2 DATE 2 FEB 1443
