2 CONT *''''''     Joan Clopton is the daughter of Sir William Clopton.1 She married Sir John Cavendish, son of Sir John Cavendish and Alice de Odyngseles.1
2 CONT *''''''      Her married name became Cavendish.1
2 CONT *''''''Children of Joan Clopton and Sir John Cavendish
