2 CONT *''''''     Joan de Clopton was born circa 1338 at Hawstead, Suffolk, England. She married Sir Walter Wolcot circa 1358 at of Gunton, Norfolk, England.4 Joan de Clopton married Sir Roger de Beauchamp, son of Sir Roger de Beauchamp
2 CONC , 1st Baron Beauchamp of Bletsoe, Captain of Calais and Sibyl de Pateshulle, circa 1361; They had 1 son (Sir Roger) and 1 daughter (Margaret, wife of Robert Mauteby, Esq.).3,2 Joan de Clopton married Sir John Cavendish, son of Sir
