2 CONC obert Mauteby, Esq.).4,2,3 Joan de Clopton married Sir John Cavendish, son of Sir John Cavendish and Alice Odingsells, after 15 May 1374.6 Joan de Clopton died circa 1388 at of Bletsoe, Bedfordshire, England.4,2,3
