2 CONT He was born at Bletso, Bedfordshire, England.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Roger Beauchamp.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Mary (?).1 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 13 May 1406 at age 43.2
2 CONT
2 CONT  In 1384 he had livery of all of his lands, including Bletsoe, Bedfordshire and Spelsbury, Oxfordshire and Lydiard Tregoz, Wiltshire.1,2 He was invested as a Knight before 18 February 1393.1,2 In 1395 he attended the King into Ire
2 CONC land.1 He held the office of Member of Parliament (M.P.) for Bedfordshire in 1399.2 His last will was dated 11 March 1406.2
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Sir Roger Beauchamp and Mary (?)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * John Beauchamp+1 d. Apr 1412
2 CONT
