2 CONT * '''Sir Walter Blount''' (1)
2 CONT * '''d. 21 July 1403
2 CONT * Last Edited=20 Oct 2009
2 CONT * '''Sir Walter Blount was the son of John Blount and Eleanor Beauchamp.2 He married Sancha de Ayala, daughter of Diego Gomez de Toledo and Inez Alfonsa de Ayala. He died on 21 July 1403 at Shrewsbury, Shropshire, England, killed 
2 CONC in action.
2 CONT * '''Sir Walter Blount fought in the Battle of Shrewsbury on 21 July 1403 and is listed as dying the same day.
2 CONT * '''Children of Sir Walter Blount and Sancha de Ayala
2 CONT ** 1. Constance Blount+1 d. Sep 1432 
2 CONT ** 2. Thomas Blount+2 b. 1390, d. 1456 
2 CONT
