2 CONT * '''Walter BLOUNT (Sir Knight)'''
2 CONT * '''Born:''' 1350, Elwaston, Derbyshire, England
2 CONT * '''Died:''' 21 Jul 1403, Shrewsbury, Shropshire, England
2 CONT * '''Buried:''' Jul 1403, St. Mary's, Newark, Leicester, England
2 CONT * '''Father:''' John BLOUNT (Sir)
2 CONT * '''Mother:''' Eleanor De BEAUCHAMP / Isolda MOUNTJOY
2 CONT * '''Married:''' Sancha De AYALA (b. 1360 - d. 1418) ABT 1371
2 CONT * '''Children:'''
2 CONT **1. '''Constance''' BLOUNT
2 CONT **2. '''Thomas''' BLOUNT (Sir)
2 CONT **3. '''James''' BLOUNT (Sir)
2 CONT **4. '''John''' BLOUNT (Sir)
