2 CONT * Siblings:	Marguerite De Beauchamp (Beauchamp), Robert De Beauchamp (Beauchamp)
2 CONT * Wife:	Isabel De Beauchamp (born Deferrers)
2 CONT * Children:	Richard De Beauchamp (Beauchamp), 
2 CONT * Elizabeth De Beauchamp (Beauchamp), 
