2 CONT Comments
2 CONT
2 CONT From http://cybergata.com/roots/3570.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT The William Boteler who married Elizabeth Argentine was NOT William Boteler of Warrington as often claimed in print. I went around the mulberry bush on that one, too, before I got it straightened out. Elizabeth Argentine actually 
2 CONC married (lst) before 1326, William Boteler, son of Ralph Boteler, of Pulverbatch, co. Salop; married (2nd) after 1336 and before 1349, Gilbert de Elsfield. She was still living 1376, and died soon after without issue.
2 CONT
2 CONT My source for this is: Victoria County History of Hertford, 4:111-112.
2 CONT
2 CONT Subject: Elizabeth Argentine, wife of William Boteler Date: 2 Feb 1999 00:23:59 GMT
