2 CONT
2 CONT 1398 Burke reports that William FitzHerbert, of Norbury, was alive in 1363-1398. [2][3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Burke reports that William Fitzherbert married Alice, daughter of Nicholas Longford, of Longford, Derbyshire and they had son Henry Fitzherbert. [4][5]
