2 CONT *Foulds, Trevor. The Thurgarton Cartulary. Paul Watkins, Stamford, 1994. p. cxvii.  Table 2: Deyncourt Secondary Branch. [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000156914237830 link]
2 CONT
