1 NOTE {geni:about_me}     From: <DadGenes@aol.com>
2 CONT
2 CONT     Subject: Re: Ancestry of Alianor le Strange, wife of Reynold de Grey
2 CONT
2 CONT     Date: Thu, 13 Apr 2000 12:39:23 EDT
2 CONT
2 CONT     In a message dated 4/12/00 1:02:44 PM, AChanning@compuserve.com writes:
2 CONT
2 CONT     << I have had a quick look at the two CP refs you mention:
2 CONT
2 CONT     CP 1:339/40
2 CONT
2 CONT     He [James Audley/Aldithley) Ld Audley] m., 2ndly, before Dec 1351, Isabel,
2 CONT
2 CONT     said to have been da of Roger (Le Strange) 5th Lord Strange of Knokyn. CP
2 CONT
2 CONT     Vol XIV (additions and corrections) states that Roger 5th Lord Strange was
2 CONT
2 CONT     not born till c1326 and m. as a child in or before 1338.
2 CONT
2 CONT     So CP "said to have been" could not confirm this marriage and Vol XIV
2 CONT
2 CONT     infers it was hardly possible..
2 CONT
2 CONT     [snip of response related to other parts of original query]
2 CONT
2 CONT     I hope this helps a little, in haste
2 CONT
2 CONT     Adrian>>
2 CONT
2 CONT     >
2 CONT
2 CONT     >
2 CONT
2 CONT     > In part 2 of his post on the ancestry of Elizabeth Fitz Hugh dated 4/4/00
2 CONT
2 CONT     > 1:08:50 PM, UTZ@aol.com writes:
2 CONT
2 CONT     >
2 CONT
2 CONT     > [snip of material not related to this question]
2 CONT
2 CONT     >
2 CONT
2 CONT     > << 22. Roger le Strange (Source: CP, 1:339.), born Abt. 1327 in of
2 CONT
2 CONT     > Knockin,
2 CONT
2 CONT     > Salop, ENG (Source: Complete Peerage, by Cokayne, Vol V, pp 426-431); died
2 CONT
2 CONT     26
2 CONT
2 CONT     > August 1381. He was the son of Roger le Strange and Maud. He married 23.
2 CONT
2 CONT     > Alaive FitzAlan.
2 CONT
2 CONT     > 23. Alaive FitzAlan She was the daughter of Edmund Fitz Alan and
2 CONT
2 CONT     Alice
2 CONT
2 CONT     > de Warenne.
2 CONT
2 CONT     >
2 CONT
2 CONT     >
2 CONT
2 CONT     >
2 CONT
2 CONT     > Children of Roger and Alaive FitzAlan are:
2 CONT
2 CONT     >
2 CONT
2 CONT     > i. Isabel le Strange, died Aft. 1366; married James Audley Bef.
2 CONT
2 CONT     > December 1351; born 08 January 1312/13 in Knesale, NTT, ENG; died 01 April
2 CONT
2 CONT     > 1386 in Heleigh, STS, ENG. >>
2 CONT
2 CONT     [snip of more material not related to this part of original query]
2 CONT
2 CONT     Adrian,
2 CONT
2 CONT     Thanks for pointing out this inconsistency regarding Isabel. I had
2 CONT
2 CONT     originally focused only on Lucy and Alianor from Dave's original post and had
2 CONT
2 CONT     missed this point. Do you have any clue as to where this Isabel fits in the
2 CONT
2 CONT     Strange family?
2 CONT
2 CONT     John Stuart
