2 CONC mund Fitzalan, 9th Earl of Arundel and Alice de Warenne.1 '''He died on 12 May 1361.3
2 CONT *'''     He gained the title of 4th Lord Strange, of Blackmere.1 He was also known as John le Strange. He was created 1st Lord Lestrange in 1360.
