1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Richard Pembridge married Elizabeth le Strange (d.1362), a daughter of John le Strange, 2nd Baron Strange (1305–1349), of Blackmere, by his wife Ankaret le Boteler, daughter of William Boteler, 1st Baron Boteler (d
2 CONC ied 1334), of Wem. Elizabeth was the widow successively of Edmund St John, 3rd Baron St John (d. 1347), of Basing, who died at the Siege of Calais in 1347, and of Gerard de Lisle, 1st Baron Lisle (1304-1360)of Kingston Lisle. By E
2 CONC lizabeth he had one son:
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry Pembridge (1360-1375), who died at the age of 15 and predeceased his father.
