1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Thomas de Ferrers, Keeper of Channel Islands
2 CONT *Acceded: 10 MAY 1337
2 CONT *Died: JUL 1353
2 CONT *Notes: The Complete Peerage vol.V,p.345, note d.
2 CONT *Father: de Ferrers, William, Lord Ferrers of Groby, b. 30 JAN 1271 & Mother: Ellen
2 CONT * Married to Botiller, Angharad le
