1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Sir Nicholas de Carew, Kt=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of William de Carew and Alice Marshall 
2 CONT * Birth:	circa 1223  in Moulsford, Berkshire, , England
2 CONT * Death:	circa 1297 (65-83) in Carew Castle, Pembrokeshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/CAREW1.htm#Nicholas%20De%20CAREW%20(B.%20Carew)1 The Tudor Place]
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Nicholas De CAREW (B. Carew)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Born: ABT 1223
2 CONT * Died: 1297
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Notes: went to Ireland in 1284.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Father: William De CAREW
2 CONT * Mother: Alice MARSHALL
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: '''Avice TUITT,''' daughter of Daughter of Lord Richard Lord of Marston Tuitt, The Black Lord.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children:=
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1. '''Nicholas De CAREW (Sir)''' Married 1: Amicia PEVERELL, Married 2: Avice MARTIN.
2 CONT
