2 CONT '''     Sir John de Mohun was born circa 1299 at of Dunster, Somersetshire, England.7 A contract for the marriage of Sir John de Mohun and Christian Segrave was signed on 31 March 1305; They had 1 son''' (Sir John, 2nd Lord Mohun)
2 CONC  '''& 2 daughters''' (Margaret, wife of John de Carew, Baron Carew; & Elizabeth).7 '''Sir John de Mohun married Christian Segrave''', daughter of Sir John de Segrave, 2nd Lord Segrave and Christian de Plessetis, '''in May 1305.2,4
2 CONC ,7 Sir John de Mohun died between March 1322 and 1330 at Scotland.'''7
2 CONT '''Family'''
