2 CONT ==Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://books.google.com/books?id=i4UuAAAAMAAJ&pg=RA4-PA143&lpg=RA4-PA143&dq=John+de+meriet+1308&source=bl&ots=FTdhOMFvN4&sig=iodVsBeKSyuLGaJEpBvPwSAb3ss&hl=en&ei=LocfTP3PLsGNnQf7mNXpDQ&sa=X&oi=book_result&ct=result&resnum=2&ved=0
2 CONC CBYQ6AEwAQ#v=onepage&q=John%20de%20meriet%201308&f=false Proceedings], Volumes 27-28 By Somersetshire Archaeological and Natural History Society Pg.104
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife brought him Haccombe, near Newton Abbot, and other lands in Devon and East Cornwall. He lived at Carew Castle, Pembrokeshire, Wales.
