2 CONT ** 3.  [S00058] Doubleday, H.A. & Lord Howard de Walden, The Complete Peerage, 1936 . 4:325 
2 CONT * https://www.british-history.ac.uk/vch/berks/vol4/pp369-379  Hugh Earl of Devon settled the manor for her life in 1361 on Margaret daughter of Sir Guy de Brienne, wife of his grandson Hugh son of Hugh de Courtenay.  That Margaret
2 CONC  evidently died shortly as Hugh remarried about 1663 [sic: 1263].
2 CONT * Early Owners of Torbryan Manor (1936)  Author(s): Alexander. J. J.; Year published: 1936; Origin: DA Transactions; Pages: 197–214 
