2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Holwey-1
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne, wife of Guy de Bryan, was  the daughter of William Holwey, who was born circa 1265 in Devon, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT From http://www.geneajourney.com/brian.html#maudbrian
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Guy de Brian b abt 1222 and unknown first wife was Guy de Brian b abt 1250, d bef 26 Jul 1307. He md Sibyl de Sully abt 1270, daughter of Walter de Sully and Mabel de Somery. She was b abt 1256.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Guy de Brian and Sibyl de Sully was:
2 CONT
2 CONT Guy de Brian b 1283/84, d 17 Jun 1349. He md Alice de Holway abt 1302, daughter of William de Holway. She was b abt 1286, of Holwey, Devonshire, England.
2 CONT NOTES:
2 CONT
2 CONT Despite claims to the contrary, there is no connection between the Brian family and that of Brienne.
2 CONT
