2 CONT
2 CONT Edward de Bohun was born before 1336.1 He was the son of John de Bohun, 1st Lord Bohun and Isabel de Tregoz.1 He married Philippe de Briene, daughter of Guy de Bryan, 1st Lord Bryan.1 He died in January 1361/62, without issue.1
