1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Thomas de Audley, Knt., of Kingston, married Elizabeth Fitz Payn, daughter of Robert Fitz Payn (formerly de Grey), knt., by Elizabeth daughter of Guy de Bryan, K.G. Lord Bryan. They had no issue. Sir Thomas de Audl
2 CONC ey was living 23 April 1379. He died before 1 April 1386. His widow, Elizabeth married (2nd) shortly after 14 March 1386/7 (date of marriage arrangements) (as his 1st wife) Hugh Courtenay, Knt., younger son of Edward de Courtenay,
2 CONC  Knt., by Emeline daughter and heiress of John Dauney, Knt. They had no issue.
2 CONT
