2 CONT
2 CONT Src:Medlands, England Earls 1138-1142.  Elizabeth FitzPayn, widow of Thomas de Audley is NOT the wife of Huge de Courtenay. His first wife was Elizabeth Cogan, widow of Fulk FitzWarin.
