4 CONT 								[2]	Thomas (Sir) Murray, d. 1361 in London.  He married Joanna (Lady of Bothwell) Murray, b. abt 1339 in Strathearn, Perthshire, Scotland (daughter of Maurice (Sir, 1st Earl of Strathearn) Moray and Joanna (Joan) Menteith)
4 CONC , d. Aug 1409.
