2 CONC tration of the Earl of Strafford, and of the First Duke of Ormond. New York Public Library: T. Cadell. p. 194. Jump up  ^ Lodge, John The Peerage of Ireland or, A Genealogical History Of The Present Nobility Of That Kingdom, 1789,
