2 CONT * 2.^ Lodge, John The Peerage of Ireland or, A Genealogical History Of The Present Nobility Of That Kingdom, 1789, Vol IV, p 9.
2 CONT * Richardson, Douglas, and Kimball G. Everingham. Magna Carta Ancestry A Study in Colonial and Medieval Families. Royal ancestry series. Baltimore, Md: Genealogical Pub. Co, 2005. googlebooks Accessed November 9, 2007
2 CONT * Butler family Accessed November 9, 2007
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/James_Butler,_2nd_Earl_of_Ormonde
2 CONT
