1 OCCU 5th Lord Grey of Wilton
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Henry de Grey, 5th Lord Grey of Wilton was born between 1340 and 1351 at of Wilton, Herefordshire, England; Age 28 or 30 in 1370; age 40, 44 or 50 in 1391.2,6,10 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Elizabeth Talbot circa 4 May 1370; They had 2 sons (Sir Richard, 6th Lord Grey of Wilton; & Geoffrey, Esq.) and 2 daughters (Margaret, wife of Sir John, 5th Lord Darcy of Knaith, & 4th Lord Meinell, & of Sir Thomas Swyn
2 CONC ford; & Pernel, wife of Sir Gerard Braybrooke).14,2,3,5,6,7,10 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Henry de Grey, 5th Lord Grey of Wilton died on 22 April 1396 at of Water Eaton in Bletchley & Sherington, Buckinghamshire, England.6,10
2 CONT
2 CONT Family
2 CONT #Elizabeth Talbot d. 10 Jan 1402
2 CONT Children	
2 CONT #Margaret Grey+15,2,3,4,7,8,10 b. c 1381, d. 1 Jun 1454
2 CONT #Pernel Grey+16,17 b. c 1383, d. b 1416
2 CONT #Sir Richard Grey, 6th Baron Grey of Wilton+2,6,10 b. c 1393, d. 13 Aug 1442 or 20 Aug 1442
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Sources
