1 OCCU Knight of the Garter, Grand Constable of France, Lieutenant of Ireland, Lord High Steward of Ireland, Cheif English Captain during the final phase of the One Hundred Years War, 1st Earl of Shrewsbury, 1st Earl of Waterford, 7th Ba
