2 CONT *'''Notes: Knight of the Garter. Lord Talbot 1421. Lord Furnivall, Lord Strange of Blackmere, Earl of Salop, Created Earl of Waterford 17 Jul 1446. Marshal of France, Fought in the French wars under Henry V. Taken prisoner by Joan
2 CONC  of Arc. Killed in battle at Chastillon, near Bordeaux in 1453.
