2 CONT * Son of Richard Talbot and Ankaret (Strange) Talbot
2 CONT * Brother of Gilbert Talbot, Mary (Talbot) Greene, Richard Talbot, Unknown Talbot, Alice (Talbot) de la Mere, Anne * (Talbot) Courtenay, Thomas Talbot and	William Talbot
2 CONT * Husband of Maud (Neville) Talbot — married before 8 Mar 1407 (to 31 May 1423) in Englandmap
2 CONT * Husband of Margaret (Beauchamp) Talbot — married 6 Sep 1425 (to 17 Jul 1453) in Warwick Castlemap
2 CONT * Father of Joan (Talbot) Berkeley, John Talbot KG, Katherine Talbot, Joan Talbot, Elizabeth (Talbot) Mowbray, 
2 CONT * John Talbot and	Eleanor (Talbot) Butler
2 CONT * Died 17 Jul 1453 in Battle of Castillon, Dordogne, Aquitaine, Francemap
