2 CONT M, #215860, b. circa 1336, d. 13 July 1374
2 CONT
2 CONT John Cherleton, 3rd Lord Cherleton|b. c 1336\nd. 13 Jul 1374|p21586.htm#i215860|John Cherleton, 2nd Lord Cherleton|d. b 30 Aug 1360|p21584.htm#i215840|Maud de Mortimer||p21586.htm#i215859|John Cherleton, 1st Lord Cherleton|b. c 12
2 CONC 68\nd. 1353|p285.htm#i2844|Hawyse ap Owen|d. bt Aug 1345 - 1353|p21583.htm#i215826|Roger de Mortimer, 1st Earl of March|b. 1287\nd. 1330|p10697.htm#i106962|Joan de Geneville, Baroness Geneville||p10297.htm#i102965|
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=1 Dec 2008
2 CONT
2 CONT      John Cherleton, 3rd Lord Cherleton was born circa 1336.1 He was the son of John Cherleton, 2nd Lord Cherleton and Maud de Mortimer.1 He married Joan de Stafford, daughter of Ralph de Stafford, 1st Earl of Stafford and Margare
2 CONC t Audley, Baroness Audley.1 He died on 13 July 1374.1
2 CONT
2 CONT      John Cherleton, 3rd Lord Cherleton succeeded to the title of Lord of Powis [feudal baron] in 1360.1 He succeeded to the title of 3rd Lord Cherleton [E., 1313] in 1360.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of John Cherleton, 3rd Lord Cherleton and Joan de Stafford
2 CONT
2 CONT John Cherleton, 4th Lord Cherleton b. 25 Apr 1362, d. 19 Oct 14011 
2 CONT
2 CONT Edward Cherleton, 5th Baron Cherleton+ b. c 1371, d. 14211 
2 CONT
