2 CONT * 19.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 277.
2 CONT *From: http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p367.htm#i11028 ________________
2 CONT *'''Margaret Audley, Baroness Audley1 
2 CONT *'''F, #9864, d. between 1347 and 1351
2 CONT *Last Edited=4 Feb 2013
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.29%
2 CONT *'''     Margaret Audley, Baroness Audley was the daughter of Hugh Audley, 1st and last Earl of Gloucester and Margaret de Clare.1 She married Ralph de Stafford, 1st Earl of Stafford, son of Edmund de Stafford, 1st Lord Stafford a
2 CONC nd Margaret Basset, before 6 July 1336.1 She died between 1347 and 1351.1 She was buried at Tonbridge, Kent, England.2
2 CONT *'''Children of Margaret Audley, Baroness Audley and Ralph de Stafford, 1st Earl of Stafford
2 CONT ** 1.Catherine de Stafford+ d. a 6 Dec 1361
2 CONT ** 2.Beatrice de Stafford+2 d. 14 Apr 1415
2 CONT ** 3.Lady Elizabeth de Stafford3 b. c 1334, d. 7 Aug 1376
2 CONT ** 4.Joan de Stafford+4 b. 1336, d. b 1397
2 CONT ** 5.Sir Ralph Stafford b. b 1344, d. b 1347
2 CONT ** 6.Hugh de Stafford, 2nd Earl of Stafford+1 b. c 1344, d. 13 Oct 1386
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Exti
2 CONC nct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume I, page 346. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT * 2.[S1545] Mitchell Adams, "re: West Ancestors," e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lundy, 6 December 2005 - 19 June 2009. Hereinafter cited as "re: West Ancestors."
2 CONT * 3.[S6] Cokayne, and others, The Complete Peerage, volume III, page 353.
