1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Beatrice de STAFFORD (1342-1415) [Pedigree] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Sir Ralph de STAFFORD K.G. 1st Earl of Stafford (1301-1372) and Margaret AUDLEY Baroness Audley (1325-1348) 
2 CONT
2 CONT     b. ABT 1342, Tunbridge, Stafford, Eng.
2 CONT
2 CONT     d. 14 Apr 1415
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Sir Thomas de ROS 4th Lord Ros (1336-1384) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: [listed under entry for Thomas de ROS]
2 CONT
2 CONT References: [GENSERV],[FarisPA],[AR7]:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. [GENSERV]"Genealogical Server, www.genserv.com",
2 CONT
2 CONT          Cliff Manis.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. [FarisPA]"Plantagenet Ancestry of Seventeenth-Century Colonists",
2 CONT
2 CONT          David Faris, 
2 CONT
2 CONT          Genealogical Publishing Co., Inc., 1996.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. [AR7]    "Ancestral roots of certain American colonists who came
2 CONT
2 CONT          to America before 1700",
2 CONT
2 CONT          Frederick Lewis Weis, 1992, seventh edition.
2 CONT
2 CONT          The earlier editions were called: "Ancestral roots of
2 CONT
2 CONT          sixty colonists who came to New England 1623-1650"
2 CONT
2 CONT Beatrice de Stafford1
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #176188, d. 14 April 1415
2 CONT
2 CONT Beatrice de Stafford|d. 14 Apr 1415|p17619.htm#i176188|Ralph de Stafford, 1st Earl of Stafford|b. 24 Sep 1301\nd. 31 Aug 1372|p812.htm#i8120|Margaret Audley, Baroness Audley|d. bt 1347 - 1351|p987.htm#i9864|Edmund de Stafford|d. 1
2 CONC 308|p17619.htm#i176187|Margaret Basset||p11699.htm#i116983|Hugh Audley, 1st and last Earl of Gloucester|b. c 1289\nd. 10 Nov 1347|p2753.htm#i27521|Margaret de Clare|b. 1293\nd. Apr 1342|p10485.htm#i104850|
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=13 Jun 2009
2 CONT
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=0.03%
2 CONT
2 CONT      Beatrice de Stafford was the daughter of Ralph de Stafford, 1st Earl of Stafford and Margaret Audley, Baroness Audley.2,1 She married, firstly, Maurice FitzMaurice, 2nd Earl of Desmond.3 She married, secondly, Thomas de Ros, 
2 CONC 4th Lord de Ros of Helmsley, son of William de Ros, 2nd Lord de Ros of Helmsley and Margery de Badlesmere, circa 1 January 1359.3 She married, thirdly, Sir Richard Burley after 1384.3 She died on 14 April 1415.3
2 CONT
2 CONT      From after 1384, her married name became Burley.3
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Beatrice de Stafford and Thomas de Ros, 4th Lord de Ros of Helmsley
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Elizabeth de Ros+ d. Mar 14241
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Margaret de Ros+ 2
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Thomas de Ros 3
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Robert de Ros 3
2 CONT
2 CONT     * John de Ros, 5th Baron de Ros of Helmsley b. c 1368, d. 6 Aug 13933
2 CONT
2 CONT     * William de Ros, 6th Lord de Ros of Helmsley+ b. c 1369, d. 1 Sep 14144
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT
2 CONT    1. [S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Ex
2 CONC tinct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume III, page 292. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT
2 CONT    2. [S1545] Mitchell Adams, "re: West Ancestors," e-mail message from <e-mail address> (Australia) to Darryl Roger Lundy, 6 December 2005 - 19 June 2009. Hereinafter cited as "re: West Ancestors".
2 CONT
