2 CONT      Catherine de Stafford was the daughter of Ralph de Stafford, 1st Earl of Stafford and Margaret Audley, Baroness Audley.1 She married Sir John de Sutton, son of John de Sutton and Isabella de Cherleton, on 25 December 1357.1 S
2 CONC he died after 6 December 1361.1
