2 CONT Last Edited=10 Jun 2017  Warin l'Arcedekne, 3rd Baron Arcedekne was the son of John l'Arcedekne, 2nd Baron Arcedekne  and Cecily Haccombe .1 He married Elizabeth Talbot , daughter of Sir John Talbot  and Catherine (?) .1 He died f
2 CONC rom 1400 to 7 August 1407.1 His will was proven (by probate) on 7 August 1407.1 He succeeded as the 3rd Baron l'Arcedekne [E., 1321] in 1377. His last will was dated 12 December 1406.  Children of Warin l'Arcedekne, 3rd Baron Arce
