2 CONT Personal data Sir John Tiptoft 
2 CONT
2 CONT     He was born about 1370 in Great Eversden, Caxton, Cambridgeshire, England, UK.
2 CONT     Profession: 1st Baron Tiptoft, Knight of the Shire, Speaker of the House of Commons.
2 CONT     He died about 1443 in Enfield, Edmonton, Middlesex, England, UK.
2 CONT     He is buried February 1443 in Enfield, Greater London, Middlesex, England, UK.
2 CONT     A child of Pain Tiptoft and Agnes Wrothe
2 CONT
