2 CONT *Mother: Anne De FERRERS (B. Grey of Wilton)
2 CONT *'''Married: Ralph BASSETT (B. Bassett) 
2 CONT *Children: 
2 CONT **1. Margaret BASSETT
2 CONT *From: http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/GREY2.htm#Joan De GREY (B. Bassett) _________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Lady Joan married Sir Ralph De Bassett, Baron Bassett of Drayton on March 27, 1304.
