2 CONT Baron De Grey
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Reynold Grey, 3rd Lord Grey (of Ruthin) was also known as Edward Grey.
2 CONT
2 CONT He succeeded to the title of 3rd Lord Grey, of Ruthin [E., 1325] in 1389.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1421 he won a judgement in the Court of Chivalry to the right to wear the arms of the feudal Lord Abergavenny (against Sir Edward Hastings, de jure 8th Lord Hastings).
2 CONT --------------------
