2 CONT *''''''Constantine de Clifton, 2nd Lord Clifton1
2 CONT *''''''M, #228514, b. circa 1372, d. 1395
2 CONT *Last Edited=15 Apr 2007
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.0%
2 CONT *''''''     Constantine de Clifton, 2nd Lord Clifton was born circa 1372.1 He married Margaret Howard, daughter of Sir John Howard and Margaret Plaiz, after February 1389/90.1 He died in 1395.1
2 CONT *''''''     He was the son of John de Clifton, 1st Lord Clifton and Elizabeth de Cromwell.1 He succeeded to the title of 2nd Lord Clifton [E., 1376] on 10 August 1388.1 In 1393 he had livery of his lands.1
2 CONT *''''''Children of Constantine de Clifton, 2nd Lord Clifton and Margaret Howard
2 CONT **1.Elizabeth Clifton1
2 CONT **2.Sir John Clifton+1 b. c 1394, d. b 1 Dec 1447
2 CONT *Citations
