2 CONT *Mother Margaret Howard2,3,7,6 d. 25 Mar 1434 
2 CONT *''''''     Elizabeth Clifton was born circa 1392 at of Old Buckenham, Norfolk, England.2 She married Sir John Knyvett, Sheriff of Northamptonshire, son of Sir John Knyvet, Sheriff of Norfolk, Suffolk, Cambridgeshire, & Huntingdon
2 CONC shire and Joan Botetourt, before 1412; They had 10 children (including 2 sons (John, Esq; & Erasmus) and 3 daughters (Margaret, wife of Richard Chamberlain, Esq. & of William Gedney, Esq; & Joan, wife of Robert Toppes, & of Richar
2 CONC d Roos, Esq.).2,3,4,5,6 Elizabeth Clifton died before 8 December 1461.2,6
2 CONT *''''''Family Sir John Knyvett, Sheriff of Northamptonshire b. c 1394, d. 9 Nov 1445 
2 CONT *Children 
