1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *''''''Sir John Clifton1
2 CONT *''''''M, #228540, b. circa 1394, d. before 1 December 1447
2 CONT *Last Edited=15 Apr 2007
2 CONT *''''''     Sir John Clifton was born circa 1394.1 He married Joan Thorpe, daughter of Edmund Thorpe, before 6 January 1431/32.1 He died before 1 December 1447, without any surviving issue.1
2 CONT *''''''     He was the son of Constantine de Clifton, 2nd Lord Clifton and Margaret Howard.1 He succeeded to the title of 3rd Lord Clifton [E., 1376] in 1395, although he never claimed this barony.1
2 CONT *''''''Child of Sir John Clifton and Joan Thorpe
2 CONT **1.Margaret Clifton1 d. b 1447
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *1.[S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Extin
2 CONC ct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume III, page 308. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT *http://thepeerage.com/p22854.htm#i228540
2 CONT *_________
2 CONT *''''''Sir John Clifton, 3rd Lord Clifton1
2 CONT *''''''M, b. 1394, d. before 1 December 1447
2 CONT *Father Sir Constantine Clifton, 2nd Baron Clifton b. c 1372, d. 19 Feb 1396 
2 CONT *Mother Margaret Howard1 d. 25 Mar 1434 
2 CONT *''''''     Sir John Clifton, 3rd Lord Clifton was born in 1394 at of Buckenham Castle, Norfolk, England; Age 1 in 1395.1 He and Elizabeth obtained a marriage license before 6 January 1432; Papal indult.1 Sir John Clifton, 3rd Lor
2 CONC d Clifton died before 1 December 1447; d.s.p.s; buried at Wymondham, Norfolk.1
2 CONT *''''''Family Elizabeth d. a 1 Dec 1447 
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *1.[S11568] The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain, and the United Kingdom, by George Edward Cokayne, Vol. III, p. 308.
2 CONT *http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p1594.htm#i47928
2 CONT *_________
