1 TITL Lady
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://thepeerage.com/p66091.htm#i660903
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Robert de Scales, 3rd Baron Scales'''
2 CONT
2 CONT From [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_Scales%2C_3rd_Baron_Scales Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia]
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert married Catherine[1], sister, and co-heir of, William d'Ufford, 2nd Earl of Suffolk. They had the following children:-
2 CONT
2 CONT Peter de Scales, married Johanna[4] held Wetherden in Suffolk in 1330[4] and 1346[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert de Scales, went on Kings Service overseas in 1337 with Robert d'Ufford, 1st Earl of Suffolk[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Lord Roger de Scales, 4th Baron Scales (1354-1387)
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret de Scales, married Sir Robert Howard (-1388) son of Sir John Howard and had one son Sir John Howard[5]
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth de Scales, married Sir Roger Felbrigg and was buried at St Margaret, Felbrigg[5]
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert HOWARD (Sir)
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: Margery SCALES (dau. of Robert De Scales, 3° B. Scales and Catherine De Ufford)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. John HOWARD (Sheriff of Essex)
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Elder daughter of Sir Robert de Scales and Katherine de Ufford. Granddaughter of Sir Robert de Scales and Egeline de Courtenay, Robert de Ufford, Earl of Suffolk, and Margaret de Norwich.
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret was the wife of Sir Robert Howard, the son and heir to Sir John Howard of the same, and Alice de Bois, daughter of Sir Robert. They had one son and one daughter: Sir John and Margaret, wife of Constantine de Clifton.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Robert died in 1388, and Margaret married Sir Walter de Bermingham of Ireland who died before 10 Feb 1401. Margaret left a will dated 08 May 1416, and was buried with her first husband in the south side of the chancel at East 
2 CONC Winch, Norfolk.
2 CONT
2 CONT Buried at the Austin Friars, Norwich, per An Essay Towards a Topographical History of the County of Norfolk by Francis Blomefield and Charles Parkin.www.findagrave.com
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret de Scales Howard BIRTH	1339 Hertfordshire, England DEATH	8 May 1416 (aged 76–77) East Winch, Kings Lynn and West Norfolk Borough, Norfolk, England BURIAL	 Austin Friars Church Cemetery Norwich, City of Norwich, Norfolk, E
2 CONC ngland  MEMORIAL ID	65632145
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Members Parents Robert de Scales 1315–1369
2 CONT
2 CONT Catherine d'Ufford de Scales 1318 – unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse 	
2 CONT Robert Howard 1336–1389
2 CONT
2 CONT Children 	
2 CONT John Howard 1357–1436
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Howard Clifton 1376–1434 
