1 OCCU Sheriff of Hertfordshire & Essex, Knight of Fersfield and East Winch, Norfolk, Lord of Wiggenhall, Sheriff of Essex, Knight of the Shire
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Sir John Howard, Sheriff of Essex, Hertfordshire, Cambridgeshire, & Huntingdonshire1,2,3,4,5,6
2 CONT *'''M, #12722, b. circa 1365, d. 17 November 1436
2 CONT *Father      Sir Robert Howard7,8,9 b. c 1342, d. 18 Jul 1388
2 CONT *Mother     Margaret Scales7,8,9
2 CONT *'''     Sir John Howard, Sheriff of Essex, Hertfordshire, Cambridgeshire, & Huntingdonshire was born circa 1365 at of Wiggenhall, East Winch, Fersfield, & Terrington, Norfolk, England; Age 23 in 1388.3,4,6 He married Margaret de 
2 CONC Playz, daughter of Sir John de Playz, 5th Lord Playz and Joan Stapleton, circa 22 June 1378; They had 1 son (Sir John, 7th Lord Plaiz).3,10,4,6 Sir John Howard, Sheriff of Essex, Hertfordshire, Cambridgeshire, & Huntingdonshire ma
2 CONC rried Alice Tendring, daughter of Sir William de Tendring and Katherine Mylde, before June 1397; They had 2 sons (Sir Robert; & Henry, Esq.).3,4,5,6 Sir John Howard, Sheriff of Essex, Hertfordshire, Cambridgeshire, & Huntingdonshi
2 CONC re left a will on 1 April 1435.4,6 He died on 17 November 1436 at Jerusalem, Israel; Buried beside his 2nd wife (Alice) at Stoke by Nayland, Suffolk.3,4,6 His estate was probated in 1437.4,6
2 CONT *'''Family 1      Margaret de Playz b. c 1367, d. bt 7 Aug 1391 - 14 Aug 1391
2 CONT *Child
2 CONT **Sir John Howard, 7th Lord Plaiz+7,4,6 b. c 1385
2 CONT *'''Family 2      Alice Tendring b. c 1385, d. 18 Oct 1426
