1 NOTE {geni:about_me} (Walter was the father of) the younger Ralph Parles must have died within a few years of his grandfather, leaving a brother William as his heir, who himself died in 1430, while still under age. Not until 1440 was t
2 CONC he surviving son of that generation, John Parles, born in 1419, able to recover the estate from a lengthy wardship. (fn. 27) (1)
2 CONT
