2 CONT * ''[http://www.elizabethnoyes.co.uk/fh/watford.htm History of Northamptonshire]'' by Whellan published in 1874.  <link invalid>
2 CONT * https://www.historyofparliamentonline.org/volume/1386-1421/member/PARLESWXXXX (not yet created as of March 2026)
2 CONT
