2 CONT 2.	William de HARDRESHULL , of Hartshill & Saleby (John de HARDRESHULL , of Hartshill & Saleby6, William de HARDRESHULL , of Hartshill & Saleby5, Robert de HARDRESHULL , of Hartshill & Saleby4, William de HARDRESHULL , of Hartshil
2 CONC l & Saleby3, Robert de HARDRESHULL , of Hartshill2, Hugh de HARDRESHULL , of Hartshill & Ansley1) was born 1269 in Scotton, Gainsborough, Lincolnshire, England (dsp), and died BEF 10 NOV 1303 in Hartshill, Atherstone, Warwickshire
2 CONC , England. He married Juliana 2nd Baroness de HACHE , of West Hatch in 1st husband, daughter of Eustace 1st Baron de HACHE , of West Hatch, Sir and Amice (Avice) LEW , heir of Moreton Morrell. She was born ABT 1272 in Chesterton, 
2 CONC Southam, Warwickshire, England, and died BEF 4 JUL 1322 in North Kelsey, Caistor, Lincolnshire, England.
2 CONT  	  Child of William de HARDRESHULL , of Hartshill & Saleby and Juliana 2nd Baroness de HACHE , of West Hatch is: +	3	  i.	John 3rd Baron Hache de HARDRESHULL , Sir was born 24 AUG 1291 in Hartshill, Atherstone, Warwickshire, Engl
2 CONC and, and died BEF 18 JUN 1368 in Ashton, Northamptonshire, England.
