2 CONT
2 CONT   M Henry Harry STRADLING (AFN:9F97-QV)  Pedigree   
2 CONT
2 CONT     Born:  Abt 1430   Place:  Of St. Donat's, Ogmore, Glamorganshire, Wales   
2 CONT
