2 CONT Sir John Crophill was born circa 1322.2 He married, firstly, Margery de Verdun, daughter of Sir Theobald de Verdun, 2nd Lord Verdun and Maud de Mortimer, before 10 September 1355.1 He died on 3 July 1383 at Bosworth, Leicestershir
2 CONC e, England.1,3
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir John Crophill lived at Bonnington, Nottinghamshire, England.1
