2 CONT Sir Walter Devereux, Sheriff of Herefordshire, Constable of Builth Castle1,2,3,4,5,6 M, #21886, b. circa 1359, d. 20 June 1401 Father	Sir William Devereux, Seneschal of Limousin2,3 b. c 1330, d. 1376 Mother	Anne Barre b. c 1330, d
