1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *''''''Walter Devereux, Esq.1,2,3
2 CONT *''''''M, #23240, b. circa 1387, d. 1420
2 CONT *Father      Sir Walter Devereux, Sheriff of Herefordshire, Constable of Builth Castle2,4 b. c 1359, d. 20 Jun 1401
2 CONT *Mother      Agnes Crophull2,4 b. c 1372, d. 3 Feb 1436
2 CONT *''''''     Walter Devereux, Esq. was born circa 1387 at of Weobley & Bodenham, Herefordshire, England.2 He married Elizabeth Bromwich, daughter of Sir Thomas Bromwich and Alice Oldcastle, circa 1410 at of Weobley & Bodenham, Here
2 CONC fordshire, England; They had 1 son, Sir Walter.3 Walter Devereux, Esq. died in 1420 at of Newbold Verdon, Leicestershire, England.2,3
2 CONT *''''''Family       Eliabeth Bromwich b. c 1391
2 CONT *Children
2 CONT **Sir Walter Devereux, Sheriff of Herefordshire & Gloucestershire, Constable of Wigmore, Keeper of Leominster+5,3 b. c 1412, d. 22 Apr 1459
2 CONT **Cicily Devereux+ b. c 1415, d. c 1434
2 CONT *Citations
