1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ---------- regarding  1 inconsistency found for Mary Pigot (Blount) (1421 - d.)  '''Too old parent''' (1) Mary Pigot (Blount) had 1 child between the ages of 64 and 104 years old. Tip: Correct the birth date of Mar
2 CONC y Pigot (Blount) (born circa 1421) or the following child: Thomas Pigot
2 CONT
2 CONT ALSO  1 inconsistency found for Thomas Pigot (1525 - 1584) '''Too young parent''' (1) Thomas Pigot had 1 child between the ages of 0 and 15 years old. Tip: Correct the birth date of Thomas Pigot (born circa 1525) or the following 
2 CONC child: Elizabeth Vernon 
2 CONT
2 CONT There are MANY generations of "Thomas Pigott"  also spelled Pigot, Piggott, Piggot. I don't have an answer yet, only that it's highly unlikely that This Mary, had a son when she was 64 years old.  ALSO highly unlikely that Thomas 
2 CONC had a daughter when he was 2 years old. ----------
