2 CONT *'''     Sir John St John, Sheriff of Glamorganshire, Mayor of Bordeaux was born at of Faumont, Glamorganshire, Wales. He married Isabel de Paveley, daughter of Sir John de Paveley, Sheriff of Northampton and Joan.3,5
