2 CONT *F, #16424
2 CONT *Father      Sir John de Paveley, Sheriff of Northampton2,3 b. 1331, d.1393
2 CONT *Mother     Joan Stury d. 1414
2 CONT *'''     Isabel de Paveley married Sir John St John, Sheriff of Glamorganshire, Mayor of Bordeaux, son of Sir John St John and Elizabeth de la Bere.2,3 Isabel de Paveley was born at Paulersbury, Northamptonshire, England.
2 CONT *'''Family      Sir John St John, Sheriff of Glamorganshire, Mayor of Bordeaux 
2 CONT *Children
2 CONT **Sir Oliver St John+
