2 CONT * 2.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. III, p. 475.
2 CONT * 3.[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. IV, p. 526-527.
2 CONT * 4.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 100.
