2 CONT John Wake, 1st Baron Wake of Liddell1 
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #102543, d. circa 10 March 1300
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=4 Jun 2008
2 CONT
2 CONT      John Wake, 1st Baron Wake of Liddell was the son of Baldwin Wake, Lord of Bourne and Hawise de Quincy. He married Joan de Fenes, daughter of William de Fiennes, Baron of Tingry and Blanche de Brienne, Dame de La Loupelande, b
2 CONC efore 24 August 1291. He died circa 10 March 1300.
2 CONT
2 CONT      John Wake, 1st Baron Wake of Liddell gained the title of 1st Baron Wake of Liddell.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of John Wake, 1st Baron Wake of Liddell and Joan de Fenes
2 CONT
