2 CONC n pp. 60–61 Hanska "Hanging of William Cragh" Journal of Medieval History Bartlett Hanged Man pp. 1–11 Bartlett Hanged Man pp. 86, 152 Prestwich Edward I pp. 538–539 Quoted in Phillips Edward II p. 105 footnote 105 Prestwich Plant
2 CONC agenet England pp. 197–198 Phillips Edward II p. 366 Phillips Edward II p. 446 Prestwich Plantagenet England p. 426 Cokayne Complete Peerage Volume XIV p. 111 Bartlett Hanged Man pp. 138–141 Public Record Office Calendar of Inquis
2 CONC itions Post Mortem Vol. 6 p. 435
2 CONT
