2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Father	Sir William de Brewes, 1st Lord Brewes, Lord Buckingham[2] b. c 1224, d. 6 Jan 1291
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother	Mary de Roos[3] b. c 1250, d. c 23 May 1326
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Peter de Brewes was born circa 1273 at of Tetbury, Gloucestershire, England; Age 23 in 1296.[4]
2 CONT
2 CONT He and Agnes de Clifford obtained a marriage license on 6 June 1300; They had 3 sons (Sir Thomas, Lord Brewes; Sir John; & Sir Peter) and 2 daughters (Margaret, wife of Sir Henry, 2nd Lord Tyeys, & of Sir Thomas, 2nd Lord Montherm
2 CONC er; & Mary, wife of Sir Ralph de Cobham, & of Sir Thomas 'of Brotherton' Plantagenet, Earl of Norfolk, Marshal of England).[5]
2 CONT
2 CONT     Sir Peter de Brewes died circa 7 February 1312. 
