2 CONT Alice LE RUS Heiress of Stinton & Ludborough 
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: 25 Dec 1245, Stinton in Sall, Aylsham, Norfolk, England 9516 Married (1): 1st husband  Married (2): Before 9 Sep 1265  Died: Before 28 Jan 1300-1301, Ludborough, Louth, Lincolnshire, England 9515,9516
2 CONT
2 CONT    General Notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT Alice le Rus, widow of Richard Longespee, died shortly before 28 Jan 1300/1, daughter and heir of William le Rus of Stinton, Norfolk by Agatha (dsp shortly before 27 Dec 1261), daughter and heir of Roger de Clere of Brumlegh, Surr
2 CONC ey and Ludborough, Lincoln. [Magna Charta Sureties]
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: I am not sure how to read the above. MCS cannot mean that Agatha "dsp" because in the same statement she is said to have a daughter (Alice) by her husband William le Rus.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT He [Richard de Breuse] married, before 9 September 1265 Alice, widow of Richard LUNGESPEYE (who died s.p. shortly before 27 Dec. 1261, and daughter and heir of William LE Rus, of Stinton, Norfolk, Akenham and Whittingham, Suffolk,
2 CONC  by Agatha. daughter and heir of Roger DE CLERE, of Bramley, Surrey, and Ludborough, co. Lincoln. She was born 25 December 1245 or 1247, or 1 January 1245/6. He died before 18 June 1292. His widow died shortly before 28 January 13
2 CONC 00/1. They were buried in Woodbridge Priory. [Complete Peerage II:304, (transcribed by Dave Utzinger)] 9110
2 CONT
2 CONT    Marriage Information:
2 CONT
2 CONT Alice married Richard DE LONGESPÉE, son of Sir William II DE LONGESPÉE 2nd Earl of Salisbury and Idoine DE CAMVILLE, in 1st husband 9110,9515. (Richard DE LONGESPÉE was born in 1236 in Salisbury, Wiltshire, England and died before
2 CONC  1265 9515.)
2 CONT
2 CONT     Marriage Information:
2 CONT
2 CONT Alice also married Sir Richard DE BRAOSE of Stinton, son of John DE BRAOSE Lord of Bramber & Gower and Margaret FERCH LLYWELYN, before 9 Sep 1265 9110,9442,9515,9516. (Sir Richard DE BRAOSE of Stinton was born before 1232 in Bramb
2 CONC er, Sussex, England 9515,9516 and died before 18 Jun 1292 in Stinton in Sall, Aylsham, Norfolk, England
