2 CONC las de Audeleye and Katherine, his wife''', and the heirs begotten by Nicholas on the body of Katherine, to hold of the chief lords for ever. In default of such heirs, remainder to the right heirs of John.<br>
2 CONT Source: [http://www.medievalgenealogy.org.uk/fines/abstracts/CP_25_1_81_20.shtml#99 Abstracts of Feet of Fines]
