1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==brief biography==
2 CONT styled as Lady Audley on 15 May 15, 1321
2 CONT
2 CONT Baroness Mortimer Consort of Wigmore
2 CONT
2 CONT ==notes==
2 CONT Place of birth might be Wigmore, Herefordshire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==comments==
2 CONT Date and place of birth have also been (erroneously?) reported to be between circa 1262 and circa 1270 (including specifically 1262) at Wigmore, Herefordshire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Date and place of death have also been erroneously reported to be:
2 CONT
2 CONT * July of an unspecified year at Wigmore, Herefordshire, England
2 CONT * February 7, 1334 at Wigmore, Herefordshire, England
2 CONT
