2 CONC ections/49324/images/FLHG_RoyalDescentsof600Immigrants-0489?ranMID=50138&ranEAID=4026539&ranSiteID=Xib7NfnK11s-OX.rA2C0xPEjs.87ueVoQw&o_xid=4026539&o_lid=4026539&o_sch=Affiliate+External&pId=93946 Ancestry.com] >; ([https://www.ge
2 CONC ni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000212566386836 document attached.]) "Descent from https://www.geni.com/people/Alfonso-IX-king-of-Leon-and-Galicia/6000000008477543238 & https://www.geni.com/people/Berenguela-I-la-Grande-reina-de-
2 CONC Castilla/6000000001412951572?through=6000000008477543238." 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Margaret de Fiennes, Baroness Mortimer of Wigmore is a direct descendant of Charlemagne.
2 CONT This is her Capetian lineage:
2 CONT '''
2 CONT # Hugues Capet, roi des Francs [First Capet] [A direct descendant of Charlemagne, via both parents]
2 CONT # Robert II Capet, "the Pious" king of the Franks
2 CONT # Robert I le Vieux, duc de Bourgogne
2 CONT # Constance de Bourgogne, Queen consort of Castile and Leon
2 CONT # Urraca I, reina de Castilla y León
2 CONT # Alfonso VII the Emperor, King of Castile and Leon
2 CONT # Fernando II, rey de León 
2 CONT # Alfonso IX, king of Leon and Galicia
2 CONT # Berenguela de León, emperatriz consorte de Constantinopla
2 CONT # Jean (John) de Brienne
2 CONT # Blanche de Brienne, Baroness Tingry
2 CONT # Margaret de Fiennes, Baroness Mortimer of Wigmore
