2 CONT 31. -- SIR ROGER DE MORTIMER, b. 25 Apr 1287, d. 29 Nov. 1330, 8th Baron Mortimer of Wigmore; cr. Earl of March, Oct. 1328; m. bef. 6 Oct. 1306, JOAN DE GENEVILLE (71-32), b. 2 Feb. 1285/6, d. 19 Oct. 1356. (CP VIII 433-442; IX 28
2 CONC 4; Banks I 200-221; Turton 72).
2 CONT
