1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Margaret_Mortimer,_Baroness_Mortimer
2 CONT
2 CONT In September 1285, when she was fourteen or fifteen years old, Margaret Fienned married Edmund Mortimer of Wigmore, 2nd Baron Mortimer, the son of Roger Mortimer, 1st Baron Mortimer and Maud de Braose. They had eight children. ...
