2 CONT *'''Reverend Hugh Mortimer1
2 CONT *M, #405458
2 CONT *Last Edited=28 Feb 2010
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.0%
2 CONT *'''     Reverend Hugh Mortimer is the son''' of Sir Edmund de Mortimer, 1st Lord Mortimer and Margaret de Fiennes.1
2 CONT *'''     He was the Rector at Old Radnor.1
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *[S1916] Tim Boyle, "re: Boyle Family," e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lundy, 16 September 2006. Hereinafter cited as "re: Boyle Family."
