2 CONC gh=6000000004533877074 FERQUHARD MacTaggart] Earl of Ross & his wife ---.  The Chronicon Manniæ et Insularum records that Olav of Man married thirdly “Scristinam filiam Ferkar comitis de Ros”[1339].''' 
