2 CONC ddansdóttir var frilla Hákonar jarls ; ...en Ingibjörg dóttir þeirra, er átti Ólafr bitlíngr Suðreyja -konúngr)"p82 of https://books.googleusercontent.com/books/content?req=AKW5QaesUBUIDn6aM6BU68Jm8BMt8wDBVdsKe-YN-ri8LARgzUozVkSgh
