2 CONT The Chronicon Manniæ et Insularum records that Olavus filius '''Godredi Crovan'''” had many concubines by whom he fathered “filios tres…Reignaldum, Lagmannum et Haraldum et filias multas”, ["three sons: Reignaldum, Lagmannum & Har
2 CONC aldum and many daughters..[translation Sharon D July 2021]]   adding that one daughter married “Sumerledo regulo Herergaildel”[1031].  Balfour Paul names her "Ragnhildis" but he does not cite the corresponding primary source[1032]
2 CONC . http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SCOTTISH%20NOBILITY.htm#ReginaldsonSomerledB
