2 CONT Gudrod Crovan - died at Islay in 1095. He participated in the battle of Stanford bridge in 1066. When he came home from the battle, he made several attempts to win the throne of the Isle of Man, and finally succeeded. Gudrod becam
2 CONC e a great King at Man and acknowledged King Magnus Barefoot as his overlord.
