1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elizabeth or Joan is an illegitimate daughter of Henry Beauclerc, but her mother is uncertain. It is probable that a daughter of Henry married Fergus. Whether Elizabeth was really married to Fergus of Galloway, or 
2 CONC whether his children had a different mother is uncertain. 
