2 CONT Personal data Bethoc MacFergus Source 1
2 CONT She was born in the year 1124 in Bedrule, Roxburghshire, Scotland.
2 CONT She died in the year 1165 in Scotland, she was 41 years old.
2 CONT A child of Fergus Lord and Elizabeth England
