2 CONT From Darrell Wolcott:  "Ergo we have Annes (1315) ferch Cadwgan (1285) ap Ieuan (1255) ap Philip (1225) ap Trahaearn (1195) ap Hoedliw (1160) ap Rhiwallon (1130) ap Caradog (1095) ap Madog Eidio Wyllt (1065).  The mother of the la
2 CONC tter man was Nest (1045) ferch Tewdwr (1015), a sister of King Rhys ap Tewdwr of Deheubarth.   Her pedigree back to Trahaearen is cited in Peniarth 131, 220 & 296, and extended back to Madog in Peniarth 131, 308, Peniarth 132, 306
2 CONC  and Peniarth 133, 52" (Steven Ferry, September 9, 2019.)
