1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Emma FITZ ORM was born in 1150 in Derleveston, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Adam De ALDITHLEY. Adam De ALDITHLEY and Emma FITZ ORM were married in 1170. 2 _PREF Y 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children were: 
2 CONT
