2 CONT www.thepeerage.com
2 CONT
2 CONT Emma fitz Orm
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=29 Apr 2009 
2 CONT Emma fitz Orm is the daughter of Ralf fitz Orm. 
2 CONT Children of Emma fitz Orm and Adam of Aldithley
2 CONT 	Adam of Aldithley  b. b 1175, d. b 1212 
2 CONT 	Henry of Aldithley  b. c 1175, d. 1246
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Extinct or Do
2 CONC rmant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume I, page 337. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT
2 CONT www.celtic-casimir.com
2 CONT
2 CONT Emma FITZ ORM 
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: 1153, Darlaston, Walsall, Staffordshire, England 
2 CONT Married: 1173, Heleigh, Stafford, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Ancestral File Number: GLCB-J0. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Information:
2 CONT Emma married Adam DE ALDITHLEY, son of Liulf DE ALDITHLEY Sheriff of Chester and Unknown, in 1173 in Heleigh, Stafford, England. (Adam DE ALDITHLEY was born in 1149 in Heleigh, Stafford, England, died in 1203 in Heleigh, Stafford,
2 CONC  England and was buried in 1203 in Heleigh, Stafford, England.)
