2 CONT https://books.google.com/books?id=VwMcAQAAMAAJ&pg=PA324&lpg=PA324&dq=arderne+and+stanley+of+elford&source=bl&ots=2r-qgfE-ey&sig=dt3BDC98sQkPzwzo7_QftK1o16I&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwiCo4qLyLTUAhXI8YMKHWlKALk4ChDoAQghMAA#v=onepage&q=ar
2 CONC derne%20stanley%20of%20elford&f=false
2 CONT
2 CONT *''''''Sir Thomas de Arderne1
2 CONT *''''''M, d. circa 1 July 1391
2 CONT *Father Sir John de Arderne2 d. 1349 
2 CONT *Mother Elena de Wasteneys2 d. bt 13 Jul 1349 - 23 Dec 1349 
2 CONT *''''''     Sir Thomas de Arderne was born at of Aldford, Alderley, & Etchells, Cheshire, England; He was illegitimate, but his father eventually married his mother.2 A settlement for the marriage Sir Thomas de Arderne and Katheri
2 CONC ne Stafford was made on 7 January 1346; They had one son, Sir John.2 Sir Thomas de Arderne died circa 1 July 1391.2
2 CONT *''''''Family Katherine Stafford  
2 CONT **Children 
2 CONT **Catherine Arderne+
2 CONT **Blanche Arderne+3
2 CONT **Sir John Arderne+2 b. 12 Mar 1369, d. 2 Jul 1408
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *1.[S5977] Unknown author, Wallop Family, p. 719; Lineage and Ancestry of HRH Prince Charles by Gerald Paget, Vol. II, p. 434.
2 CONT *2.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. I, p. 23.
2 CONT *3.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 290-291.
2 CONT *http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p644.htm#i19345
2 CONT *_________________
