2 CONT *****a.	Sir John Wettenhall of Wettenhall 	m. Maude Fulleshurst (dau of Robert Fulleshurst)
2 CONT ****** 	(1)	Mabella Wettenhall (dsp) 	m. Richard Grosvenor of Budworth
2 CONT ******	(2)	Catherine Wettenhall (dsp) 	m. Sir Adam Hartley
2 CONT ****** 	(3)	Ellena Wettenhall 	m. Henry Arderne of Dorfold
2 CONT ******	(4)	Margery Wettenhallyy 	m. Geoffrey de Bromhale
2 CONT ****** 	(5)	Margaret Wettenhall 	m. Sir Adam de Bostock
2 CONT ****** 	(6)	Elizabeth Wettenhall 	m. Sir Richard de Manley
2 CONT ****** 	(7)+	other issue (d young) - Richard, John
2 CONT ***** 	b.	Robert Wetenal or Wettenhall (a 1333, 1344) - continued just below 	m. Amicia de Alpraham (dau/coheir of Mathew de Alpraham)
