2 CONT Brief Life History of John
2 CONT When Sir John Wettenhall III was born on 1 June 1295, in Acton, Cheshire, England, his father, Baron John Wettenhall, I, was 31 and his mother, Margred ferch Gruffudd, was 28. He married Maude Fulleshurst in 1319, in Cheshire, Eng
2 CONC land. They were the parents of at least 2 sons. He died in 1348, in Wettenhall, Cheshire, England, at the age of 53.
