1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lucy de TREGOZ, daughter of Robert I de TREGOZ 1, 2, 3, 4 was born 1202 in Ewyas Harold, Herefordshire, England. She died 1294 in Knockin, Shropshire, England. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Lucy married Sir John III le STRANGE Knight on 1225 in Cheswardine, Shropshire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT * M	i	 John IV le STRANGE was born 1226 and died Feb 1276.
2 CONT * M	ii	 Robert le STRANGE was born 1230 and died Aug 1276.
2 CONT * M	iii	 Hamon le STRANGE 1 was born 1232 in Cheswardine, Shropshire, England. He died 1274 in , , Palestine.
2 CONT * F	iv	 Hawise le STRANGE was born 1234 and died 1310.
2 CONT * M	v	 Roger le STRANGE Lord Strange of Ellesmere was born 1236 and died 31 Jul 1311.
2 CONT * F	vi	 Alice le STRANGE was born 1238 in Cheswardine, Shropshire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------
2 CONT * https://archive.org/stream/lestrangerecords00lestuoft#page/153/mode/1up
2 CONT * http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~hwbradley/aqwg782.htm#12720
