1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Nicole d'Aubigny''', was the daughter of [[6000000006297376203]] and [[6000000004019957187]].
2 CONT
2 CONT She married '''Roger de Somery'''.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was granddaughter of William d'Aubigny, 2nd Earl of Arundel b 1150 d. 24 Dec 1193; Matilda de St. Hilary du Harcouet; Hugh of Kevelioc, 3rd Earl of Chester b. c 1147  d. 30 Jun 1181; Bertrada de Montfort b. c 1155 d. c 1227
2 CONT
2 CONT Her married name became de Somery. In 1221 she obtained as her 4th share of her father's inheritance, the manor of Barrow on Soar, Leicestershire.
2 CONT
