2 CONC  unknown they became the parents of Joan De Somery abt.1225 in England. When Nichole was age unknown and Roger De Somery was ageunknown they became the parents of Margaret (Margery) De Somery abt. 1229in Dudley, Worchestershire, E
2 CONC ngland.
