2 CONT ===Identity 
2 CONT
2 CONT Death date seen as 1283 without supporting evidence; in fact she must have died before 1277, when Isabel was John de Walton’s widow.  Elizabeth was not the same person as https://www.geni.com/people/Isabel/6000000086771720011.   W
2 CONC e know that because https://www.geni.com/people/Maud-de-Walton/6000000003243400123?through=6000000086771720011 was an ancestress of https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Owain_Glyndŵr and he is not known to have had a Shirley ancestress
2 CONC .
