2 CONT m ELEANOR Giffard, daughter of JOHN Giffard Lord Giffard of Brimsfield & his [first/second] wife Matilda de Clifford (-before 1324).  Inquisitions following a writ dated 12 Feb "1 Edw III", after the death of "John Giffard…of Brim
2 CONC mesfeld…", record that John "married Maud de Longespeye, of whom he begat…of his said wife…Eleanor la Estraunge, afterwards espoused to Fulk le Estraunge…"[943]. 
