2 CONT '''Roger Lestrange, 5th Lord Strange (of Knokyn)'''1 
2 CONT M, #47264, '''b. circa 1326, d. 23 August 1382'''
2 CONT Last Edited=8 Dec 2016
2 CONT '''     Roger Lestrange, 5th Lord Strange (of Knokyn) was born circa 1326.2 He was the son''' of Roger Lestrange, 4th Lord Strange (of Knockyn) and Maud (?)2 '''He married Lady Aline Fitzalan''', daughter of Edmund Fitzalan, 2nd/9
2 CONC th Earl of Arundel and Alice de Warenne, '''before 1338.2 He died on 23 August 1382.'''2
2 CONT '''     He lived at Knockin, Shropshire, EnglandG.3 Served Hundred Years War in France.2 He succeeded as the 5th Lord Strange, of Knokyn [E., 1299] on 29 July 1349.'''2
2 CONT '''Children of Roger Lestrange, 5th Lord Strange (of Knokyn)'''
2 CONT 1.Isabel LeStrange+4 d. a 1366
2 CONT 2.Alianore Lestrange+3
2 CONT '''Children of Roger Lestrange, 5th Lord Strange (of Knokyn) and Lady Aline Fitzalan'''
2 CONT 1.Lucy Lestrange+2
2 CONT 2.John Lestrange, 6th Lord Strange (of Knokyn)+2 b. c 1352, d. 20 Sep 1400
