1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Eleanor Goch verch Philip   
2 CONT
2 CONT Eleanor was born about 1320 in Cardigan, Wales.1   Eleanor's father was Lord of Cardigan Philip ap Cadivor and her mother was Catherine verch Llewelyn.  Her paternal grandparents were Lord of Cardigan Cadivor ap Iscoed and <Unknow
2 CONC n>; her maternal grandparents were Prince of Wales Llewelyn ap Gruffydd and Eleanor de Montfort. She had a sister named Margaret.  She was the older of the two children.
2 CONT
