1 NOTE {geni:about_me} See Peter Bartrum, https://cadair.aber.ac.uk/dspace/bitstream/handle/2160/6380/CROFT_343.png?sequence=1&isAllowed=y (April 3, 2018; Anne Brannen, curator)
