2 CONC ling Croft Castle in overall effect..." 
2 CONT *Fry, Plantagenet Somerset, The David & Charles Book of Castles, David & Charles, 1980. ISBN 0-7153-7976-3
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir John de Croft held the office of Captain of Merk Castle, near Calais. He lived at Croft Castle, Herefordshire, England. Between 1402 and 1404 he was frequently employed in negotiations in Flanders.
