2 NICK Baron of Edernion
1 SEX M
1 BAPM
2 PLAC Tribe
2 ADDR
3 CITY Bleddwyn ap  Cynfyn.
3 CTRY Wales
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1330
2 PLAC of, Yr Hendwr
2 ADDR
3 CITY Llandrillo-yn-Edeimion
3 CTRY Wales
