2 CONT Bartrum notes: "Ali ap Ieuan ab Adda (F94, S*59) Brawd oedd Ali i Heilin (S*59) but generally wrongly Ali ap Ieuaf ap Heilin (F54, H184c, etc)."  That is, though two manuscripts give Ali as the brother of Heilin, many others give 
2 CONC him as the grandson of Heilin.  As to the MSS -- F is Peniarth 129; H is Peniarth 128; S is Peniarth 139, Part 1.
