2 CONT Dwnn ii, 49 says that the mother of Moriddig Warwyn was Gladys Ddu ferch Rhys ap Tewdwr, but it adds the caveat that other's say the mother of Moriddig Warwyn was Nest ferch Iestyn ap Gwrgan. Darrell Wolcott writes: "The other wif
2 CONC e of Drymbenog was a daughter of Iestyn ap Gwrgan.  3 sources call her Gwenllian; 3 call her Arddun; 2 call her Nest (both in Dwnn's work); and 1 leaves her unnamed. Bartrum chose to call her Gwenllian." [Wolcott sorts this out in
2 CONC  Family of Drymbenog cited below] See Bartrum: Iestyn 1; https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000173392863866 (Steven Ferry, September 14, 2020.)
