2 CONC i.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000173392955938 [NOTE: Bartrum, in both Cydifor Fawr 20 and Bleddyn ap Maenyrch 28, had Madof Llwyd's wife woman as Margred ferch Ieuan ap Llywelyn Ddu ap Llywelyn. But, as Bartrum was having troubl
2 CONC e connecting this line to Cydifor Fawr, he crossed out the line in CF 20, and directed readers to Rhys ap Tewdwr 2, where he now charts her as ferch Ieuan ap Llewelyn Ddu ap Rhydderch Ddu. Darrell Wolcott maintains that the line i
2 CONC n CF 20 IS correct, except it does not go to Cydifor Fawr, but to Meurig ap Bleddyn ap Cydifor ap Gwgan ap Bleddyn ap Maenyrch.] (Steven Ferry, May 5, 2024.)
