2 CONC , Lord Whichnor was made on 12 February 1325; They had 3 sons (Sir Rhys; Thomas; & Sir Henry).8,2,3,4,5 Joan de Somerville died on 8 October 1376 at Stockton, Warwickshire, England.2,5 Family Sir Rhys ap Griffith, Sheriff of Carma
