2 CONC Rhun this Ifor should date at c.1300, and Bartrum has assigned him to the wrong https://www.geni.com/people/Llewelyn-ab-Ifor-Lord-of-St-Clear-manor/6000000006444566084?through=6000000002603760016] (Steven Ferry, June 3, 2025.)
