1 CONT      Owain Brogyntyn, lord of Penllyn and Edeirnion (1160 -- 11??)
1 CONT      Madog ap Gruffydd, prince of Northern Powys (1191 -- 1236)
1 CONT      Gwenwynwyn ab Owain Cyfeiliog, prince of Southern Powys (1197 -- Feb 1216)Principality of Powys
1 CONT
1 CONT After c.1200, northern Powys and southern Powys were known as Powys Fadog and Powys Wenwynwyn, respectively.
