1 CONT RESEARCH NOTES:Justiciar of England [Ref: Weis AR7 #148A] 1261: Justiciary of England [Ref: Watney WALLOP #61]
1 CONT  1245: one of the deputation of the Barons to the Council of Lyons [Ref: Watney WALLOP #61]
