1 CONT [edit] Historical fiction
1 CONT
1 CONT     * The stories of Llywelyn Fawr, Llywelyn ap Gryffydd and Davydd ap Gryffydd are depicted in Sharon Penman's Welsh Trilogy:
1 CONT
1 CONT "Here be Dragons", "Falls the Shadow", and "The Reckoning".
1 CONT
