1 CONT    2. ^ History of Cambria (1584).
1 CONT    3. ^ Calendar of Welsh Rolls, Calendar of Chancery Rolls, Various, London, 1912, page 240).
1 CONT    4. ^ CCR, 1272-79, 317; CPR, 1272-81, 279.
1 CONT    5. ^ Note: Much has been read into this latter statement regarding Llywelyn ap Dafydd's betrayal, but it has to be taken in context with the other events of 1283, the fact that Llywelyn's father and brother had been taken, and 
1 CONC the size of the army that had by now occupied Snowdonia.
1 CONT
