1 CONT Llywelyn ap Iorwerth, Prince of North Wales is the son of Iorwerth Drwyndwn (?) <p10260.htm>. He was born in 1173.1 He married, secondly, Joan (?) <p10493.htm>, daughter of John I 'Lackland', King of England <p10201.htm> and Cleme
1 CONC ntina (?) <p10493.htm>, in 1205.2 He died in 1240.1  Llywelyn ap Iorwerth, Prince of North Wales also went by the nick-name of Llwelyn 'the Great'. He gained the title of Prince Llywelyn of North Wales.3 He hanged the Anglo-Norman
1 CONC  baron, William de la Braose, for having an affair with his wife.
