1 CONT PLAC Known as the most beautiful woman in Wales. She had many lovers.
1 CONT _FA2
1 CONT PLAC In Christmas 1108 Owain ap Cadwgan of Cardigan came to visit Gerald and Nesta.
1 CONT _FA3
1 CONT PLAC He so lusted after her that he, that night, attacked the castle.
1 CONT _FA4
1 CONT PLAC He then carried her off and had his way with her.
1 CONT _FA5
1 CONT PLAC This upset Henry I so much that the incident started a war.[BIGOD-Mel Morris,10Gen Anc.FTW]
