1 CONC dly, Thomas de Hastang), had issue, John, Ebulo, and Hamon. His lordship d.in 1310 and was s. by his eldest son, John le Strange, 2nd baron. [Sir Bernard Burke, Dormant, Abeyant, Forfeited, and Extinct Peerages, Burke's Peerage, L
1 CONC td., London, 1883, p. 515, Strange, Barons Strange ofKnokyn]
