1 CONT he waged several campaigns in order to consolidate and expand his continental possessions. Was so hated by his brothers that they vowed to disinherit him.  In 1106  he captured Robert and held him til he died. He proved to bea har
1 CONC d but just ruler.  He aparently died from over eating Lampreys!
