1 CONC ) son of Walter FitzOther, Constable of Windsor Castle and Keeper of the Forests of Berkshire. She had several other liaisons - including one with Stephen of Cardigan, Constable of Cardigan (1136) - and subsequently other illegiti
1 CONC mate children. The date of her death is unknown.
1 CONT Henry FitzRoy, 1103-1158.
1 CONT
1 CONT With Isabel de Beaumont
1 CONT Isabel (Elizabeth) de Beaumont (after 1102 - after 1172), daughter of Robert de Beaumont, sister of Robert de Beaumont, 2nd Earl of Leicester. She married Gilbert de Clare, 1st Earl of Pembroke, in 1130. She was also known as Isab
1 CONC ella de Meulan.
1 CONT Isabel Hedwig of England
