1 CONC am, surnamed FitzWolfric.
0 @N6000000004303384285@ NOTE Fulk, subsequent to a violent quarrel with King John of England, sought refuge in the woods and became an outlaw. Maud accompanied him. The legendary figures of Robin Hood and Maid Marian are said to be based on Fulk and Maud.
