1 CONT OCCU Mabel ? ...
1 CONT SOUR gendex.com/users/daver/rigney/D0001 says 1134, England;
1 CONT www.public.asu.edu/bgertz/family says 1134, LEICESTER, LEICESTERSHIRE,ENGLAND;
