0 @N6000000000337394992@ NOTE Countess of Gloucester
1 CONT
1 CONT Source #1:  T. Anna Leese, "Blood Royal:  Issue of the Kings and Queens of Medieval England, 1066-1399:  The Normans and Plantagenets" (Heritage Books, Inc, 1996) - her sister, Hawise/Isabella FitzRobert was King John's first wife
1 CONC !
1 CONT
