0 @N6000000002116268342@ NOTE There is a certain leap of faith required to accept the Hugh Mortimer of Milton Keynes b. 1378 is the same as Hugh Mortimer d. 25 10 1415 at Agincourt.  This Hugh is probably but not certainly the son of Sir Thomas Mortimer of Att
1 CONC leborough and his 1st wife Sarah who m. abt. 1380.  In the IGI reference (and there are several conflicting references) he is shown to be b. 1380 and to be of Welden, Northamptonshire.  There is no clear explanation why he did not
1 CONC  inherit Attleborough if he were the eldest son.  
