0 @N6000000003949830048@ NOTE Chamberlain to Henry I and Henry II [Ref: Watney #662]
1 CONT     Lord of Porchester & Hanslope [Ref: Lorelei Gustafson message to Gen-Medieval 31 Jan 1999]
1 CONT Was chamberlain of the exchequer from 1153 by charter of Henry II. He was also the younger brother of Robert Mauduit who d.1120. [Ref: The Origins of the English Treasury by C Warren Hollister in English Historical Review XCIII (1
1 CONC 978), 265-266; English Baronies: A Study of their Origin and Descent by I J Sanders, Clarendon Press, Oxford, 1963 (1960) 50]
1 CONT dead by 1160 [Ref: Watney #662] bef Feb 1158 [Ref: Lorelei Gustafson message to Gen-Medieval 31 Jan 1999]
1 CONT
