0 @N6000000003615871748@ NOTE In 1326 Eleanor's husband, Hugh Despenser, was captured and executed by ba 
1 CONT rons opposed to the king. The following year Eleanor was kidnapped and rap
1 CONT ed bya knight called William la Zouche. The punishment for rape was dea
1 CONT th but as Zouche was one of Edward's most loyal knights, the king refus
1 CONT ed to take action against him. Eleanor was forced to accept William la Zou
1 CONT che as her husband.
