1 CONT    4. ^ Phillips (1972), p. 8.
1 CONT    5. ^ a b c d e f Phillips (2004).
1 CONT    6. ^ Phillips (1972), p. 9.
1 CONT    7. ^ Phillips (1972), pp. 240–2.
1 CONT    8. ^ Phillips (1972), p. 22.
1 CONT    9. ^ Phillips (1972), pp. 23–4.
1 CONT   10. ^ Phillips (1972), p. 24.
1 CONT   11. ^ Maddicott (1970), pp. 67–71.
1 CONT   12. ^ McKisack (1959), pp. 2–4
1 CONT   13. ^ McKisack (1959), pp. 12–7
