1 CONT   31. ^ Jennifer C. Ward, 'St Pol, Mary de, countess of Pembroke (c.1304–1377)', Oxford Dictionary of National Biography (Oxford, 2004).
1 CONT   32. ^ "Pembroke College, Cambridge". Pembroke College, Cambridge. Retrieved on 2008-08-22.
1 CONT   33. ^ P. Binski, Westminster Abbey and the Plantagenets: Kingship and the Representation of Power, 1200-1400 (New Haven 1995), pp. 118-9, 176-7; M. Prestwich, Plantagenet England 1225-1360 (Oxford, 2005), p. 565.
1 CONT
1 CONT [edit] Sources
