1 CONT John Baliol as king in 1292-1296, then there was an Interregnum of 10 years,
1 CONT a time where there wasn't a government of Scotland royalty. Then enters
1 CONT Robert Bruce in 1306 to set the stage for the rest of Scottish monarchies.
