0 @N6000000000551147113@ NOTE Reynold Grey, 3rd Lord Grey of Ruthin (M) b. before 1362, d. 1440, #32163 Last Edited=24 Oct 2003
1 CONT Reynold Grey, 3rd Lord Grey of Ruthin was born before 1362. He married, secondly, Joan of Astley, Baroness Astley <p3216.htm>, daughter of William of Astley, 4th Lord Astley <p3212.htm> and Joan Willoughby <p3214.htm>.1 He died in
1 CONC  1440.1  He gained the title of 3rd Lord Grey of Ruthin. He was also known as Edward Grey.1
1 CONT Child of Reynold Grey, 3rd Lord Grey of Ruthin and Joan of Astley, Baroness Astley <p3216.htm>:
1 CONT Sir Edward Grey, 1st Lord Ferrers of Groby+ b. b 1415, d. 18 Dec 1457
1 CONT Citations
1 CONT [S6 <s1.htm>] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant,
1 CONC  Extinct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume I, page 284. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
