1 CONC 916.htm#i109156|Helen (?)|d. a Feb 1294/95|p12728.htm#i127280|');"Pedigree <JavaScript:pup('Margorie Bruce, Princess of Scotland|b. c 1297<BR> Last Edited=10 May 2003
1 CONT Margorie Bruce, Princess of Scotland was the daughter of Robert I Bruce, King of Scotland <p10209.htm> and Isabella, Lady of Mar <p10209.htm>. She was born circa 1297.1 She married Walter Stewart, 6th High Steward of Scotland, son
1 CONC  of James Stewart, 5th High Steward of Scotland <p10531.htm> and Cecilia de Dunbar <p10792.htm>, in 1315. She died on 2 March 1316 at Paisley, Renfrewshire, Scotland, in childbirth.2 She was also reported to have died in childbirt
1 CONC h on 19 March 1316 at Paisley, Renfrewshire. She was buried at Paisley Abbey, Paisley, Renfrewshire, Scotland.2  She was also known as Princess Marjorie of Scotland.
1 CONT Child of Margorie Bruce, Princess of Scotland and Walter Stewart, 6th High Steward of Scotland:
1 CONT Robert II Stewart, King of Scotland+ b. 2 Mar 1316, d. 19 Apr 1390
1 CONT Citations
