1 CONT
1 CONT [...] John Philip Wood, Peerage of Scotland (Edinburgh, 1813), vol. 1,pp. 612-13: Fergus, Prince of Lord of Galloway, flourished in thereign of David I. He became a canon regular in the abbey ofHolyroodhouse. Left two sons, 1. Gil
1 CONC bert, ancestor of the Earls ofCarrick. 2. Uchtred.
