1 CONT He [James of Aldithley] m. in 1244, Ela, daughter of William Longespee (who d. 1250), son and heir of Ela, suo jure Countess of Salisbury, by Idoine, daughter and heir of Richard de Camville.  She brought him the manors of Stratto
